<node id="&quot;BLACK FRIDAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Black Friday follows Thanksgiving and marks the start of the month-long shopping season for the winter holidays, highlighting the commercial aspect of the holiday period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a commercial event where retailers offer significant discounts on products and services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a significant sales event in the United States during which many electronic products, including the MacBook Air and iPad, are offered at reduced prices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a significant shopping event known for deals, especially on technology, where deals on small accessories are highlighted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is an annual shopping event that precedes Cyber Monday, traditionally featuring discounts and promotions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a significant shopping event where deals and discounts are offered on various products, including Apple accessories and computing devices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is an annual sales event where various products and services offer significant discounts, including education and cybersecurity services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is highlighted as an annual consumer shopping event, with deals on tech products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is referenced as a contemporary event that mirrors historical traits of consumerism and class divisions, providing a backdrop for the movie's opening scenes and themes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is the event around which various promotions and sales are organized by different brands and organizations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday signifies a major annual discount event, during which various electronics, including smart speakers, home theater products, and other tech items, are offered at reduced prices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a major holiday sales event during which Newegg's price-match guarantee is not valid, influencing the timing of price-related consumer purchases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a major shopping event where retailers often offer price-matching policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a shopping holiday known for significant deals on various electronics, including headphones and earbuds, influencing consumer buying behavior and sales trends."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a significant sales event that leads to budget-friendly prices on various electronic products including earbuds and headphones."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a significant shopping holiday known for deals on products such as headphones and earbuds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a special event where some companies' price-matching policies might not apply."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is an event during which various products, including the mentioned earbuds and headphones, are offered at discounted prices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a significant shopping event known for deals on technology and electronics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a widespread shopping event, creating a sense of urgency and a time-sensitive opportunity for consumers to purchase technology deals and gadgets.&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is mentioned as a significant sales event where electronics like the Galaxy Buds2 may be available at a discounted price."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday refers to an annual shopping event where various products, including Kindle deals, are often discounted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a recurring sales event where customers can find significant discounts on products, including those offered by Walmart and Tractive."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is a significant sales event in the United States, traditionally held on the Friday after Thanksgiving, where retailers offer promotions and discounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is highlighted as a time for special deals and promotions across various categories."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is an annual sales event, marking a significant time for technology deals and discounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Black Friday is an annual shopping event known for great deals, extending the possibility of savings beyond the event itself into December."</data>
