<node id="&quot;CYBER MONDAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cyber Monday is a shopping event that typically follows Black Friday, offering additional discounts and sales opportunities for consumers and businesses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is a significant shopping event featuring online deals, typically occurring after Thanksgiving."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is a significant shopping event where major product deals, including those for Apple technology, are offered."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is an annual online event where retailers offer significant discounts on various products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is an annual online shopping event that offers significant discounts on various products, including consumer electronics like Apple Watch Series 9 and iPads."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is mentioned as a subsequent event where many of the products offered at Black Friday may continue to be available or have sales, connecting it as a follow-up to the Black Friday event."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is an online shopping event that often follows closely behind Black Friday and where further sales or deals might be found."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is an annual online shopping event where deals like those mentioned in the article are promoted, relevant to the context of the article."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is a similar shopping event that also sees retailers offering price-matching policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is another major sales event during which Newegg's price-match guarantee is not applicable, affecting sales and pricing strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is another significant sales event following Prime Day, with possible competitive deals after Amazon's event ends."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is a subsequent shopping event following Black Friday, with deals on various products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is another sales event following Black Friday, where additional deals may still be available."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cyber Monday is a significant sales event where various Apple products are offered at discounted prices, particularly during the holiday season."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e08c64cb2d7e6fe30986418ab1549d99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74ff4761ec6f25c5f1dfb1d484a659e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa727e88f790e839451dcdc83f54e8f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fd32d6870cda4499f6198028b36ba19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d64b4959ff31595de98c92a533b45b80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec935980927f8b6e39b96ac5b5e9f51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3a2c3228a0aa6239adbc663986e3961&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0215d6ca966aaf50adc0287c1f42f0a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f8ee069fe16da677ea6e8384773ee99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf07f55119c79e41d06f4f347fb3ac16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8505c79b96b7237f97abb55ce1c9126&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a27a33e2bf3400ce69950dd7729cec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e6b96f31b61f54eab9da738fca5e668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87f8bd02c8c26cd0e2d520563e379ad9</data>
