<node id="&quot;CONSUMERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A collective group of consumers is involved in the legal proceedings, representing concerns over app store practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumers are implied in discussions about Amazon's practices and the sellers' need to adjust to competition and alternative platforms for their businesses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumers are the subject of the lawsuit against PayPal, representing those affected by the policy decisions and sparking the need for legal scrutiny."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumers are indirectly affected by the privacy rules and enforcement actions within the single market, representing the public interest at stake."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumers are the end-users of the internet, whose experiences and perceptions are distorted by the search engine algorithms and the entities that cater to them."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumers are the end-users of Meta's services who are affected by the changes in data tracking and profiling practices, central to the issue at hand."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumers are state residents who will have rights to opt-out of automated data processing and request access to information about ADMT use.&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumers are the target demographic for these sales, individuals interested in enhancing their homes with new technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumers represent the target market whose spending habits, as affected by inflation and student loan payments, is directly relevant to Nike's sales performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumers are individuals who participate in shopping activities, particularly on Black Friday, to take advantage of discounts and deals on products like headphones and earbuds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumers are the individuals or entities that purchase and use the products made available by the market, affected by the dynamics between Startups and Large Corporations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumers are the end-users who benefit from technology products and are influenced by events like Amazon Prime Day to make purchasing decisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bb1668f74824393873062800326b3029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ea97096e09ce26c6a3503248bbf11c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54663704b68f4c29b62f315b606413f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdfdd7bc3cc52c359502c3c03b84e92a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1d82e5c29781e672c9e7c86753bfd72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9132e992f6e5d72e5c33952b267b9b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c6d7259cf4321bf0a7659f23e160b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82cb9857637c700cd31e747d57c809a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779be9d8a2f98ae640c8b7115387c0ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c6e6566cf973ee85bc9c96af876766&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5b7328c27a0feeaa39f464e37a59eb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31bcb67c56c22f4aaf8e426eda4124fb</data>
</node>
