<node id="&quot;THE VERGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Verge is a media outlet reporting on the Epic Games vs. Google legal case."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is a news organization that publishes the article with details about Black Friday tech deals."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is a news outlet that published the article about Sam Bankman-Fried's personal and professional life, contributing to the public narrative of the case."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is the news outlet where the court case against Apple and Google is being reported, providing journalistic coverage of the legal proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is the publication where the article about Prime Day smart home deals is sourced from, categorized under technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is an online media company that provides news and information about technology and other topics."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is a news outlet that published the article about the Epic v. Google trial."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is a well-known news outlet that published the article about the Xbox controllers, indicating its credibility and relevance in technology news."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is a media outlet that published the article reviewing the Ray-Ban Meta smart glasses."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is a publication known for covering technology news, including the best deals on headphones and wireless earbuds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is a news organization that publishes the article on price-matching policies of various retailers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is an online media outlet with a focus on technology news, where the article on Echo Frames was published."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is an organization known for technology and holiday gift guides, particularly for kids, as evidenced by the provided article."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is a media outlet that covered the Gag City meme, indicating their role in broadcasting and analyzing the viral trend."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is a news publication that provides information, including holiday shipping deadlines for retailers and carriers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is a news outlet where the article about the Apple Watch's double tap gesture has been published."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is mentioned as a source that reported on the internal knowledge among OpenAI employees about Sam Altman's departure, showing the role of media in technology news.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is an organization that produces technology-related news content and offers deals and updates on tech products."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is the publication where the article about Black Friday sales and deals is sourced from, indicating its role as a news organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Verge is an online media company known for technology news, which is publishing the newsletter 'Installer'."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-74ff4761ec6f25c5f1dfb1d484a659e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf1db51fc0edfaa2baaafabc0e33be81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca665b45ebbfa0ff665574a91d013895&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d305b19334f40ed7a4990072f9469d59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fd32d6870cda4499f6198028b36ba19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-385774c8f60c29bf8544825b51fafb2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60dd9377ce3b586374dfab3d0a374040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057b7317eec6793dd87b481abc4c284a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c358a804af7bec98ac89e8a8e5029ba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb1668f74824393873062800326b3029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b5f3c79911cd9857a69ceaa748a8028&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f354a6175730eb4da9c523aa7f2901c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0864bac80ea127025c703d9c70412f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6544389011c8f93153a89fc8667c521a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-409b052cf634534a1b080909c4539ef0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d4ec06372c78a987da35c09bce2d282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93c691669dc56811dfc72f67662852af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ef6612b6aebc4c34f55e1e050f5dad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a0995ce5b2454e8c155a73e56841b9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51eacd5acc81f6d6986e2ffa95821b3</data>
