<node id="&quot;DAVID PIERCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"David Pierce is the author of an article analyzing the potential of the fediverse for decentralized social media."&lt;SEP&gt;"David Pierce is the author of the piece reporting on the Apple-Google antitrust case, serving as a journalist documenting the event and its implications."&lt;SEP&gt;"David Pierce is the author of the newsletter 'Installer' and a guide to various topics within The Verge's universe, offering advice on managing money and finance tools."</data>
