<node id="&quot;JUSTICE DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Justice Department is a federal agency that enforces law and administers justice. It charged Sen. Robert Menendez with bribery, which is part of the legal challenges he is facing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Justice Department is an entity involved in questioning the nature of the Google-Apple relationship from a regulatory and competitive standpoint, suggesting scrutiny over potential anti-competitive practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Justice Department is one of the parties involved in the antitrust case against Google, questioning the legality of the ISA and advocating for fair market competition."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a09a62cb9f741323e17f30b33211a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057b7317eec6793dd87b481abc4c284a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdfe9885408c9e158f4aed0d86f42787</data>
</node>
