  <data key="d1">"The Courtroom is the setting where the legal battle between the Prosecution and the Defense takes place, integral to the unfolding of the case involving Sam Bankman-Fried."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Washington, DC, courtroom is the physical setting where the trial against Google is taking place, critical to the context of the legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08d890dfc9208b54ae051d1a3f6f8086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057b7317eec6793dd87b481abc4c284a</data>
