<node id="&quot;SAM RIVERA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sam Rivera acknowledges the interaction between Meta's practices and data protection authorities, reflecting on the implications for privacy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Rivera exhibits a mixture of awe and anxiety while engaging with advanced technology, highlighting a key role within the team."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Rivera is a team member involved in communication with an intelligent entity, displaying a mix of awe and anxiety."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Rivera is an individual associated with cryptocurrency businesses and has a connection with SBF, referenced in discussions about the subject."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Rivera is engaged in active observation and interaction with technology, reflecting a sense of youthful energy mixed with awe and anxiety in the face of an advanced intelligence.&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Rivera is identified as a member of the team reviewing the Steam Deck OLED, providing insights into the product's performance and user experience."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Rivera is a team member of the Diamondbacks, reflecting on the interaction with the unknown intelligence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Rivera represents a role within the team, providing insights on communication with intelligent beings but not specifically tied to an organization, event, or technology product."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Rivera is a person mentioned in the context of discussing communication with an intelligence, showing a mix of awe and anxiety."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Rivera is a member of the team working on establishing communication with an advanced intelligence, expressing both awe and anxiety about the situation."</data>
