  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Thane Rehn is a prosecutor in the SBF trial, characterizing the accused's actions as fraudulent and destructive to investors and customers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thane Rehn is the assistant US attorney prosecuting Sam Bankman-Fried, who starkly contrasts Bankman-Fried's demeanor with his own animated explanations to the jury."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08d890dfc9208b54ae051d1a3f6f8086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb78a9662e9f89c12554eea5d98b637</data>
