<node id="&quot;SPOTIFY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"APP"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Spotify announced layoffs of 200 jobs in its podcast unit, demonstrating organizational downsizing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is an organization that announced layoffs, affecting approximately 600 employees globally."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is another service where the TechCrunch's Chain Reaction podcast can be accessed, alongside Apple Podcasts, by the public for educational content."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is one of the major companies taking significant layoffs, reflecting its position in the music industry.&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify's announcement of layoffs affecting around 600 employees, which is about 6% of its global workforce, on January 23, 2023, is an organizational event related to downsizing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify's significant workforce reduction relates to its position in the rapidly changing music streaming industry, particularly impacted by competition and changing user preferences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify, an organization, is laying off about 1,500 jobs as of December 4, marking its third round of layoffs in the year."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is a company that negotiated a special deal with Google, receiving a 0% fee and the ability to process its own payments, which disadvantages smaller developers who must pay the standard 30% fee.&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is a digital music platform that played a critical role in promoting Si No Estás and providing it with a global audience, including playlist inclusions and top chart positions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is a platform where the album El Comienzo and other artists' works have gained substantial streaming numbers, indicating its role as a major player in the music distribution and consumption market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify, as a digital music streaming service, is a key site where independent artists can gain streams and gauge their popularity globally."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is a company that has removed AI-generated songs from its platform but also introduced an AI-powered DJ, illustrating the complex role of AI in the music industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is a technology/service offering a music streaming platform, suitable as a gift for someone who enjoys music."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is a music streaming service undergoing layoffs to improve productivity and efficiency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is listed as one of the streaming services where TikTok users subscribe, relevant in the context of music streaming on the platform."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is a company heavily involved in podcasting, and currently focusing on scaling and efficiency over original content."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spotify is a music streaming service app on the Apple Watch that does not utilize double tap functionality, highlighting the limitations of double tap for certain app interactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4858befea8647fc8858e0a35abd02cad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d6dc2d558e8c913dc498b003e62cae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e12dc7da779249348839cbb839df513&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb78a9662e9f89c12554eea5d98b637&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b7ac8e12041fa2b49b4d369dfe8ba66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f812fe7c8b6ca1ce43ad8986b05a7fef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c12d27e34c918671ffcd1de343d48a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d86f1367560c866b5a92b4fff98ddbd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6a32626c7394869f547f4ee6ccac459&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e0c2f70ef0775416906c3f57df7014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e31ede1c7e0bd2496710c3d99a0d5df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f48de14c3c62b76d1fff3ec66fa40d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d7f0cccca1431ec664c34b761b23382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3be20b4d3bd8bd82367878619fc02e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380596c782c1d2656cd689661074c4f6</data>
