<node id="&quot;SBF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"SBF is portrayed as a co-founder and CTO of FTX who allegedly mismanaged funds by diverting customer money for personal gain."&lt;SEP&gt;"SBF, also known as Sam Bankman-Fried, is the central figure in the article, previously a disgraced cryptocurrency entrepreneur central to the financial fraud of FTX and now at trial."&lt;SEP&gt;"SBF, represented by Sam, is a central figure in the discussion, known for its involvement in cryptocurrency and its fall from grace due to mismanagement and scandal."</data>
