</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Defense is added as a component to Israel's national security doctrine, symbolizing a strategic development in their security concept."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defense represents the side arguing that SBF and his team were overwhelmed, not with intentional fraud, but with the challenges of running FTX."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defense is the party objecting to the treatment of 'normal customers' in the context of the case, indicating their role in the legal process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86186789739ea225fd9dcfdd550e5a3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65dc5d663868d51c16be734ed29defa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c51d18a87b8c5bcea42b00475309ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROSECUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Prosecution is one side in a legal trial, presenting allegations of fraudulent activities against Sam Bankman-Fried."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Prosecution is the opposing side to the Defense, presenting the case against SBF and his actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Prosecution represents the legal body that brought charges against Bankman-Fried and his co-conspirators, indicative of the judicial process at play."&lt;SEP&gt;"Prosecution represents the legal body opposing Bankman-Fried, bringing forth questions and testimonies about the organization's practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cef8862c6918d02dd1f5018cabaed6f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f90dd524447230c0ba9f19ff45aeae94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f44d1fb769811b62dec26a14ca8e3ba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c51d18a87b8c5bcea42b00475309ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GARY WANG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gary Wang is a co-founder and CTO of FTX who testified about Alameda Research's financial practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gary Wang is the former CTO of FTX who pleaded guilty to federal criminal charges related to the FTX collapse."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gary Wang is a key witness in the trial, previously a partner at Sequoia Capital and a lieutenant of Bankman-Fried, potentially linked to the organization's involvement in the case."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gary Wang was one of the hired employees at Alameda Research to program the computers, mentioned in the context of Bankman-Fried's actions and hiring practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gary Wang, as the Chief Technology Officer of FTX, played a role in the trial through his testimony, which was scrutinized for inconsistencies and technical complexity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gary Wang is co-founder of FTX and Alameda Research, testifying about secret privileges created in the FTX code."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gary Wang is a co-founder of FTX and a witness testifying in the trial. He was born in China and moved to the U.S. at age 7. He studied math and computer science at MIT and worked at Google before joining FTX. Wang testified about the fraudulent activities and the financial arrangements between FTX and Alameda, where he had a 10% ownership. He highlighted the advantages Alameda received by having code embedded in FTX's software, which allowed special access and privileges. Furthermore, he discussed the $8 billion bug in the code, which went unnoticed until it was too late, ultimately leading to FTX's collapse."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gary Wang is the former co-founder of FTX and a witness in the fraud trial against Sam Bankman-Fried, facing up to 50 years in prison for his involvement in the company's collapse."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gary Wang was the co-founder and CTO of FTX, involved in the coding and technical decisions that are under scrutiny in the testimony."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7f35c4b6154a8f2343fab7cd419b4f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60dd9377ce3b586374dfab3d0a374040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fbf2d5f58f4b4f3b25a566059e9283e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86186789739ea225fd9dcfdd550e5a3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0ce5eeb08a778c695cdba351571fcb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a8c789b034881e0489e2514ca89f43e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fd006714e0bf26c23ed69ba354b35b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cef8862c6918d02dd1f5018cabaed6f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c51d18a87b8c5bcea42b00475309ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATT HUANG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Matt Huang is a co-founder and managing partner of Paradigm, which invested in FTX and testified about being unaware of its financial practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Matt Huang is a co-founder of Paradigm Operations LP, who invested in FTX and testified about his dealings and concerns with FTX's governance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-460081ab84c90e2cb3c786217304f4cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c51d18a87b8c5bcea42b00475309ad</data>
