<node id="&quot;FTX CUSTOMERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FTX Customers are the individuals whose transactions were allegedly used to fund Alameda Research, representing the financial base of the crypto trading firm FTX."&lt;SEP&gt;"FTX customers are the individuals who have entrusted their funds to the cryptocurrency exchange FTX, and their financial well-being is at stake due to the alleged mismanagement of funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"FTX Customers represent the individuals who lost their deposits due to FTX's financial mismanagement and fraudulent activities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b60262e0789b7646790d8c63276a0aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-460081ab84c90e2cb3c786217304f4cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c51d18a87b8c5bcea42b00475309ad</data>
</node>
