  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sam Altman is a key figure involved in founding OpenAI and its evolution, and has connections to Microsoft as well as effective altruists."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman is recognized as a supporter and backer of young entrepreneurs, specifically a teen's AI startup focused on automating business workflows."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman is a prominent figure associated with OpenAI, offering reflections on the launch and impact of ChatGPT on the technological landscape and AI product strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman is the CEO and co-founder of OpenAI, noted for his leadership role and recent controversies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman is the former CEO of OpenAI, whose departure marks a significant change in leadership for the organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman is the former CEO who stepped down from OpenAI, described as transformative for him and optimistic for the world."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman is the ousted CEO of OpenAI, involved in the company's leadership and decision-making processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman is the CEO of OpenAI, recognized for his role in the popularization of ChatGPT."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman was the CEO of OpenAI and is now free from the board of directors after a controversial dismissal."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman is the CEO of OpenAI, involved in decision-making processes related to AI model development and deployment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman was the CEO of OpenAI, who is now no longer in the position following a vote of no confidence due to perceived lack of candor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman is an investor in OpenAI and was ousted as CEO, reflecting on his transformative experience and expressing intent to launch a new venture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman is the ex-Y Combinator president and an OpenAI co-founder who was fired as CEO, central to the timeline of events."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Altman is identified as the former CEO of OpenAI who has been ousted following a deliberative review by the board for lack of candor in communications."</data>
