<node id="&quot;SAM BANKMAN-FRIED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sam Bankman-Fried is the CEO of FTX during the time of the events, depicted as motionless and composed during the prosecution's opening statement, despite facing serious charges of lying and stealing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Bankman-Fried is the central figure of the FTX trial, accused of orchestrating fraudulent activities and affecting many lives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Bankman-Fried is the former CEO of FTX involved in a criminal trial for fraud and conspiracy, maintaining his innocence amidst allegations of mismanagement and a significant crypto industry collapse."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Bankman-Fried is the former CEO of crypto exchange FTX, and a subject of the trial, characterized by contrasting portrayals of his actions and intentions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Bankman-Fried is the founder of FTX who is testifying before a jury and is characterized by self-assuredness and a tendency to speak in a manner that implies he's unaware of his own contradictions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Bankman-Fried is the founder of FTX, accused of fraud and central to the hedge fund's collapse, with complex relationships affecting his business decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Bankman-Fried is the founder of FTX, who is on trial for wire fraud and conspiracy, and has testified about financial mismanagement at FTX."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Bankman-Fried is the defendant in a trial for FTX, the founder and former CEO of a failed cryptocurrency exchange, charged with various counts of wire fraud and conspiracy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Bankman-Fried is the defendant in the fraud trial, accused of orchestrating the collapse of FTX. He met Gary Wang during high school, and later became a co-founder of FTX. Bankman-Fried had private relationships with employees and was involved in the financial decisions concerning Alameda's privileges and the misuse of funds.&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Bankman-Fried is the founder of FTX who faces multiple federal charges including wire fraud, securities fraud, and money laundering."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Bankman-Fried is the CEO of FTX, accused of fraud and conspiracy in the financial collapse of the exchange."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Bankman-Fried was the founder of FTX who was found guilty of criminal fraud and faces prison time, influencing the crypto industry's perception and actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7f35c4b6154a8f2343fab7cd419b4f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60dd9377ce3b586374dfab3d0a374040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f90dd524447230c0ba9f19ff45aeae94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fbf2d5f58f4b4f3b25a566059e9283e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae72da3d9b8976ac437556b02fe22ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a8c789b034881e0489e2514ca89f43e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-666b134149baf8ecb41c331461915fa2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60262e0789b7646790d8c63276a0aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fd006714e0bf26c23ed69ba354b35b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08d890dfc9208b54ae051d1a3f6f8086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cef8862c6918d02dd1f5018cabaed6f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be3f57d263b110d6f976c940b00bad63</data>
