  <data key="d1">"Sundar Pichai is the CEO of Google, a key figure in the trial against Epic Games."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sundar Pichai is the CEO of Google, at whose company Sameer Samat works, and potentially a figure Epic Games would engage with for the current legal and strategic issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sundar Pichai is the CEO of Google, defending the company's search engine quality and practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sundar Pichai is the CEO of Google, involved in Android and antitrust lawsuits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sundar Pichai is the CEO of Google, involved in discussions regarding settlement talks with Epic Games."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sundar Pichai is the CEO of Google, testifying in an antitrust trial regarding Google's business tactics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sundar Pichai is the CEO of Google, expected to be a witness in the trial involving Epic's legal dispute against Apple."</data>
