  <data key="d1">"Baldur's Gate 3 is a video game series that includes a variety of classes and subclasses for players to choose from."&lt;SEP&gt;"Baldur’s Gate 3 is a game that features the Warlock class as one of its twelve classes, with unique abilities and spellcasting mechanics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Baldur’s Gate 3 is a tabletop role-playing game that offers a variety of class choices for players, each balanced and impacting character combat strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Baldur’s Gate 3 is a computer role-playing game that offers a unique take on the Zelda series, with a new world and innovative gameplay mechanics like the use of the Ultrahand."&lt;SEP&gt;"Baldur’s Gate 3 is the video game setting for the quest narrative."&lt;SEP&gt;"Baldur’s Gate 3 is a video game that features a vampire character named Astarion, with vampirism being a prominent gameplay element."&lt;SEP&gt;"Baldur’s Gate 3 is mentioned as an inspiration for the Rogue Trader game, indicating a connection to the RPG genre."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86779f3a7608b52e73d27af82543b55e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ba558946a177d2a4c4279c9bbf41f66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3e2d9b0f2b30c01730fc8fc4efffae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f559492332530aa27ce47fc14d3b6a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa6aded5a7aa46b42a29ef9c96cf926c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WARLOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Warlock is a caster class where players draw magic from within themselves, offering a flexible range of spells and themes tied to their subclass choice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Warlock is a class available in Baldur's Gate 3, known for its spellcasting abilities and subclasses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Warlock is a player class in a role-playing game, characterized by its pact-based magic.&lt;SEP&gt;"Warlock is characterized by knowledge-seeking and the ability to form pacts with otherworldly beings, sacrificing the number of spells known for power."&lt;SEP&gt;"Warlock is one of twelve classes in Baldur’s Gate 3, characterized by its knowledge-seeking nature and ability to form pacts with otherworldly beings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Warlock, being a spellcaster class, shares thematic ties with the broader concept of magic manipulation and control in the game world."&lt;SEP&gt;"Warlocks are casters with magic based on a pact with a higher power, emphasizing a blend of combat and magical abilities with a scholarly element."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f613e8154483a3a5550a5e34f2086d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEY PRESENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fey Presence is a feature for The Archfey subclass, allowing the Warlock to charm or frighten nearby enemies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fey Presence is a spell from the Circle of the Archfey subclass, allowing Paladins to draw upon faerie magic, indicating a fusion of holy and arcane power with magical themes.&lt;SEP&gt;"Fey Presence is a unique action available to Warlocks in The Archfey subclass of Baldur’s Gate 3."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIEND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fiend subclass allows Warlocks to make a pact with a hellish fiend for powerful abilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARMOR OF AGATHYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Armor of Agathys allows Warlocks to gain temporary hitpoints and deal damage when hit by melee attacks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Armor of Agathys is a spell that grants temporary hitpoints and deals damage when hit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BONE CHILL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CANTRIP"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bone Chill prevents the target from healing and affects undead targets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bone Chill stops healing and affects undead specifically."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELDRITCH BLAST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eldritch Blast conjures a beam of energy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eldritch Blast creates a beam of energy for various effects."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAGE HAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mage Hand creates a spectral hand for interaction with objects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mage Hand creates a spectral hand for object manipulation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINOR ILLUSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CANTRIP"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Minor Illusion creates an illusion that draws nearby creatures' attention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minor Illusion creates an illusion to draw attention."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POISON SPRAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Poison Spray projects noxious gas as damage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Poison Spray releases a gas that serves as damage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HELLISH REBUKE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hellish Rebuke reacts with flames against attackers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hellish Rebuke reacts with flames to deal damage to attackers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAERIE FIRE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Faerie Fire is a spell from the Circle of the Archfey subclass, a whimsical, nature-connected spell that hints at the faerie themes prevalent in this magic-focused subclass.&lt;SEP&gt;"Faerie Fire is an exclusive spell for The Archfey subclass, dealing damage around the target based on spell save DCs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Faerie Fire makes targets visible and gives attackers advantage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Faerie Fire reveals targets and gives attackers advantage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Command allows control over creatures' actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Command allows directing the actions of creatures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Command is an exclusive spell for The Fiend subclass, allowing the Warlock to command creatures to do tasks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHARM PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Charm Person prevents a humanoid target from attacking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Charm Person prevents target humanoids from attacking."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISSONANT WHISPERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dissonant Whispers frightens a creature, making it harder to hit.&lt;SEP&gt;"Dissonant Whispers frightens the target, inhibiting its movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dissonant Whispers is an exclusive spell for The Great Old One subclass, allowing the Warlock to create a caustic atmosphere and attack foes within it."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXPEDITIOUS RETREAT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Expeditious Retreat allows for quick movements as a bonus action."&lt;SEP&gt;"Expeditious Retreat allows quick movement and reactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BURNING HANDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Burning Hands deals damage to flammable targets.&lt;SEP&gt;"Burning Hands is an exclusive spell for The Fiend subclass, dealing damage within a 15-foot cone.'&lt;SEP&gt;"Burning Hands targets flammable enemies with fire damage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARMS OF HADAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arms of Hadar prevents enemies from using reactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arms of Hadar prevents targets from using reactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROTECTION FROM EVIL AND GOOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Protection from Evil and Good defends against various supernatural threats."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protection from Evil and Good" offers defense against common threats.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TASHA'S HIDEOUS LAUGHTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tasha's Hideous Laughter leaves creatures prone with laughter."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tasha's Hideous Laughter puts creatures in a state of prone amusement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SLEEP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sleep induces slumber in selected targets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sleep is an exclusive spell for The Archfey subclass, causing illness and affecting foes' Wisdom saving throws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sleep puts creatures into a magical slumber."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WITCH BOLT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Witch Bolt links the caster to a target with a bolt of lightning, causing ongoing damage.&lt;SEP&gt;"Witch Bolt maintains a magical link to deal ongoing lightning damage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BLADE WARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Blade Ward is not explicitly mentioned, but implied as a defensive ability likely related to the Warlock's weapon skills.&lt;SEP&gt;"Blade Ward, while not explicitly described, is implied to be a defensive skill related to weapon use."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPELL SLOT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Warlocks have spell slots used to cast spells, recharged by short rests."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROFICIENCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROFICIENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Warlocks are proficient in simple weapons and light armor, with saving throws in Wisdom and Charisma."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SKILLS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TRAIT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Skills are the actions performed by the Barbarian that can be swapped or buffed to enhance the damage output and playstyle described in the build."&lt;SEP&gt;"Warlocks can choose two skills from a list including Arcana, Deception, History, Intimidation, Investigation, Nature, and Religion."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fe69cdd5f7208d1ea6e7261d118cb4e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WARLOCK SUBCLASSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"There are three subclasses for Warlocks, determined by the otherworldly patron chosen during character creation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE FIEND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Fiend Warlocks draw their magic from demons, focusing on hell-themed spells that suggest macabre and destructive powers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fiend is a subclass for Warlocks in Baldur's Gate 3, characterized by a pact with a fiendish entity and exclusive spells Burning Hands and Command."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fiend is a subclass for Warlocks in Baldur's Gate 3, characterized by a pact with a fiendish entity and exclusive spells."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fiend subclass involves a pact with a hellish fiend for specific abilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-567a98f32a88e8906e8ac91ff4c695d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE GREAT OLD ONE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WARLOCK SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Great Old One Warlocks have magic themed around ancient and mythic beings, indicating lore-rich and powerful magic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Great Old One is a subclass for Warlocks in Baldur's Gate 3, involving a mysterious being from the Far Realm with exclusive features and spells Dissonant Whispers and Tasha’s Hideous Laughter."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Great Old One is another subclass for Warlocks in Baldur's Gate 3, involving a mysterious being from the Far Realm with exclusive features and spells."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE ARCHFEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WARLOCK SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Archfey Warlocks draw their magic from faerie realms, suggesting spells that are whimsical, trickster-like, and connected to nature or magic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Archfey is a subclass for Warlocks in Baldur's Gate 3, linked to fey lords and ladies, with exclusive spells Faerie Fire and Sleep."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Archfey is a subclass for Warlocks in Baldur's Gate 3, linked to fey lords and ladies, with unique spells and effects."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DROW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"RACE/SUBRACE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Drow is a race in Baldur's Gate 3, with Drow Weapon Training as a subclass that boosts proficiency with certain weapons."&lt;SEP&gt;"Drow is a race in Baldur's Gate 3, with Drow Weapon Training as a subclass, enhancing proficiency with rapiers and hand crossbows."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HUMANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"RACE/SUBRACE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Humans is a race in Baldur's Gate 3, whose Civil Militia subclass increases proficiency with medieval weaponry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Humans is a race in Baldur's Gate 3, whose Civil Militia subclass increases proficiency with spears, pikes, halberds, and shields."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HALFLINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"RACE/SUBRACE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Halflings is a race in Baldur's Gate 3, without specific subclass features mentioned."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GITHYANKI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"RACE/SUBRACE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Githyanki is a race in Baldur's Gate 3, associated with the Martial Prodigy subclass for enhanced combat capabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DWARF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"RACE/SUBRACE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dwarf is a race in Baldur's Gate 3, with Dwarven Combat Training granting proficiency with certain weapons."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHARISMA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Charisma is a key statistic for spellcasting in Baldur's Gate 3, particularly for classes like Warlock."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Constitution supports hit points for characters, beneficial for classes like Warlock and Sorcerer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELDRITCH INVOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WARLOCK SUBCLASS FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eldritch Invocation is a feature that enhances Warlock subclass spells and is selected at level 2."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eldritch Invocation is a feature that enhances Warlock subclass spells, chosen at level 2, particularly impactful due to its ability to upgrade existing spells like Eldritch Blast."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eldritch Invocation is a feature that enhances Warlock subclass spells, chosen at level 2, particularly impactful due to its ability to upgrade spells like Eldritch Blast."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DARK ONE’S BLESSING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WARLOCK SUBCLASS FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dark One’s Blessing is a feature exclusive to The Fiend subclass, providing temporary hit points after defeating hostile creatures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTAL REMINDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WARLOCK SUBCLASS FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortal Reminder is a feature exclusive to The Great Old One subclass, instilling fear in enemies after a critical hit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TASHA’S HIDEOUS LAUGHTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXCLUSIVE SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tasha’s Hideous Laughter is an exclusive spell for The Great Old One subclass, mauling creatures with a disease-like effect."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGONIZING BLAST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WARLOCK SUBCLASS FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Agonizing Blast is a result of the Eldritch Invocation for The Great Old One subclass, which intensifies spellcasting damage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agonizing Blast is a result of the Eldritch Invocation for The Great Old One subclass, which intensifies the Warlock's spellcasting damage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPELL SNIPER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WARLOCK FEAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Spell Sniper is a Feat for Warlocks that allows learning a cantrip and reduces the critical hit roll by 1, enhancing spellcasting accuracy."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WARLOCK FEAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Actor is a Feat for Warlocks that increases Charisma by 1, doubling Proficiency Bonus for Deception and Performance Checks, beneficial for social interactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELEMENTAL ADEPT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WARLOCK FEAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Elemental Adept is a Feat for Warlocks that makes spells ignore Resistance to a chosen damage type, significantly impacting spellcasting effectiveness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MODERATELY ARMORED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WARLOCK FEAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Moderately Armored is a Feat for Warlocks that provides Armor Proficiency with medium armor and shields, improving combat survivability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fd9b5685c40134ed78fc2e5f06f6bde</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUGUST ALSINA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"August Alsina is a public figure who had an affair with Jada while she was married, and discussed the nature of his relationship with Jada openly."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b896650d8a3a16964d4a38258e81dc9e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JADA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Jada is August Alsina's romantic partner, who was married at the time of the alleged affair, and is involved in discussions about their relationship and public reactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jada is Will's partner, and there are discussions about the nature of their relationship and its challenges."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f97aa2fddead7ef00cb53deb69fd3664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b896650d8a3a16964d4a38258e81dc9e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WILL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Will is Jada's husband, who publicly denies infidelity and defends his relationship with Jada."&lt;SEP&gt;"Will is a character who has had a controversial incident at an awards ceremony, leading to questions about his past relationship with Jada."&lt;SEP&gt;"Will is discussing a concept related to emotional sensitivity and the awareness of subtleties in life, suggesting a reflective individual."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d7ccaeb298b5ef7c86fcdeee5e73947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f97aa2fddead7ef00cb53deb69fd3664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b896650d8a3a16964d4a38258e81dc9e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OSCARS INCIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The incident at the 94th annual Oscars, where Will slapped Chris Rock, became a notable moment in their public life."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b896650d8a3a16964d4a38258e81dc9e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JADA'S REP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Jada's Rep is the representative of Jada, involved in public responses and denying the allegations of an affair."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b896650d8a3a16964d4a38258e81dc9e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RED TABLE TALK&quot;">
