<node id="&quot;TAYLOR SWIFT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DIRECT COMPETITOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Taylor Swift continues to navigate her personal and professional life, often drawing from real-life experiences to inform her songwriting and public persona."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a Grammy-winning artist who has sparked interest among sports fans, particularly Kelce, and is noted for her stage presence and public persona."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a Grammy-winning music artist who has experienced significant life events that have shaped her identity and career, including being cancelled for her work and having her music catalogue and master recordings acquired by a music mogul."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a performer who does not converse outside of her concerts, and Kelce wishes to give her a personalized bracelet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a renowned singer and occasional sports commentator, indicating her role as a public figure and an event participant."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a singer-songwriter who has had a rumoured relationship with Travis Kelce, with whom he has shared public experiences such as attending games together."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is recognized as a prominent figure in entertainment, having been named Time’s 2023 Person of the Year for her significant impact on headlines and popular culture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a high-profile pop star and a subject of rumors regarding a potential romantic relationship with Travis Kelce."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a public figure who has attended a Chiefs game and interacted with Travis Kelce, creating significant media attention and social buzz."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a famous singer-songwriter who has commented on the transformation in music consumption trends due to digital platforms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a singer facing mixed reactions amid her reported relationship with Travis Kelce and commentary about his views on having children."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is an individual who was present at the event where Travis Kelce allegedly interacted with security personnel."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is mentioned as a previous collaborator with Beyoncé and a notable figure in the concert film industry, having set the precedent for 'Renaissance: A Film by Beyoncé's' success."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is mentioned as one of the collaborators for the song "Unholy," demonstrating her influence and collaboration within the music industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is one of Ice Spice's key collaborators, contributing greatly to her success and audience expansion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a celebrated artist whose albums are part of Hipgnosis Songs Fund's investments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is an artist reflecting on her personal relationships and the media portrayal of them, acknowledging pain and growth without resorting to blame."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is an artist who reflects on personal relationships and their complexities in her music."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is the artist that has a falling out with Katy Perry over the alleged incident involving backing dancers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is the central figure of the album '1989', highlighting her evolution from a country star to a pop icon and her personal expression through music."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a Grammy-winning singer who has recently discussed her romantic relationship with NFL star Travis Kelce in a Time interview."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a celebrity mentioned in the context of a publicity stunt related to football betting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a central figure discussed in the context of NFL's coverage and fan interests, a pop culture celebrity with a significant fanbase."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is an artist from Universal Music Group who has participated in the 'Dream Track' AI music experiment.&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is mentioned in relation to her song "All Too Well (10 Minute Version)," which broke the record previously held by 'American Pie.'&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a central figure in the concert film and a pop star with significant influence, encouraging audience engagement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a pop star whose concert films have achieved significant commercial success as an alternative to live concerts, especially given ticket price inflation and logistical challenges."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is an American singer-songwriter and a key figure in the pop music industry, also known for her significant and dedicated fan base."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a famous singer-songwriter who, despite controversy, has a notable impact on NFL viewership and jersey sales."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift is a rumoured girlfriend of Travis Kelce and a subject of NFL's media attention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taylor Swift, known for her songwriting and successful career, is mentioned as a direct competitor within the singer-songwriter niche that Tate McRae is also reaching towards.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6724733fbcf1de818c12b3127bed9038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bed85882f8b8c273c4607bb3b336221&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6677081ba1bf7c665602ed9182e88a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e60b1c5d92337428012e41cc3b379852&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8172a2f9b335a341ae1de45d395180c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a2909c19b8362eb3d5dadd41e7cf408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7228eab616f311039f5147fcaa207275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4488ee91b0a939ea6254959e9dee4ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea9ceaff475450a9183036c4dc948ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf5f62bf82adaab23be3ed8d83b7d4fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca0ad3345c785d38f701945e287e42bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-233c280c48e91119f2e7fd607fef5069&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a84f589c36829e7c384eab299728f09c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5f7ec1f51fada703fd21d82022ec10b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87f5f577fff8e2da6ad8c8447ac27c86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db487216aefd9e69b4236fcc6b8e9284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe59e3db56c028bac582201cbb46adc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d8fdfb9c9340b0465b58cb6b8ee367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af069c108e8b4967e774b39ea04f66ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b8d05914230b4d45b86027af874aa45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-770b359eb098a567b0ef119511e1fe45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-835769d53ba2905e28aedb8687e3ca91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e0622e33444c67273cfc3eb92d118ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dc3c75985ec99946c346b27b166c585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f356d3df0691d6ec444767a4e546850&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f748521b1f2e85d6b98d54805eaa06d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-460ac7f04fc562593fd336bbccadccb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f2efe9e353fee8a180d831461123b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8d30ad7aa8ff8668a17b4f80bc6e17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fec7d4854d187377646ddb42f13e05a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ERAS TOUR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eras Tour is a concert tour associated with Taylor Swift, during which she has attended Travis Kelce's games and received support from him."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eras Tour is a major tour by Taylor Swift in 2023, which dominated ticket sales and grossed over $1.4 billion, showcasing her commercial success in the music industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eras Tour is an event where Swift performed, which Kelce attempted to meet her during but was unsuccessful due to her vocal preservation policy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eras Tour is the concert series where Taylor Swift performs, and Kelce attended to receive bracelets from fans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eras Tour refers to an event by Taylor Swift during which Travis Kelce was involved, demonstrating a convergence of public life and their relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eras Tour is mentioned as Taylor Swift's upcoming tour, providing context to her commitment and schedule, which contrasts with Kelce's controversial personal statements.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-233c280c48e91119f2e7fd607fef5069&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f356d3df0691d6ec444767a4e546850&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6724733fbcf1de818c12b3127bed9038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-460ac7f04fc562593fd336bbccadccb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f2efe9e353fee8a180d831461123b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca0ad3345c785d38f701945e287e42bf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SWIFT'S NUMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Swift's Number refers to Kelce's desire to have his number on a bracelet for Taylor Swift as a token from a concert fan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-460ac7f04fc562593fd336bbccadccb7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PODCAST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Podcast is a digital medium through which Travis Kelce disclosed his earlier attempt to give Taylor Swift his number, indicating the use of technology in their relationship's public revelation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Podcast is the medium through which Kelce discusses his experiences and feelings regarding Taylor Swift, indicating it's an organized platform for sharing ideas."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-460ac7f04fc562593fd336bbccadccb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6724733fbcf1de818c12b3127bed9038</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BROTHER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Kelce's brother is another individual involved in the context, possibly as a co-host or participant in the dialogue on the podcast."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-460ac7f04fc562593fd336bbccadccb7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JEFFREY PARKIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Jeffrey Parkin is the author of an article on Baldur's Gate 3, discussing the strategic choice of classes within the game."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86779f3a7608b52e73d27af82543b55e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLASSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Classes in Baldur’s Gate 3 are a core part of the game, impacting how players fight and interact with the game world."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86779f3a7608b52e73d27af82543b55e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIGHTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fighter is a player class in a role-playing game, representing the warrior archetype."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fighter is recommended as the best melee class for beginners in Baldur’s Gate 3, known for its straightforward combat approach."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86779f3a7608b52e73d27af82543b55e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BATTLE MASTER, ELDRITCH KNIGHT, CHAMPION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Battle Master, Eldritch Knight, and Champion are subclasses for Fighters, each offering unique combat advantages such as battlefield control, magical attacks, and critical hits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86779f3a7608b52e73d27af82543b55e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RANGER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ranger is a player class in a role-playing game, focusing on tracking and ranged combat."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ranger is advised as the best ranged class for beginners, due to its agility focus and versatile nature in combat and skills."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ranger, while a combat-focused class, often forms part of a team dynamic with other classes like Druids and Clerics for a combination of ranged and support roles."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86779f3a7608b52e73d27af82543b55e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RANGER SUBCLASS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Beast Master, Gloom Stalker, Hunter are subclasses for Ranger, with each focusing on different gameplay aspects like companionship, stealth, and specialized melee abilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86779f3a7608b52e73d27af82543b55e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BARBARIAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Barbarian is a character class in the game Diablo 4, focusing on a leveling and endgame build guide."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barbarian is highlighted as a class focused heavily on combat, with choices regarding armor and damage output."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barbarian is one of the player classes in a role-playing game, associated with the warrior archetype."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barbarians are all about combat, focusing on heavy hitters and Rage ability, which enhances their combat prowess."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barbarian is the class of discussion, focusing on heavy build strategies involving Key Passives and weapon swapping."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6fe69cdd5f7208d1ea6e7261d118cb4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86779f3a7608b52e73d27af82543b55e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2ca0f54086ede9cead909319bf30af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BATTLE MASTER, ELDRITCH KNIGHT, CHAMPION, BEAST MASTER, GLOOM STALKER, HUNTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS AND SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These subclasses are part of the main classes in Baldur’s Gate 3, each providing distinct combat and gameplay enhancements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86779f3a7608b52e73d27af82543b55e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BALDUR'S GATE 3&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"VIDEO GAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Baldur's Gate 3 is a video game, focusing on strategic class choice and character development."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-86779f3a7608b52e73d27af82543b55e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BEAST MASTERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Beast Masters is a class in Baldur’s Gate 3 where players get a companion animal that fights alongside them, emphasizing combat and partnership."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GLOOM STALKERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gloom Stalkers focus on stealth, indicating a class specialization in covert and sneaky tactics."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HUNTERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hunters allow players to specialize their melee abilities, highlighting a focus on close combat and offensive skills."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hunters are adversaries that Mary Jane encounters and engages with in combat in the 'Wake Up' quest, representing part of the game's challenge and action for her character."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-edf316e0c244291b388cf303f869efb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WILDHEART&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Wildheart is a subclass for Barbarians that adds animal-themed tweaks like healing, jumping, or a stampede, focusing on versatile combat abilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BERSERKER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Berserker is a subclass for Barbarians emphasizing aggressive combat and dealing extra damage, suitable for hit-focused playstyles."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WILD MAGIC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Wild Magic adds a magical flair to the Barbarian Rage with random effects, enhancing both combat and magical aspects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wild Magic is a Warlock subclass that represents chaotic and untamed magic, reflecting the unpredictable and raw nature of the forces the character harnesses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f613e8154483a3a5550a5e34f2086d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DRUID&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Druid is a player class in a role-playing game, known for its connection to nature and magic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Druids are nature-based casters with magic themed around nature or animals, and the ability to shapeshift, indicating a blend of elemental and life-force-focused spellcasting."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Druid is a character within Baldur’s Gate 3, working alongside Malus Thorm, and plays a role in the quest."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b3e2d9b0f2b30c01730fc8fc4efffae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CIRCLE OF THE LAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Circle of the Land enhances Druid's magic and spellcasting abilities, enriching their connection to the elements of the natural world."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CIRCLE OF THE MOON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Circle of the Moon adds bear as an additional animal shape for Druids, further diversifying their shapeshifting options and abilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CIRCLE OF SPORES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Circle of Spores introduces decay and fungus-based magic, indicating a specialization in darker, more mysterious and organic magical elements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PALADIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Paladin is a player class in a role-playing game, combining aspects of a warrior and a divine priest.&lt;SEP&gt;"Paladin, as a divine fighter class, often has a thematic relationship with the concept of law and order, paralleling the idea of control."&lt;SEP&gt;"Paladins mix divine magic with melee abilities, indicating a class that balances offensive combat with powerful holy magic."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OATH OF THE ANCIENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Oath of the Ancients adds healing magic to Paladin's arsenal, highlighting a role that focuses on supporting and healing in battle."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OATH OF DEVOTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Oath of Devotion focuses Paladin's magic on defense, indicating a more supportive or protective role during combat."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OATH OF VENGEANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Oath of Vengeance adds offensive magic, indicating a subclass geared towards delivering powerful attacks and aggression."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THIEF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Thief Rogues offer an extra bonus action and stealth-oriented gear, focusing on evasion and cunning in combat."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARCANE TRICKSTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arcane Tricksters allow Rogues to mix in magic with their cunning and stealth, indicating a hybrid of spellcasting and sneaky tactics."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSASSIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Assassin is a spellcaster class in a role-playing game, specializing in stealth, speed, and dealing high single-target damage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assassins give advantages over surprised or unprepared enemies, indicating a subclass well-suited for sneak attacks and tactical strikes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MONK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Monk is a player class in a role-playing game, emphasizing martial arts and mental discipline."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monks are melee classes that focus on martial arts and unarmed strikes, emphasizing agility and acrobatic combat skills."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WAY OF THE FOUR ELEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Way of the Four Elements adds spells to Monk abilities, enhancing their synergy with elemental forces."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WAY OF THE OPEN HAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Way of the Open Hand expands Monk attacks to include knockdown or pushing enemies, indicating a subclass specializing in crowd control and disruption."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WAY OF SHADOW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Way of Shadow makes Monks sneaky and stealthy, indicating a subclass focusing on ninja-like tactics and evasion."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPANION ANIMALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Companion animals are a key aspect of Beast Masters, living creatures that fight alongside the player, adding tactical depth to the class and enhancing party dynamics."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STEALTH ATTACKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SKILL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Stealth Attacks are a Rogue-like feature that allows for sneak attacks without provoking Opportunity Attacks, highlighting the Rogue subclass's ability to engage in unseen combat."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DASH (DOUBLE MOVEMENT)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dash (Double Movement) is a feat that Rogues gain, permitting them to move twice during their turn without using their movement, emphasizing their agility and quick maneuvering capabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISENGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Disengage is a feat all Rogues receive, allowing them to avoid provoking Opportunity Attacks when they would ordinarily be at risk, showcasing careful tactical planning in stealth and surprise attacks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HIDE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BONUS ACTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hide is a bonus action exclusive to Rogues, enabling them to become unseen behind covered or draped objects, furthering their stealth capabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SNEAK ATTACK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMBAT ACTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sneak Attack is a combat action unique to Rogues that allows dealing extra damage when they have Advantage, directly showcasing the subclass's emphasis on stealth and tactical advantage in combat.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMBAT FORM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SKILL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Combat Form is a skill that Monks learn, allowing them to harness their martial arts prowess effectively during melee combat, reflecting their focus on unarmed and weapon-based melee battles."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNARMED STRIKES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MELEE ABILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unarmed Strikes are a core ability of Monks, dealing extra damage due to their focus on martial arts and agility, signifying their status as a warrior class with proficiency in hand-to-hand combat."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DODGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REACTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dodge is a reaction skill that Monks utilize, reflecting their ability to evade attacks, a crucial aspect of their melee combat strategy."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMBAT MASTERY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEAT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Combat Mastery is a feat that Monks can choose, deepening their expertise in combat and adding bonuses to their Attack and Hit rolls, indicating an advanced level of combat proficiency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WEAPONS AND SHIELDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EQUIPMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Weapons and Shields are equipment choices for Monks, though they have a limited selection due to their focus on unarmed combat. They typically opt for weapons that complement their martial arts style, such as daggers or short swords, reflecting their focus on agility and melee prowess."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;QUARTERSTAFF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WEAPON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Quarterstaff is a popular weapon choice among Monks, fitting their combat theme and allowing them to maintain their agility while dealing damage effectively.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAYMORE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WEAPON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Claymore, a two-handed sword, is another option for Monks, reflecting their flexibility in adapting to different melee combat situations.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CROSSBOW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WEAPON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Crossbow is a ranged weapon commonly used by classes like Archer and Ranger in role-playing games."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crossbow, while not a traditional melee weapon, can be utilized by Monks for ranged combat situations, showcasing their adaptability to various combat scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RUNIC DEFENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Runic Defense is a spell available to Monks, enhancing their defensive capabilities against magical attacks, reflecting the subclass's balance between offense and defense in combat.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPELL REFLECT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Spell Reflect enables Monks to reflect incoming spells back to the caster, providing a unique defensive tool in magical combat scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"VAMPIRIC POWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Domination is a Vampiric Power potentially augmenting control over the battlefield or enemies within the Double Swing Barbarian build."&lt;SEP&gt;"Domination is a powerful top-level spell available to Paladins, offering them the ability to control creatures within 30 feet, highlighting their offensive and controlling magic capabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-38d1176dcae0322528f608fea1bb2852&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOLD MONSTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hold Monster is a powerful control spell available to Paladins, allowing them to maintain sway over a creature they control within a range, reflecting their versatile and controlling magic nature.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FROST GIANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MONSTER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Frost Giant is a monster encountered in Baldur's Gate 3, representing a formidable opponent for Paladins to showcase their offensive power and magic capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECTRAL ASSASSIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MONSTER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Spectral Assassin is a monster encountered in Baldur's Gate 3, known for its stealth and strategic combat tactics, similar to Rogue subclass's playstyle, making it relevant for comparative analysis.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANGRY HUNTSMAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MONSTER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Angry Huntsman is a monster encounterable in Baldur's Gate 3, which presents a challenge that requires feats like Disengage, aligning with Rogue's emphasis on tactical combat.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARCANE SPELLCASTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SKILL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arcane Spellcasting is a skill available to Warlocks, allowing them to cast spells of their deity's domain, showcasing the strength and academic aspect of their magic practice.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NECROMANCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Necromancy controls life and death, allowing a Wizard to manipulate undead and deal lethal damage to living foes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Necromancy is a spell focused on manipulating death and the undead, reflecting the dark and powerful themes associated with this magic-focused subclass.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f613e8154483a3a5550a5e34f2086d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BLIGHT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPELL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Blight is a spell from the Circle of the Fiend subclass, representing the demons-themed, destructive spells that offer intense damage and thematic weight to gameplay as a fiendish force.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TWIBBLES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CREATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Twibbles are disembodied creatures found in Burning Steppes, providing Rogue-like stealth opportunities and aligning with Rogue's companion and trap-setting skills.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FOREST ARCHER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CREATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Forest Archer is a monster encountered in Baldur's Gate 3, known for its elusive and stealthy nature, akin to the Rogue subclass's focus on sneak and evasion.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEPER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CREATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Leper is a monster in Baldur's Gate 3, known for its resilience and defensive capabilities, providing a test for Paladin's offensive and protective magic strategies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DUPERI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CREATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Duperi reflects the theme of decay and death, and could be an interesting monster encounter for Druids with their emphasis on nature-based magic.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f6cabdb1d59ae35e683deef01ec1d35</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLERIC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cleric is a player class in a role-playing game, typically associated with the support and healer archetype."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cleric is the healer class that prioritizes healing, with additional spells and Channel Divinity abilities to support allies in combat despite limited physical protection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f613e8154483a3a5550a5e34f2086d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bard is Google's competitor to ChatGPT, now powered by Gemini Pro, and is subject to user criticism regarding its performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bard is Google's response to ChatGPT, an AI chatbot similar in purpose, highlighting the technological developments and responses in the AI sector."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bard is a specialized class focusing on performance, charm, and social interactions, with abilities centered around Bardic Inspiration and utility/offensive spells, typically avoiding frontline combat."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bard is another player class in a role-playing game, often linked with the performer and storyteller archetype."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bard, developed by Alphabet/Google, is an example of foundational layer model provider that dominates the AI market."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7054dfe6c7b5237b9fbf24ed29804f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f613e8154483a3a5550a5e34f2086d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e293176957be772f9c55e41a57259811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25f4c1b2e2d4af4be6f14672cae06dcb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WIZARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Wizard is a player class in a role-playing game, representing the scholarly and arcane magic archetype."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wizard is known for dealing damage through magic, having the most spells and slots in the game, and specializing in spellcasting rather than melee combat."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wizard shares thematic ties with other spellcasting classes, due to its emphasis on arcane magic and knowledge.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f613e8154483a3a5550a5e34f2086d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SORCERER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sorcerer excels in social interactions and dialogue-heavy encounters, with a primary Ability of Charisma and a wide range of self-derived magic themes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sorcerer is a player class in a role-playing game, specializing in spellcasting and versatility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sorcerer is a pure caster class in Diablo 4, specializing in elemental magic."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f613e8154483a3a5550a5e34f2086d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718735513dd5c30904ba5902e9518734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f08d085ad3a68863ed96b39b8c221d7e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DRACONIC BLOODLINE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WARLOCK SUBCLASS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Draconic Bloodline is a Sorcerer subclass that infuses their magic with a dragon-based flavor, adding a unique element to their spell selection and abilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Draconic Bloodline is a Sorcerer subclass that ties the character's magic to the lore of dragons, adding a fantastical and potentially ancient power source to their spell selection.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f613e8154483a3a5550a5e34f2086d2</data>
</node>
