  <data key="d1">"Divination gives a Wizard foresight and control over random rolls, allowing strategic planning and alteration of outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Divination is a spellcaster class in a role-playing game, specializing in locating magical and mystical knowledge.</data>
