pendent is a news organization that publishes content including articles about the changing of clocks in 2023."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Independent offers a newsletter, which is suggested as a vehicle for providing lifestyle and wellness advice and updates to subscribers, including information on topics like clock changes and their effects.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Independent is the publication where Jada Pinkett Smith's interview was featured."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Independent is the publication where the article about Cole Palmer was published, highlighting its role as a news source."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Independent is the publication's name, an organization that reports on sports events including the Rugby World Cup."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Independent is a publication that publishes travel-related content, including the article about luxury ski resorts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Independent is an organization that publishes travel-related news and offers a travel email service for expert advice and discounts."</data>
