ng, on both platforms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Social media, particularly Twitter, was used as a platform to share experiences and thoughts about the aurora borealis, highlighting its communal impact and relevance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Social media refers to the platforms and methodologies of online communication, highlighted as the evolution of media tracking for Meltwater's services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Social media was utilized as a crucial platform for the viral campaign that helped facilitate the donation process for Lucas."</data>
