<node id="&quot;ETHICAL CONSIDERATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ETHICAL CONSIDERATIONS IN BOXING ARE UNDERSCORED BY THE RESPECT FIGHTERS SHOW TO EACH OTHER POST-MATCH AND THE EMPHASIS ON SPORTSMANSHIP, WHICH CONTRASTS WITH THE ROUGH COMPETITIVENESS OF THE SPORT ITSELF."</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ethical Considerations involve the moral dimensions of quantum dot research and use, including privacy, security, and consent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ethical considerations are alluded to in the discussion about the control of superintelligent machines, suggesting a broader narrative on the responsibility and moral implications of AI development within the industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ethical considerations could involve discussions on privacy, data security, or the environmental impact of smart home devices, which, while not explicitly mentioned in the text, are important in the broader context of technology adoption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ethical considerations regarding privacy, consent, and the portrayal of personal tragedies in media are important for understanding the documentary's sensitivity and responsibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ethical considerations are implied in the development and application of robotics, particularly as AI and robotics become more integrated into society and the workforce.&lt;SEP&gt;"ethical values, sportsmanship"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fd46633478af2c632e7d3e1b937b5f58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1493c087513e04c99c968b3a10278c6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6003eef8a0fcd2849f7d3dd40161e9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d460d57b29c86d7dbfee71ee9b5c47a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85c2cc8923d360f76fdb78a89b92e816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb1668f74824393873062800326b3029</data>
</node>
