  <data key="d1">"Reid Hoffman is a PayPal founder and present at the ethics board meeting, indicating his involvement in the tech industry and AI ethics.&lt;SEP&gt;"Reid Hoffman, as an investor and participant in AI discussions, may have interests aligned with effective altruism and the societal impact of technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reid Hoffman, known for co-founding LinkedIn, is also listed as a co-founder of OpenAI together with Sam Altman, highlighting the significant figures involved in the company's early days.</data>
