<node id="&quot;OPENAI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"OpenAI is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization that operates as the governing body for OpenAI, which develops generative AI systems like ChatGPT and DALL-E 3."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is a chief critic of Meta's open source AI approach but is not mentioned as a member of the AI Alliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is a company developing AI technologies, including ChatGPT, and is involved in handling data privacy concerns and addressing controversies."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is a company that develops generative AI models such as GPT-4 and ChatGPT, and is involved in expanding these services globally."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is a research institute co-founded by notable figures like Elon Musk and fellow Microsoft co-founder, which developed GPT-4 and is part of the collaborative effort to advance AI understanding and capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI started as a nonprofit aimed at AI research but later considered a for-profit approach due to commercial pressures, and faced internal disagreements over its direction and governance."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is an AI research laboratory, mentioned in the context of potential development of proprietary AI chips which could impact the broader AI ecosystem."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the company behind GPTs and ChatGPT, pushing the boundaries of AI technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the organization behind ChatGPT, a popular and widely-used AI chatbot, highlighting its role as a significant player in AI research and product development."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is actively exploring the educational applications of ChatGPT, indicating their broadening interest in its use."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is an AI research lab that has been impacted by the leadership change and the introduction of a new CEO."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is facing implications from a lawsuit related to AI systems trained on publicly available data, which impacts its ChatGPT service."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the central entity in the text, being involved in a drama affecting the generative AI industry and having proprietary models that many startups rely on."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the company behind the ChatGPT AI model and is responsible for launching the plugins for ChatGPT that extend its functionality."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the company developing ChatGPT and other AI models, mentioned in the context of updates, partnerships, and governance.&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the company where Sam Altman was CEO, and which is now experiencing a leadership transition and exploring AI applications in education."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the developer of ChatGPT, a general-purpose AI chatbot using deep learning technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the parent company of ChatGPT, responsible for the development and management of the AI technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI, despite internal changes, continues to play a key role in the ongoing discussions and research regarding the impact and governance of AI technologies like ChatGPT."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI, known for AI research, may be indirectly associated with layoffs in the tech industry as a whole."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the company behind GPT technology, indicating its role as a major player in the AI field."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the company developing generative AI technologies, facing both advancements and regulatory challenges."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the entity behind the development of GPT and ChatGPT, a significant player in the field of artificial intelligence technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is a leading AI development company that is making significant changes to its safety processes to manage risks associated with the AI it develops."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is an AI startup that held its first-ever developer conference, announcing various new products and tools."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is an organization concerned with the development and control of powerful AI models, and its stance on transparency and risk management is under discussion."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is a nonprofit organization focused on AI that has been involved in generating conflict avoidance and exploring AI agents for various tasks."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is again mentioned as the organization, which the board is trying to advance its mission of benefiting humanity, facing leadership and directional challenges."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the company at the center of the news, facing a leadership change after a board decision."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the organization at the center of the discussion, involved in API and services, and facing issues related to AI ethics and product safety."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is discussed as a company transitioning towards a product-oriented approach, expected to drive products to market more aggressively."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is an AI startup known for developing influential AI technologies like ChatGPT, GPT-4, and DALL-E 3, and is at the center of the recent events."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is the tech company from which Greg Brockman and others resigned, known for its involvement in AI and innovation."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is a nonprofit organization with a mission to achieve artificial general intelligence (AGI)."&lt;SEP&gt;"OpenAI is a leading organization in the AI field that develops models like ChatGPT, recognized in the context as a key player whose models might be subject to the new AI regulations.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-18308a2314bab43f38e105e4bcb3e3d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0eab85e959cb67db0971d34daa576b58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96f9649fc015f0cce4a173c68a88e26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d4b470676d3090373bf457c38258243&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e0fb30ac99883e9eb570243d8bff78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25f4c1b2e2d4af4be6f14672cae06dcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbf17c80c4c4da295f994266b89636ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10c4e5dc5e3453b2b2772792a15d6021&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-110a9d0daa1bc9fd14dbe5e0d3884ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff93f1a990e6b37757bfac54fd152683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a04636b49c5d8346d1ca2fd6e5201fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a31f0faa2fc575af0ba55eefe461914&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-226396bbe23d2faac70b87776260f0ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8253d1a2bf72058bff792e3c5a68bcab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2c527cb73437aecdd69c4fbe90492d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-829f521d1c52ce9db8dffc407df1f622&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2182e0b8a0614d40a339fd6984433423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ef11a4ef5adcf57f488398e41f71bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c432e4870b060135c514e316e3ab9fda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4484897d217c76b2c02299dbd324afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7e0cad18ec7c7bd598d8bf258be865&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6cd95e6bdcfccf17292147c609bd0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c6ba880c8074b9d0891e30b2b2ce3f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24840dbecae8bbf5da3e47cdee6761ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e133181534393e5d74842fabdce16be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76a178f894ad3e2596c06f40903489a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-645bcaa84c2eef4f18a63cceea3c6746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aefcc89544116a988d4c55577b06a390&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ecdc285a0b80eefa8253896814df350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fda6b758476cb34bc8123862712c5bc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a0995ce5b2454e8c155a73e56841b9a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TESLA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tesla is a company known for its electric vehicles and energy products, which partnered with OpenAI for AI advancements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tesla is an organization, co-chaired by Elon Musk, known for its work on electric vehicles and self-driving systems technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tesla is an automaker with a focus on electric vehicles, which is experiencing issues with falling margins and has a significant Cybertruck development in progress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tesla is urging for stricter fuel economy standards, potentially to one-up competitors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tesla is an EV manufacturer that is under scrutiny by the U.S. Department of Justice for various issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tesla is a company that has developed and delivered the Cybertruck, and is involved in the discussion of its safety and design features."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tesla is a company that produces electric vehicles like the Cybertruck, and is involved in discussions about its specifications and environmental impact."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tesla is an organization that produces electric vehicles, including the Cybertruck."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-61bdbe892e5c11eca8f15f89b2c47829&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aefcc89544116a988d4c55577b06a390&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ce9b512776fafae0597871daea33b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a6297f478fb5cf948db988a134ac1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48ba8cb4f76ce0b3553c05686059595a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4484897d217c76b2c02299dbd324afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08c0c808a67b73a24508ec5b4a1ada6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5285c457275e07d516b171073ad7a32d</data>
</node>
