  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"GPT-3 is a large language model developed by Microsoft and OpenAI, capable of generating text and reflecting a step towards AGI but also capable of creating misinformation, which is a topic of concern for researchers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aefcc89544116a988d4c55577b06a390</data>
</node>
