  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Advanced Placement biology test is mentioned as an example of a task that would test a language model's ability to perform critical thinking and not just regurgitate information."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Advanced Placement biology test is used as a challenge for GPT-4 to prove its capability to perform tasks requiring critical thinking in the field of science."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4d4b470676d3090373bf457c38258243&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aefcc89544116a988d4c55577b06a390</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DARIO AMODEI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dario Amodei is a researcher with ties to the effective altruist community, who opposed the commercialization under Microsoft's direction at OpenAI. He played a role in the initial founding of OpenAI and has a strong vision for AI development.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aefcc89544116a988d4c55577b06a390</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANTHROPIC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Anthropic is a high-profile AI startup known for its work in AI, particularly in language models, but it has limited open source AI projects and is not a member of the AI Alliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anthropic is a new lab co-founded by Amodei, Hoffman, Thiel, and Musk to develop AI under principles aligned with effective altruism, emphasizing strict controls and ethical considerations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anthropic is listed as a potential rival to OpenAI, being considered by customers amidst the company's turmoil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anthropic is an organization involved in AI development, such as Claude, contributing to the discussion on AI market dynamics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anthropic is an AI developer at the center of legal disputes over the use of copyrighted song lyrics for AI training."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anthropic is an AI developer involved in the creation of generative AI, participating in the dialogue about the implications of AI on copyright and creativity.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aefcc89544116a988d4c55577b06a390&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a40504a22fd87a448b95269a8d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0eab85e959cb67db0971d34daa576b58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343c65a2459dc13a3782c50288dd1ba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c6ba880c8074b9d0891e30b2b2ce3f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e0f78adc782a6f418124b6487edf251</data>
</node>
