  <data key="d2">chunk-aefcc89544116a988d4c55577b06a390</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BILL GATES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bill Gates is a co-founder of Microsoft who, despite his involvement in the company, maintains a sceptical view on the capabilities of AI, particularly its ability to perform tasks requiring critical thinking such as passing an Advanced Placement biology test."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4d4b470676d3090373bf457c38258243</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STEVE NADELLA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Steve Nadella is the CEO of Microsoft, present at the event where AI capabilities, specifically GPT-4, were being showcased and discussed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4d4b470676d3090373bf457c38258243</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTMAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Altman is a co-founder of Microsoft, who participated in the event with Gates, showcasing GPT-4's capabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Altman is recognized as a co-founder and former board chairperson of OpenAI, with other ventures such as Helion Energy and Retro Biosciences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Altman is a former executive at OpenAI, associated with the recent firing and resulting resignations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4d4b470676d3090373bf457c38258243&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbf17c80c4c4da295f994266b89636ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4484897d217c76b2c02299dbd324afe</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BROCKMAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Brockman is a co-founder of Microsoft and an OpenAI researcher who presented GPT-4 at the event, demonstrating its advanced capabilities by grading a biology test.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4d4b470676d3090373bf457c38258243</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHELSEA VOSS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chelsea Voss is an OpenAI researcher who, recognized for her achievements as a biology Olympiad medallist, participated in the event to demonstrate GPT-4's capabilities in answering complex biology questions.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4d4b470676d3090373bf457c38258243</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GPT-4&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"GPT-4 is OpenAI's flagship model, improved in version GPT-4 Turbo, central to discussions on AI advancements."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPT-4 is an advanced language model developed by Microsoft and OpenAI, showcased at the event to perform tasks beyond typical language processing, including answering an advanced biology test."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPT-4 is the model that Gemini Pro is being compared to, and is known for its AI capabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPT-4, developed by Microsoft/OpenAI, serves as another significant player in the AI market with its foundational layer services."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPT-4 represents a cutting-edge AI model, specifically mentioned as an example of a general purpose AI model."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4ecdc285a0b80eefa8253896814df350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7054dfe6c7b5237b9fbf24ed29804f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a04636b49c5d8346d1ca2fd6e5201fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d4b470676d3090373bf457c38258243&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe409d13cc6aab03a4d152630205a23c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AI SCEPTICISM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"AI Scepticism refers to the doubt or lack of belief in the capabilities of AI to perform tasks requiring human-like understanding and critical thinking, as expressed by Bill Gates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4d4b470676d3090373bf457c38258243</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CRITICAL THINKING&quot;">
