  <data key="d1">"Mastodon is a decentralized social media platform and one of the main technologies behind the fediverse; Mozilla is financially backing it."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mastodon is a decentralized social networking application that Mozilla is associated with and plans to experiment with."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mastodon is mentioned as a social network platform, highlighting its user statistics and growth challenges."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mastodon is an open-source social media platform, noted for not charging users and being an alternative to X and other social apps."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mastodon is cited as a competitor to Spill, with its own user base for comparison.&lt;SEP&gt;"Mastodon is a decentralized social network protocol and app that Flipboard is integrating with to reach a broader audience within the fediverse."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mastodon is a decentralized social networking service that runs on the ActivityPub protocol, part of the fediverse."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mastodon is recognized as the largest platform within the fediverse, demonstrating its potential for popularity and scalability."</data>
