<node id="&quot;WASHINGTON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Washington could imply a governmental body or organization that is receiving communications or making decisions, as mentioned in the context of the company board's confidence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is mentioned in the context of receiving communications, likely related to Mozilla's network discussions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is the team that the Green Bay Raiders are set to play against, where Love's performance against aggressive defense will be a key factor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington, in this context, refers to an opposing team as background information in the analysis of Devin Singletary's performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is critical in communicating strategic insights that influence the team's decisions, emphasizing its significance in the context of the mission.&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is implied as the source of communications that influence and shape the decisions of the Team, emphasizing its importance in the context of the mission."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is inferred as a source of strategic communications influencing the team's pivotal decisions, highlighting its importance to the mission's execution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is a location where sports news and matchups are discussed, indicating its relevance in the context of sports events."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is mentioned in relation to communications impacting the team's decisions during the fantasy football event."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is the football team where Terry McLaurin plays, relevant to the matchup and projections described."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is another team that made it through the season and qualified for the Playoff semifinals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is mentioned as a place where critical communications and possibly guidance for the team in Opera are received, adding a layer of real-world context to the film's setting.&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is a team whose defense is considered poor, affecting running back performances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington's incoming communications are highlighted as significant in the decision-making process for fantasy football players."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is a team that receives communications which could influence decision-making in finals for other teams like Geelong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is a university sports team that played in the Pac-12 championship, indirectly affecting Alabama's CFP chances by impacting Oregon's standing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is mentioned as the place where news is disseminated, with reporters like Larson stationed there."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington, being the location of media outlets and governmental bodies, is often central to national and international news stories, including Nobel Prize announcements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington refers to the location associated with the communications mentioned in the context of OpenAI's governance and decision-making processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is mentioned as the source of communications, relevant in the context of financial decision-making."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is one of the teams that played in the Allstate Sugar Bowl, scoring 0 points against USF."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is the opposing organization participating in the Allstate Sugar Bowl college football game."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is the city where Pastor Jesse Bradley serves his community, and it is near Seattle, reflecting its significance in the discussion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is mentioned as the place where communications with Cruise are received, indicating its involvement in the regulatory decision-making process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is the opposing team in the game mentioned, related to the Rams performance analysis."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4154c83cf0046a34404cd92056708b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af1bf255855290848f271ae386e07003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3ee966331887b2b1931bdb2e46b51b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1074aab6dbff3b99755ba4c218aec3fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e68b77424fb2b72802b14e0ec8061db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5e4605f2c2292971f7e32a0280776a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4ee4e6119b3f6d93aaf6a8ecb8bf01b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09ee6453222bd753ecc01f1915c80f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6406f9d6e705b4533df5fb61e6a3b60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44184336eae3faf7564977fd6f6d8b6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ab8bf43f563a828299483fb4d662011&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2182e0b8a0614d40a339fd6984433423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d54e1405e1f7911ccd35b3519d47d4da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d6df29dcb43c5284de435abdaa3acd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46ec8d01f0b38e3f93c14c42ce7f0b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4484897d217c76b2c02299dbd324afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a86d099cd55788febb68bb6f9dd8c6a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c19b73e6bc093b7f5c098c7ac5e459d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7001e4b476066adca787a3d4560a578b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4c72467dbf61fdaa1b8a7f4f8dc6bfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26c74bcec4c988bb1927c3a1910830f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1104b059238c7cb67d2279aa4c6f818b</data>
