<node id="&quot;INVESTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Investors are affected by the financial decisions and instability of FTX and Alameda, representing those who have stakes in the exchanges and whose assets are at risk."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investors are stakeholders in SBF's potential offerings, whose concerns and reactions are part of the broader context of SBF's downfall and impact on the market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investors are presumably the customers or shareholders affected by the actions taken under Sam Bankman-Fried's CEO leadership at FTX, now facing potential financial losses due to alleged misconduct."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investors, including Indian investors, are mentioned as having the potential to access growth in various sectors in India but are specifically advised to invest in pharmaceutical and Big Pharma for cutting-edge tech exposure, reflecting the importance of the pharma sector in investment strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investors are mentioned in connection with FTX's activities and due diligence, relevant to the case against Bankman-Fried."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investors are entities affected by FTX's financial decisions and disclosures, holding a vested interest in the company's stability and transparency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investors are individuals or entities that allocate capital with the expectation of a future financial return."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investors are entities that put money into ventures like Scalable with the expectation of growth over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"group"&lt;SEP&gt;"Investors are individuals or entities involved in financial markets, assessing and investing in stocks using various valuation methods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investors are individuals or entities allocating financial resources, reacting to market conditions in this context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investors on Flexport's board were concerned about the company's direction and performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investors are individuals or entities accumulating shares in NTPC due to its growth and restructuring plans."</data>
