<node id="&quot;DECENTRALIZATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Decentralization is a fundamental principle of cryptocurrency, emphasizing the distribution of control and removal of central authorities, a thematic element in the narrative concerning SBF's fall from grace and the crypto market's volatility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Decentralization is a key principle of the fediverse, which the entities like Flipboard, Medium, and Mozilla are aligning with in their adoption of platforms like Mastodon."&lt;SEP&gt;"Decentralization is the underlying principle of the fediverse that encourages the distribution of control and functionality across multiple, independent entities rather than centralizing it in one entity."</data>
