<node id="&quot;INNOVATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Innovation embodies the process and impact of integrating New Technology into organizational practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Innovation is a driving force in the cryptocurrency industry, pushing new developments and solutions, which is contrasted with the failures and management issues highlighted in the context of SBF's story."&lt;SEP&gt;"Innovation represents the development and application of new technologies like MXenes for environmental solutions, an important concept in the context of climate change mitigation.&lt;SEP&gt;"Innovation is mentioned as a driving force in the smart glasses industry, with the Ray-Ban Meta reflecting the ongoing technological improvements and competitive offerings in the market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Innovation is an essential principle for the evolution and sustainability of the movie industry, especially in the context of distribution and exhibition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Innovation refers to the introduction of new ideas, methods, or products within the movie industry following the abolishment of distribution restrictions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca665b45ebbfa0ff665574a91d013895&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04ef2f90e39fb40c4d821653a7704080&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2747afa6f0542e566e22bd0e728eecf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cee99c740b44fb02860f0ddbc656b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fcf42217627fbc93f1fe3da4f67854b</data>
</node>
