<node id="&quot;INVESTOR CONFIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Investor Confidence could be impacted by the legal issues faced by Trump, potentially affecting investment attitudes and behaviors in his business and political ventures.&lt;SEP&gt;"Investor confidence is the trust and belief investors have in the potential success and growth of startups, which has been shaken due to China's tech crackdown and associated geopolitical issues, influencing investment decisions and opportunities globally."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investor confidence refers to the trust and belief that investors have in the stability and growth of their investments, crucial for the cryptocurrency market and overall economic health.&lt;SEP&gt;"Investor confidence refers to the trust and belief that investors have in a company's leadership and strategic direction, which is tested during significant events such as the dismissal of a CEO."</data>
