<node id="&quot;ADAM YEDIDIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adam Yedidia is Bankman-Fried's college roommate who testified against him, expressing affection despite his legal troubles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Yedidia is a college friend and employee of Sam Bankman-Fried, who testified about conversations with Bankman-Fried regarding FTX's financial situation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Yedidia is a former college friend of Sam Bankman-Fried, mentioned as a witness for the prosecution, with a connection to Bankman-Fried's financial ventures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Yedidia is a former trader and developer at FTX who was called to testify in a trial, expressing concern over potential legal issues related to his past work."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yedidia is a former roommate of Bankman-Fried and potentially a future witness in the case."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Yedidia worked as part of the prosecution in the trial and was a former colleague and friend of Sam Bankman-Fried. He testified about his concerns regarding the bug in the code and the financial dealings within FTX. His high compensation and subsequent career change to teaching are also noted in the trial context.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f90dd524447230c0ba9f19ff45aeae94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fbf2d5f58f4b4f3b25a566059e9283e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0ce5eeb08a778c695cdba351571fcb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60262e0789b7646790d8c63276a0aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cef8862c6918d02dd1f5018cabaed6f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f44d1fb769811b62dec26a14ca8e3ba8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MARC-ANTOINE JULLIARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Julliard is a customer whose money got stuck on FTX, and his experience is central to the case."&lt;SEP&gt;"Marc-Antoine Julliard is a victim in the trial, who invested in FTX and was unable to withdraw his funds, highlighting the alleged fraudulent activities of the accused, Sam Bankman-Fried."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f90dd524447230c0ba9f19ff45aeae94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f44d1fb769811b62dec26a14ca8e3ba8</data>
</node>
