  <data key="d2">chunk-071eded978479b1eff3c3f53df35649b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEGAN GRAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Megan Gray is noted as a privacy advocate and lawyer who alleges Google manipulates search queries for ad revenue, contributing to the discussion on search ethics and transparency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-071eded978479b1eff3c3f53df35649b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DANNY SULLIVAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Danny Sullivan is a former journalist who created Search Engine Land, which is significant in the dissemination of SEO information and industry events."&lt;SEP&gt;"Danny Sullivan is previously associated with Search Engine Land and later becomes Google’s public liaison for Search, perceived as defensive and impatient by the author."&lt;SEP&gt;"Danny Sullivan is recognized as Google's official search liaison who defends the integrity of Google's search algorithms and ad systems.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57578b815c72bf50178f99f9eeb18d3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-071eded978479b1eff3c3f53df35649b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1489bd7beecdc27fb2d0638c808a8b0b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WINDOWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION/PLATFORM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Windows is referenced in relation to default search queries, placing it as a platform where user defaults and search behaviors are a topic of discussion, particularly Microsoft's challenge in setting itself as the default search engine.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-071eded978479b1eff3c3f53df35649b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SEARCH ENGINE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bing is Google's competitor and is noted for having significantly less data access compared to Google."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bing is a search engine that now integrates ChatGPT for a new user experience."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bing is mentioned as having overhauled its layout and integrated a chatbot for augmented AI explanations, highlighting its efforts in improving and personalizing its search experience to compete with Google.&lt;SEP&gt;"Bing is mentioned as an entity that Forrester has represented, which is part of the search engine industry and contrasted with Google's practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1a7e0cad18ec7c7bd598d8bf258be865&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efb2e2dfb9f20f82cd50e1467190df37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57578b815c72bf50178f99f9eeb18d3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-071eded978479b1eff3c3f53df35649b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOOGLE AS DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The default setting of Google as a search option is discussed, questioning its fairness and impact on user choice, suggesting a systemic influence on search behavior and market dynamics."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-071eded978479b1eff3c3f53df35649b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEARCH QUERIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"search queries are the inputs that Google's search system processes to find relevant information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADVERTISEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Advertisements are a part of the content served in response to search queries, which Google's system ranks and sells for monetization purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WEB DATA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Web data refers to the constantly updated information Google crawls and indexes from various sources on the internet."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CENTRAL INDEX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Central index is a large database that Google maintains, containing the information it has indexed from the web, which is used to generate search results."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEARCH MEANING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Search meaning process describes how Google's system interprets and understands the intent behind a user's search query."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MACHINE LEARNING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Machine Learning is applied in smart devices for predictive maintenance and improved functionality, not explicitly mentioned but relevant for understanding the advancement of smart technologies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Machine learning is used by Google's system to rank search results based on their relevance and quality, beyond just keyword matching."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73e9f6f39849069b2f89899db290969a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HIGH QUALITY SITES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"High quality sites are prioritized by Google's search system to ensure users receive relevant and useful information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;USER LOCATION AND WEB HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"User location and web history are used by Google to personalize search results, but the company assures it does not use this data to infer personal attributes like race or religion."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WEB &amp; APP ACTIVITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GOOGLE SETTINGS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Web &amp; App Activity is a setting within Google's account where users can control the data that Google collects about their activity on websites and apps."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEARCH QUALITY RATERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Search quality raters are independent assessors Google uses to evaluate the effectiveness of its search algorithms and processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;900,000 QUALITY TESTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process involving 900,000 quality tests is part of Google's methodology to ensure the search algorithms return appropriate and relevant results."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DATA CREATION RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The rate at which data is created on the internet, measured in zettabytes, highlights the scale of information Google must manage and index over time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a23d54bf38d273764899cf4165f487e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IROBOT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"iRobot has announced layoffs, affecting around 85 employees, which represents approximately 7% of its workforce, on February 13, 2023."&lt;SEP&gt;"iRobot is mentioned as a rival to Amazon in the context of the competitive dynamics on the marketplace for robot vacuums."&lt;SEP&gt;"iRobot is the company being acquired by Amazon and is facing competition concerns from EU regulators."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1ae225cfcd4b8b227ba9adc579d827f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d7f0cccca1431ec664c34b761b23382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47111d9cb94585064711d8c6be52ea5e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FRANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"France is a key player in the discussion and analysis of the AI rules agreement, advocating for the safeguarding of Europe's AI technology development and strategic autonomy."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is among the countries where the ChatGPT app's availability has been expanded to."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is mentioned as a country where RVC customers rely heavily on Amazon for product discovery and purchasing decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is another market where the brand has managed to grow since the experiential activation initiation."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is an organization that has progressed in the tournament, achieving a historic rout of Italy with eight tries, emphasizing their goal of winning rather than showcasing talent."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the rugby team that Ana is a part of, which performed impressively with eight tries, indicating a strong organizational effort towards winning."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e632c9bd529681a87d1431310db09cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1ae225cfcd4b8b227ba9adc579d827f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19e13cc60ae0cb08c581767daa96e1d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c139626669ba0c6ce5a5bba38457547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e0fb30ac99883e9eb570243d8bff78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1165227899625387967696e9c99c63bc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GERMANY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Germany is an organization representing Germany in soccer, which was the opponent of the USMNT in the referenced match."&lt;SEP&gt;"Germany is both a host location for Euro 2024 and a team the U.S. squad will compete against, indicating geographical and political relevance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Germany is listed as one of the countries where the ChatGPT app's accessibility has been increased."&lt;SEP&gt;"Germany is mentioned alongside France as a country where Amazon is an important channel for RVC sales."&lt;SEP&gt;"Germany is the opposing team that the USMNT played against in the friendly match."&lt;SEP&gt;"Germany is one of the countries where Scalable Capital is actively building its business."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1ae225cfcd4b8b227ba9adc579d827f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d6df29dcb43c5284de435abdaa3acd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a50735db2020d91c7ac5a1793955594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e0fb30ac99883e9eb570243d8bff78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4dbe62c9ef4aa2232edef597e8cfa5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e5e1106c65fef764fa11e9500af95cb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ITALY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Italy enacted a nationwide ban on ChatGPT use by public sector employees due to data privacy violations, reflecting global regulatory concerns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Italy is included in the list of countries where Amazon is significant for RVC sales."&lt;SEP&gt;"Italy is the location where OpenAI's access to ChatGPT has been geoblocked due to concerns over GDPR compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Italy is mentioned in the context of having a long-standing yet unmatched goalscoring record by Gigi Riva, highlighting the country's trend of not producing prolific international strikers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Italy is the opposing organization that suffered a significant defeat against France, impacted by injuries and setbacks, affecting their performance in the tournament."&lt;SEP&gt;"Italy is one of the teams that Sinner competes against, and is witnessing high-stakes matches in the Davis Cup, including the doubles decider."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e632c9bd529681a87d1431310db09cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23750810c1966328cb57988bb43d08b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1ae225cfcd4b8b227ba9adc579d827f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10c4e5dc5e3453b2b2772792a15d6021&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4fb28c129b04e73843931ac6e78955c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6cd95e6bdcfccf17292147c609bd0e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPAIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Spain is a football team that has already qualified from the Euro 2024 qualification group for Norway, highlighting the competitive challenge."&lt;SEP&gt;"Spain is included with France, Germany, and Italy as a country where Amazon's role is significant for RVC sales."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2640ab812050d3c9430e795154d0d56a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1ae225cfcd4b8b227ba9adc579d827f</data>
</node>
