<node id="&quot;PUBLIC OPINION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Public Opinion can influence the popularity and regulations of sports betting, affecting the industry's landscape and user trust."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public Opinion refers to the general sentiment of the American people, which is hinted at as being 'hungry for change', potentially influencing the dynamics within the Republican party and the broader political situation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public Opinion reflects societal attitudes and reactions towards AI technologies, which can influence policy-making and the future development of AI.&lt;SEP&gt;"Public opinion plays a role in Britney Spears' situation, as her story garners widespread attention and influences the discourse around conservatorship laws and celebrity rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public opinion refers to the collective sentiment and reaction of society towards the FTX scandal and the individuals involved, which can influence the legal and business outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public opinion can influence the enactment and shaping of AI regulations, providing insight into what residents value in terms of privacy and AI use."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public Opinion refers to the collective perception and sentiment of the general populace towards Durant's decision to join the Golden State Warriors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public opinion refers to the collective sentiment and reactions of Twitch viewers towards games, which is heavily influenced by content creators like Twitch streamers."</data>
