  <data key="d2">chunk-46cd2916b14e2a6e0e550ee312536887</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FTX USERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FTX users are central to the narrative, experiencing the effects of FTX's rapid growth and eventual financial instability as customers rely on its platform for trading."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-46cd2916b14e2a6e0e550ee312536887</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRADING PLATFORMS&quot;">
