  <data key="d2">chunk-46cd2916b14e2a6e0e550ee312536887</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELLISON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ellison is another witness whose credibility is challenged by the defense, suggesting a possible involvement in the financial misconduct."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ellison is included in the group associated with non-strategic company operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ellison is involved in the calculations and concerns regarding financial leverage and balance sheet presentation, indicating a role in financial management or oversight."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ellison is implied to hold a significant role in the past of FTX and Alameda, with her authority being questioned as she was not the CEO at relevant times."</data>
