  <data key="d2">chunk-75d1f9481798c4491cf83bde220a343e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STRATEGIC OVERSIGHT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Strategic oversight refers to the high-level planning and decision-making that is reportedly not sufficiently applied in Bankman-Fried's companies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-75d1f9481798c4491cf83bde220a343e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CEO RESPONSIBILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"CEO responsibilities encompass the strategic and financial management which appears to be neglected according to the context given."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-75d1f9481798c4491cf83bde220a343e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POLYGON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Polygon is a layer-1 blockchain that aims to enable high scalability solutions for the Ethereum network, relevant to Thunder's platform compatibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media and entertainment company that published the article about concert films and pop music fandom."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media company that compiles lists of the best entertainment, including movies and TV shows, for public consumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is an entertainment publication known for its movie reviews and recommendations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is an entertainment publication where the article about the DC movies is published."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media company that has published a guide on Diablo 4, showcasing its role as a provider of entertainment content."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media company that publishes the guide about Barbarian builds in Diablo 4."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is described as a content platform that curates a list of horror-themed movies and TV shows, with a focus on the Halloween season and a dedicated Halloween countdown calendar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is identified as a media platform that curates a Halloween-themed countdown of horror-related content."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is an organization, a media company that provides entertainment content and reviews, including the What to Watch highlights that feature the TV show Castlevania: Nocturne."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a well-regarded gaming website that publishes articles on video games and their trends."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is an entertainment media company that provides reviews and guides for gaming hardware and has staff with a wide variety of preferences and needs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media company that curates video game recommendations and reviews, aiming to help players find and enjoy games across various platforms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is an entertainment media outlet known for providing reviews, guides, and recommendations for video games, with a focus on innovation and new gaming experiences for platforms like Nintendo Switch."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media outlet that publishes content about the gaming and entertainment industries, featuring weekly roundups of deals and featured products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is an entertainment news website that curates content such as the Noirvember event, providing a platform for discussion and recommendations on movies and TV shows."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media company that publishes content about films, television, and entertainment, including movie reviews and recommendations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a platform that endorses and reviews entertainment media, in this case, Spider-Man 2."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is an entertainment media company that published the article about The Legend of Zelda."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media company that is highlighting the content coming to Netflix in November."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is an entity known for curating the best games, featured as an entertainment source for gamers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media company that publishes stories on streaming trends and news, including coverage of TwitchCon 2023."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is the platform where the article about Disney's 100th anniversary was published, representing the outlet that disseminated the critical analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a news and entertainment website where the article about Monster Hunter Now’s Halloween event was published."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media outlet providing information on entertainment and gaming hardware."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media company that published an article on Diablo 4's season 2 updates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media company covering various topics including streaming trends and news from TwitchCon."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media outlet that provides entertainment recommendations, including horror movies, as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media company that asked writers and designers about their favorite tabletop RPGs, exemplifying its focus on entertainment journalism related to gaming."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is an entertainment news platform where an article about Dropout's anniversary is discussed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is a media outlet providing entertainment news and recommendations, including highlights of the best comedy movies to watch."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polygon is an entertainment media company that endorses and provides analysis on games, among other media, as indicated by their recommendation and publication of the article."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-823060544ceae955385fee95e1e8c511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32dc652d7287fa5e46af63d09bdf445&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2e72cf36ad4708b5c22e27721982f26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd2ca0f54086ede9cead909319bf30af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd7f70048044c246a3dca27c4c612e97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4614e7ecd7fb6f30c9a94665bf27fe7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fccdf1fb430566ec57acba8ac5aa78f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-394b9c29fc2d00d93ce9d8173b62d233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dd0369694ab409e7ea5090f993a6bff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25d7fb57bc20e8896177a33eb84847f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-802f084551d9a01a17a1d6b398dfbcb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-420f7ad484102d395b1af31eb74b25aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-176f5ed1e40b2cdc164364965a0873ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33023313f8a9c43762b387f3100f7897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0dc7f087fbb6c7d7f29c2bf4214f618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c01561ab169cf55e53dd0002d0d0bc68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1432e0f605c75ce0ee8868abbff2f83d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-835769d53ba2905e28aedb8687e3ca91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ec368ad0089aa9074b9736a67d15d10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94f8534bfb581e0608105f364e92f080&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-070569aa7af7aa1b10915b3b61af6228&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fedd5b2bac48040a4a5e1f014388d923&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da113a964d7f484d84be317ff49d0316&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abdc59f1db4150d9dc860c5df7f98064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfca7fa40d1da5cedac9ffcfddc83b58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-884abe53a8dea2055d50c34d004cea38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22c263bbdd03b71b5858208577a9f401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ffcbbc94b9991e42b84574b97809a0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-442b893a326b9afbada3b3e9b9c9fb03</data>
