  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Zoom has announced layoffs of 15% of its staff, which includes 1,300 people, on February 7, 2023."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zoom, a video conferencing tool, is another company in the tech industry that has faced layoffs as the sector adjusts to changing market conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zoom, despite being profitable, also faced layoffs, showing the broad industry trend."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zoom is a technology platform that, similar to TikTok, has been utilized for work and social interactions, particularly during the pandemic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zoom is identified as a video platform that can lead to feelings of fatigue and physical strain, contributing to negative mental health outcomes when overused.</data>
