<node id="&quot;BRITNEY SPEARS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Britney Spears experiences a complex mix of emotions including shock, relief, elation, sadness, and joy upon regaining personal freedom, reflecting the deep psychological impact of her conservatorship ordeal."&lt;SEP&gt;"Britney Spears is a celebrity who has dealt with a difficult home life, public scrutiny over her body image, and a conservatorship controlled by her father affecting her personal freedom."&lt;SEP&gt;"Britney Spears is a pop star who experienced abuse in a conservatorship, leading to a complex emotional state including shock, relief, elation, sadness, and joy upon gaining freedom."&lt;SEP&gt;"Britney Spears is described as feeling vulnerable and trapped in her celebrity life, struggling with the expectations and pressures placed upon her by the public and the press."&lt;SEP&gt;"Britney Spears is Michael Cain's ex-wife, who was involved in a custody dispute and had an impact on her sons' upbringing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Britney Spears is a celebrity mother who has been dealing with conservatorship and custody issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Britney Spears is a former pop star involved in a complex relationship with Kevin Federline, including co-parenting their two teenage sons."&lt;SEP&gt;"Britney Spears is a popular American singer who has faced personal controversies, including a conservatorship controlled by her father."</data>
