  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conservatorship is identified as a legal arrangement that further restricts Britney Spears' freedom and contributes to her regurgitation of childlike behaviors and dehumanization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conservatorship refers to the legal arrangement in which Britney's parents exert control over her life and career, leading to humiliating situations and the disposal of personal items."&lt;SEP&gt;"The conservatorship is a legal mechanism that controlled Britney Spears' personal and financial matters. Its dissolution marks a significant event in her life, reflecting her struggle for autonomy."&lt;SEP&gt;"The conservatorship is an organization that legally restricted Britney Spears' personal and financial freedom for 13 years, controlled by her father."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conservatorship refers to the legal measure under which Jamie Spears took control over Britney Spears' assets and personal life following her mental health breakdown, lasting from 2008 until her release from it in 2021."</data>
