<node id="&quot;POINT SPREADS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GAME_TYPE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Point Spreads are handicaps set by sportsbooks to level the playing field in betting, awarded to the handicapping team based on the margin of victory or defeat."&lt;SEP&gt;"Point Spreads are odds set by sportsbooks that indicate the margin of victory a team must win by to cover a bet. They are commonly used in sports like football and horse racing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Point spreads are adjustments made to the final score of a sports event to level the playing field between teams of different skill levels, important for betting on underdogs and favorites."&lt;SEP&gt;"Point Spreads set a number of points the favored team must win by to cover, impacting betting odds and the betting strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;"Point spreads set a margin of victory or loss, which affects the bet outcome."</data>
