  <data key="d1">"Diane Bazella is an adoptive mother who spent 40 years searching for her biological mother, feeling a deep desire to understand her origins and establish a connection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diane Bazella is someone who found out about being switched at birth and is now forming unconditional relationships after a long period of uncertainty and grief."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc9c19b26cdf403f6dad79c9e0986435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-744e9c97a6d45202a9b9e56ec2e46f00</data>
