</node>
<node id="&quot;KELLY JEAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Kelly Jean is a name that was mistakenly identified as Diane Bazella's birth name, representing a key piece of the mistaken identity puzzle."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kelly Jean is the original name of the woman who was thought to be Bazella's biological mother, as discovered from public birth records."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bc9c19b26cdf403f6dad79c9e0986435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-744e9c97a6d45202a9b9e56ec2e46f00</data>
