  <data key="d2">chunk-744e9c97a6d45202a9b9e56ec2e46f00</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BIRTH CERTIFICATE ERROR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The birth certificate listed Diane Bazella as Kelly Jean, which is part of the core misunderstanding that led to the discovery of her being switched at birth."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-744e9c97a6d45202a9b9e56ec2e46f00</data>
</node>
