</node>
<node id="&quot;PROFESSIONAL DEVOTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The devotion to making the most of the time they have together, possibly referring to their professional or personal pursuits, shows the mutual commitment Diane Bazella and Sherri Nordlie Geerts have in their relationship."</data>
