<node id="&quot;FAN ENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fan Engagement encompasses the activities and reactions of the spectators, which can influence the atmosphere of the game and potentially the performance of the players through crowd noise and support or pressure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan Engagement involves the efforts to interact and create excitement among the supporters of a football club."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan Engagement refers to the various techniques used by sportsbooks and sports teams to interact with and retain their fan base, often through social media, events, and promotions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan engagement is a strategy used by sportsbooks to create interaction with bettors, often through promotional events and bonuses related to sporting events."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan engagement strategies often include sponsorship opportunities, such as jersey naming rights, to enhance fan experience and generate additional revenue for the teams and leagues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan engagement encompasses how fans interact with NASCAR, which may be affected by changes in media rights and deal execution strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan engagement encompasses the actions and emotional involvement of sports fans during significant events like the NBA and NFL Christmas Day games."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan engagement encompasses the interactions and experiences of the spectators and fans during the game, from cheering to sports betting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan Engagement refers to the active participation and interest of fans, such as betting, in sports events."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan engagement is implied through the anticipation of games and the sharing of picks, signifying the level of interest and participation from the sports community around Thanksgiving Week.&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan engagement includes following sports news, setting alerts, and reacting to the outcomes of matches, as seen in the use of The Guardian app by viewers.&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan Engagement looks at how bettors and sports fans interact with betting platforms, including promotions and social betting elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan engagement is a key aspect of streaming, where viewers interact with streamers through chat and other communication tools, sharing their enthusiasm and building a connection beyond the content itself."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fan Engagement includes how fans interact with the game and team, affected by live updates, and how the media coverage influences their experience.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-39ba1b1acb04e3d5c71b9427bb3f8d9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a60e44bee8114aed3f5df987a9a5c7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f483d5705ac115853584a43aa8139b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4703521220754dbad52c3aa817b19183&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ed5b7940a905a326304c1667738a001&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-332853d9821c4ebda4ec8881d1e07109&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f201624bfb9c0708449a2518b2e93dcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb17d201ddbf2df40a75867b7f3ab831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b14f1be9ccc464fa157f30bdf693275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c3fa4df446d540e66a345dfa29299ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b8d05914230b4d45b86027af874aa45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb33c1f0aa82728f2e53535b9161760a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f944889d0de2b6426383aec92376ef51</data>
