</node>
<node id="&quot;VIRTUAL SPORTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INNOVATIVE BETTING"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Virtual Sports are simulations of real games that bettors can bet on, typically available on online betting platforms, offering unique betting opportunities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virtual sports offer innovative betting options in the form of simulated events, where users can bet on virtual versions of sports games.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4703521220754dbad52c3aa817b19183</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ESPORTS BETTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Esports Betting is an emerging aspect of sports wagering that focuses on betting within the realm of competitive video gaming, including within the NBA Esports context.&lt;SEP&gt;"Esports Betting is the act of placing bets on competitive video games, which has been growing as a popular sector within the sports betting industry."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ed5b7940a905a326304c1667738a001</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WAGERING LIMITS AND BANKROLL MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
