  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HANDICAP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Handicap is a system used in sports betting to adjust the odds of a team or player to account for the difficulty of achieving a victory, thereby leveling the playing field and extending betting opportunities.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MONEYLINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING TYPE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Moneylines are betting lines set by sportsbooks on the outcome of a sports event, typically found on horse racing, football, and basketball games.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POINT RATE SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING STRATEGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Point Rate System is a method used in sports betting to assign point values to different types of point spreads, affecting the payout for different betting combinations.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TOTAL GOALS SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING STRATEGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Total Goals System is a method of betting in soccer markets that involves predicting the exact number of goals scored in a game as the outcome."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BETTING ON THE SPREAD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Betting On The Spread is a popular betting strategy that involves placing bets against the spread, which is the point margin set by sportsbooks for a game."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BETTING EXCHANGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Betting Exchange is an online platform where bettors can place wagers on odds provided by other users, a feature commonly found on betting aggregator websites."&lt;SEP&gt;"Betting exchange is an online platform that offers a marketplace for sports bettors, including proposition bets, laying out odds, and facilitating bets."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-67daf770ccf4719319d553ddb9ca6c71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULAR SEASON STATISTICS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regular Season Statistics refer to the performance data of sports teams during the official seasons, which bettors may use to inform their betting decisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLAYOFFS AND FINALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Playoffs and Finals are series of games determining the champion of a sports league, garnering significant attention and wagering interest from bettors.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TOTO HK&quot;">
