  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANIMAL UNITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Animal Units are measurement units used in racing, particularly thoroughbred horse racing, to estimate the speed and potential victory margin of horses in races."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPORTSBOOK BONUSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROMOTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sportsbook Bonuses are incentives provided by betting sites to attract and retain customers, which can include cash, free bets, or other rewards tied to betting activity.&lt;SEP&gt;"Sportsbook Bonuses are offers and incentives provided by betting sites to attract and retain users, including signup and re-deposit bonuses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sportsbook Bonuses are offers from betting sites to attract punters, important for promotional strategies and bettor engagement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sportsbook Bonuses are promotional offers provided by sportsbooks to new or existing customers, often in the form of free bets, deposit matches, or other incentives."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5774b26ddfa61c3150551bd35832271b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b9f6bff577cda3d0f9deba6eb8ae551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ed5b7940a905a326304c1667738a001</data>
