<node id="&quot;VIGORISH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vigorish, also known as juice or commission, is the fee charged by bookmakers to sports bettors, influencing the odds and potential payouts on bets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vigorish, also known as juice, is the fee or commission charged by sportsbooks on bets, acting as their rake or profit margin."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-07f045324ec2808225509112992b73e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
