  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUTURES BETTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING TYPE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Futures Betting is a type of betting where bettors predict the outcome of an event before it takes place, commonly used in horse racing and American football.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6591af99296b06f81f0c8ad61a88b03</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPS BETTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING TYPE"</data>
