  <data key="d2">chunk-13177b3a00c03568bfa4c1f94b997728</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVER/UNDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Over/Under bets involve predicting whether the combined score of a game will be over or under a posted total, commonly used in team sports like basketball and football.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13177b3a00c03568bfa4c1f94b997728</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLAYER PROP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Player Prop allows bettors to wager on individual collegiate athlete statistics, such as touchdown passes or three-pointers, during games."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13177b3a00c03568bfa4c1f94b997728</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSENSUS ODDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consensus Odds are an average of the various odds offered by different sportsbooks, representing a general market view."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13177b3a00c03568bfa4c1f94b997728</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUTURES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Futures encompass long-term bets on games and events like season wins and MVPs, extending beyond single-game wagers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13177b3a00c03568bfa4c1f94b997728</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARLAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Parlay involves combining multiple bets, such as point spreads or totals, within one wager. Success requires all included bets to win for the parlay to pay out.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13177b3a00c03568bfa4c1f94b997728</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Juice, also known as vigorish, is the commission charged by bookmakers to handle bets, affecting the odds offered to bettors."</data>
