</node>
<node id="&quot;PUSH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BETTING TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Push occurs when neither the bettor nor sportsbook wins a bet, typically when the predicted outcome matches the actual result precisely.&lt;SEP&gt;"Push is a specific outcome in a bet in which neither the bettor nor the sportsbook wins, resulting in the return of the original stake."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-07f045324ec2808225509112992b73e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13177b3a00c03568bfa4c1f94b997728</data>
