owl presented by Prudential, scoring 14 points against Alabama."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michigan is the football program under investigation for alleged sign-stealing and is considered to be moving forward despite the controversy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michigan is the subject of scrutiny and potential sanctions due to alleged scouting activities."</data>
