<node id="&quot;APPLE WATCH ULTRA 2&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Apple Watch Ultra 2 is a product from Apple, recommended as the best Apple Watch for adventurers, with features like a siren alert, dive meter, and night mode."&lt;SEP&gt;"Apple Watch Ultra 2, an adventurer-friendly model with a focus on outdoor features and sale price reduced to $739, highlighting its unique siren and other functionalities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Apple Watch Ultra 2 is a rugged smartwatch designed for outdoor activities, featuring advanced technology suitable for various sports and adventures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Apple Watch Ultra 2 is highlighted as a smartwatch favored for outdoor sports, featuring a bright 3,000-nit display, the latest S9 chip, and the ultra-wideband chip for precise location of a phone, making it suitable for users heavily involved in outdoor sports."</data>
