  <data key="d1">"Digital Distribution encompasses the platforms and methods through which music is distributed and consumed online, playing a crucial role in the rise of independent artists and changed dynamics in the industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Digital Distribution encompasses the way many of the mentioned movies are made accessible to viewers, through platforms like Netflix and Mubi, for rental or purchase.</data>
