<node id="&quot;GENRE BLENDING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Genre Blending denotes the mixing of different genres within a single film, which can be inferred from the Barbenheimer phenomenon and the diversity mentioned on Polygon's list.&lt;SEP&gt;"Genre Blending illustrates how comedies can combine various genres, such as romance and sports, to create unique and engaging entertainment as exemplified by the plot of The Road to El Dorado."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-394b9c29fc2d00d93ce9d8173b62d233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd7f70048044c246a3dca27c4c612e97</data>
