<node id="&quot;PANDEMIC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pandemic led to increased record sales for Discogs due to lockdowns and stimulus checks, creating a sales bubble that has since potentially declined due to raised fees and shipping costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The pandemic's listless anxious days in 2020 provided a backdrop for the reevaluation of black narratives, influencing the subjects and reception of Mitchell's photography."</data>
