</node>
<node id="&quot;ONLINE VINYL MARKET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Online Vinyl Market encompasses various digital platforms, including Discogs, where sellers can offer vinyl records, playing a crucial role in the recent sales trends and challenges.</data>
