</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER BEHAVIOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consumer Behavior denotes the changes in how consumers shop for and purchase vinyl records, influenced by the pandemic and shifting economic conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumer Behavior influences the organizations' products and services, affecting their market strategies and performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consumer behavior is a critical factor in e-commerce success, particularly how consumers respond to discounts, technology usage, and shopping trends during peak sales events."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed471f99013d275490ebe0a1d8fa3788&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20b24696cec2e5f955ed6228a4221e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-938a9e98feea80f4d58ec2bfdd445ade</data>
</node>
