  <data key="d1">"Community sentiment encompasses the feelings and feedback of the Discogs user community, reflecting overall dissatisfaction and alienation due to recent changes and lack of support."&lt;SEP&gt;"Community sentiment refers to the overall feelings and opinions of Twitch's creator community, especially in relation to company policies and changes."</data>
