<node id="&quot;GENERATIVE AI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Generative AI is a field of artificial intelligence that is being developed and leveraged by companies like Apple, with implications for future products and services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generative AI refers to artificial intelligence technology that can generate new content based on prompts, as exemplified by ChatGPT and similar models like GPT."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generative AI is introduced as a new factor disrupting work and changing future job landscapes, suggesting a need for adaptability in career planning."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generative AI is a newer technology being implemented in organizations for efficiency with a focus on measuring return on investment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generative AI refers to systems, such as ChatGPT, that can generate content based on the input they receive, which is central to the discussion on data usage and privacy under ADMT rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generative AI represents a cutting-edge technology with potential to transform various business processes and efficiencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generative AI refers to advanced AI models, like ChatGPT, capable of creating realistic content, which raises concerns about their role in misinformation and the need for responsible development and disclosure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generative AI refers to AI systems capable of generating content that may mimic or replicate human creativity, raising concerns about its impact on the human creative class within the music industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generative AI refers to AI that can create new content, such as music or art, which is at the heart of the text's discussion on the exploitation and control of creative works.&lt;SEP&gt;"Generative AI refers to artificial intelligence systems designed to create new content or concepts, emphasizing the enhancement of such systems while clarifying that they do not aim to replace human creativity.&lt;SEP&gt;"Generative AI pertains to a class of artificial intelligence systems capable of creating new content, which is central to the regulation debate and industry focus.&lt;SEP&gt;"Generative AI is an advanced application of machine learning discussed by Brady, with potential in robotics for various purposes including the creation of synthetic packages and aiding in robotic design and decision-making."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-231a0d2dadfd30869066aa3ca72d77b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f563a19b9f1a4676d71f7d2093367fe6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ecdc285a0b80eefa8253896814df350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c432e4870b060135c514e316e3ab9fda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a04636b49c5d8346d1ca2fd6e5201fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6a32626c7394869f547f4ee6ccac459&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f39e09edbc75a59db84950e68ed24a79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c6d7259cf4321bf0a7659f23e160b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343c65a2459dc13a3782c50288dd1ba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-093cf090bf59608f296a4adc0fb60478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-131ffbf97fa24d6c9fde235f6b9dcc75</data>
</node>
