  <data key="d0">"CULTURAL SIGNIFICANCE OF BOXING IS SEEN IN ITS HISTORICAL IMPACT, THE PERSONAL STORIES OF BOXERS, AND ITS ROLE AS A SPECTACLE THAT CAPTIVATES GLOBAL AUDIENCES, CONTRIBUTING TO ITS SOCIETAL IMPORTANCE."</data>
