  <data key="d2">chunk-8d5bbd85d7503167d8fa3c953d58a4ae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNREALISTIC EXPECTATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unrealistic expectations refer to the pressure parents may feel to create an overly ambitious list of Christmas activities or gifts, which can lead to disappointment and stress if not managed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d5bbd85d7503167d8fa3c953d58a4ae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MOM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FAMILY MEMBER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mom is a parent who may struggle with maintaining a balance between Christmas preparations and self-care, often becoming a martyr."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mom is part of Plauché's immediate family, emphasizing the importance of familial relationships in the context of gift-giving."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3b96146e4ac12d561920f8927dd9ef10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5bbd85d7503167d8fa3c953d58a4ae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GRINCHY GRIPING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Grinchy griping refers to the habit of parents venting their holiday frustrations loudly to their children, which can lead to children feeling responsible for the stress and upset."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d5bbd85d7503167d8fa3c953d58a4ae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WISH LIST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A wish list is traditionally a list of desired Christmas gifts from children, but Keeley criticizes when it becomes solely about receiving without an equivalent focus on giving."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Wish List represents the collaborative process of deciding on gifts, which is supposed to balance giving and receiving."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0ba4dc4c1b6dda189f4d2e48e1107700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5bbd85d7503167d8fa3c953d58a4ae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;KEELEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Keeley is an individual promoting the concept of balance in children's gift-giving, encouraging creative and imaginative approaches over materialism."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0ba4dc4c1b6dda189f4d2e48e1107700</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Parents are concerned about their children's use of Meta platforms and their lack of action when addressing these concerns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parents are guided by Keeley to collaborate with their children in creating gift lists, emphasizing imagination and family love over simply spending."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parents are responsible for setting up kids’ voice ID and managing access to features like 'Explore with Alexa' on communal family devices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parents would interact with or report to the COPPA Enforcement Team concerning Meta's compliance with children's data privacy regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parents are implied as guardians and decision-makers regarding their children's technology usage, crucial to the discussion on managing said usage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27c22c843cc603b7f87df8b3c567de08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea7577a58ef4b1e6b4db468d7a08471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ba4dc4c1b6dda189f4d2e48e1107700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b7c047bd9683ee53f6a1448a9eb34ea</data>
</node>
