<node id="&quot;PROJECTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FANTASY_SPORTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Projections are educated guesses about future events or outcomes, significant for strategic planning and betting.&lt;SEP&gt;"Projections in fantasy football involve predicting the future performance of players based on various statistical models, key in building a competitive fantasy team."&lt;SEP&gt;"Projections involve predictions and estimations of player performance metrics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Projections refer to the anticipated statistical performance of players, which are important for fantasy football team management and strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;"Projections refer to predictions or expectations of player performances in the draftkings lineup.&lt;SEP&gt;"Projections are likely statistical predictions of player performances, crucial for making informed choices in fantasy sports lineups.</data>
