</node>
<node id="&quot;EVA DOESCHER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eva Doescher is a licensed clinical social worker in Nebraska who has shared positive feedback on the Caring Contacts program, emphasizing its impact on patient and family connections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abe0f960382cde86d0a47df03e530050</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCHALLEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Schalley is the spokesperson for Children's Nebraska's Caring Contacts program, advocating for its expansion and offering insights into its effectiveness and purpose."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abe0f960382cde86d0a47df03e530050</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITTEN COMMUNICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WRITTEN COMMUNICATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Written notes from social workers in the Caring Contacts program serve as tangible symbols of support, making the high-tech world's impersonal interactions more meaningful and impactful for patients and families."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abe0f960382cde86d0a47df03e530050</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEEN SUICIDE PREVENTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TEEN SUICIDE PREVENTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Caring Contacts program's approach, especially the use of cards, could be instrumental in suicide prevention by providing tangible reminders of support and worth at critical moments for teens."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abe0f960382cde86d0a47df03e530050</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;KINSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"KINSHIP"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The act of teens and their families hanging up, reading, and sharing the personal notes helps foster a sense of kinship and support within the family unit, which is important during times of crisis."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abe0f960382cde86d0a47df03e530050</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MENTAL WELLNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MENTAL WELLNESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The overall goal of the Caring Contacts program is to contribute to the mental wellness of patients and their families by establishing a supportive and caring environment during emergency care."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abe0f960382cde86d0a47df03e530050</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SOCIAL WORKER-PATIENT CONNECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL WORKER-PATIENT CONNECTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Caring Contacts program enhances the connection between social workers and patients, ensuring that interactions leave a lasting, positive impression that extends beyond the emergency department."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abe0f960382cde86d0a47df03e530050</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIRST RESPONDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FIRST RESPONDERS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"First responders, like social workers, use the principles of the Caring Contacts program to establish a compassionate first interaction with patients, which is crucial in establishing trust and providing effective support."</data>
