</node>
<node id="&quot;CAREGIVER SUPPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CAREGIVER SUPPORT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The program indirectly supports caregivers of patients by ensuring that they receive clear, deliberate communication and support messages, which can help alleviate their concerns and stress during a crisis."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abe0f960382cde86d0a47df03e530050</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMERGENCY CARE ENVIRONMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EMERGENCY CARE ENVIRONMENT"</data>
