  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Artificial Intelligence Industry is the broader sector where the technologies and legislative discussions are taking place, indicating the market and economic context of AI regulation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Artificial Intelligence industry is the broader field where the AI regulations discussed would apply, representing all companies and technologies involved in AI development and implementation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a04636b49c5d8346d1ca2fd6e5201fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feec4bb36bedcf009ab1afa8484aa0db</data>
