  <data key="d1">"Documentary evidence refers to the internal documents and communications, such as the 2019 email, that became public during the trial and were available to both parties, revealing details of the case."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f812fe7c8b6ca1ce43ad8986b05a7fef</data>
</node>
