</node>
<node id="&quot;LEAGUE OF LEGENDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"League of Legends is a popular esports game with a strong community, the context of its balanced season being mentioned reflecting the game's social importance."&lt;SEP&gt;"League of Legends is mentioned as a specific product affected by Google's anti-competitive actions, with Riot initially planning to distribute it independently."&lt;SEP&gt;"League of Legends is mentioned as an example of the large-scale, high-pressure online game that creators often feel compelled to stream and play."</data>
