  <data key="d2">chunk-f812fe7c8b6ca1ce43ad8986b05a7fef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNBUNDLED PAYMENT SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An unbundled payment system is described as a fairer payment method that smaller developers could use instead of the 30% fee enforced by Google, as discussed with Spotify's 4% fee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f812fe7c8b6ca1ce43ad8986b05a7fef</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPETING STORES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MARKET CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Competing stores refer to alternative app store platforms that developers might use or create as an alternative to Google's Play Store, relevant in discussions about competition and market fairness."</data>
