  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"1999 US v. Microsoft antitrust trial is referenced as a historical legal event, providing context for a quote about "licking the cookie," which symbolizes acquiescence or compliance in a business setting."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-97e661d01459ff3bc6d4add99ce21553</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STEAM DECK OLED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Steam Deck OLED is a gaming laptop with upgraded hardware, including Wi-Fi 6E, a dedicated Bluetooth module, improved haptics, and a better touchscreen, representing the technological advancement of the device."&lt;SEP&gt;"Steam Deck OLED is a portable gaming console with enhancements over the original model, including a more efficient OLED screen, longer battery life, and a faster Wi-Fi, serving as a portable gaming PC."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Steam Deck OLED is the product being reviewed, featuring upgrades like an OLED screen, improved battery life, and better performance components."&lt;SEP&gt;"The availability of the Steam Deck OLED on Nov. 16 represents a product launch event for this iteration of the gaming laptop."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6caab48b5a0a481883dca5f050484463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7d18ee3e795fba2189434b856857270&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-112e1439a6a907f08bfa2f8064a6934e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HDR OLED DISPLAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The OLED screen of the Steam Deck OLED is described with features such as a wider P3 color gamut, pure blacks, and high peak brightness, improving the visual experience compared to the original LCD screen."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b7d18ee3e795fba2189434b856857270</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BATTERY LIFE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Battery Life indicates how long earbuds or headphones can operate on a single charge, which is crucial for user convenience."&lt;SEP&gt;"Battery Life is a concern for users of portable devices such as smart glasses, with the Ray-Ban Meta noted for improved battery life but with room for further enhancement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Battery life has been improved by 30-50% in the Steam Deck OLED compared to the original Steam Deck, indicating a significant enhancement in the device's operational longevity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Battery life is a key aspect of the Steam Deck OLED, with claims of a significant 30 to 50 percent improvement, affecting user experience and gameplay capacity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Battery life is mentioned as a specification for the Microsoft Xbox controller, with a range provided and the suggestion of purchasing a rechargeable battery pack dock for convenience."&lt;SEP&gt;"Battery life is a critical performance metric discussed for Meta's smart glasses, providing users with an idea of usage expectations in different scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;"Battery life is a product attribute that is quantified for different gaming headsets, indicating longevity on a single charge."&lt;SEP&gt;"Battery life of the smart glasses has been improved according to the reviewer, indicating an enhancement in the product's performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Battery Life is a significant feature discussed, especially for portable devices like the Tribit StormBox Micro 2, with the aim to provide extended use without the need for frequent charging.&lt;SEP&gt;"Battery life, while not explicitly mentioned, is implied in the context as a concern for travelers carrying devices like phones and laptops, and thus is relevant for products such as the Lumesner carry-on and Sonos Roam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Battery Life is a critical feature for wireless earbuds and headsets, indicating how long they can operate before requiring a recharge, which was noted for the JLab Go Air Pop and Logitech G535 models."&lt;SEP&gt;"Battery Life indicates the endurance of earbuds and smartwatches in terms of hours of operation, with Beats Fit Pro offering up to nine hours and Apple Watch Ultra boasting remarkable battery life due to its larger size, making them reliable for extended use without frequent recharging.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-024f8b28d8a746c5e2e63d8c411e5650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6caab48b5a0a481883dca5f050484463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca665b45ebbfa0ff665574a91d013895&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abdc59f1db4150d9dc860c5df7f98064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-190c4a227b18304bad84f978960550d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d259d8984216c596cf9477bcdaff0892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7d18ee3e795fba2189434b856857270&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea2060e55b58fc9eaf22b36edafc0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f78dd9d0d5ae5e7c919bc273b128d725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5c74e8ac9fd67c6f70804c848b7120&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45301fb5a95549f1651efbffbf70d6ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b898230fc018d67a517f9e8dddd8408e</data>
