<node id="&quot;ARNOLD SCHWARZENEGGER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arnold Schwarzenegger is a celebrity parent who describes himself as having a disciplined, tough-love approach to parenting, likening his style to a "drill instructor." He shares four children with his ex-wife Maria Shriver and a son with Mildred Baena, a former housekeeper. He emphasizes the importance of learning through failure and the consequences of not adhering to rules, as illustrated by an anecdote about his daughter Katherine."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arnold Schwarzenegger is a renowned actor with a prolific career, who also appeared in the documentary about his life in Wingwomen."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arnold Schwarzenegger is a star featured in a documentary starring Sylvester Stallone."</data>
