<node id="&quot;REESE WITHERSPOON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reese Witherspoon adds to the film's star-studded cast, playing a role in the unfolding crime drama."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reese Witherspoon is an Oscar-winning actress and a mom of three, who shares her eldest children with her ex-husband Ryan Phillippe. She advocates for parents to allow their children to experience failure as a valuable learning tool, relating personal experiences of her own school suspension to this philosophy. She also acknowledges the complexities of raising children in the public eye, potentially dealing with gratitude for their fame and wealth.</data>
