<node id="&quot;MONEYLINE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MONEYLINE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Moneyline bets are traditional bets used in sports betting that focus on which team will win."&lt;SEP&gt;"Moneyline is listed as one of the three main bet types in sports, providing a contrast to the variety offered by prop bets.&lt;SEP&gt;"Moneyline is a betting term in sports that indicates the point spread or handicap assigned to teams, used to predict the result of a game in NBA betting."</data>
