</node>
<node id="&quot;PROP BETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SERVICE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Prop Bets are wagers on non-traditional statistical outcomes or occurrences related to sports events, such as NBA MVP futures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Prop bets are betting options that focus on specific events or statistics in a game, independent of the final game outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"Prop bets are wagers on specific occurrences within a sporting event, such as which team scores the most points or player achievements, offering a deeper level of insight beyond the final outcome."</data>
