<node id="&quot;PLAYER PROPS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Player Props are bets placed on individual players’ performances or outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Player Props are betting options on individual player statistics, such as total hits or strikeouts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Player props are bets on individual player statistics or actions during sporting events, with most sportsbooks voiding the bet if the player doesn't play, unless they do participate in the game at least once."&lt;SEP&gt;"Player Props are wagers that focus on individual player statistics during a game, including points, rebounds, assists, and three-point field goals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Player props enable bettors to place wagers on individual player outcomes, such as points scored or games won, illustrating the personalized betting opportunities provided by sports betting apps."</data>
