<node id="&quot;DINOSAURS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANISM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dinosaurs became the dominant group on Earth after the P-T extinction event, benefiting from the drop in atmospheric oxygen levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"The presence of teenage dinosaurs in Goodbye Volcano High introduces a unique fantastical element to the high school setting, blending the mundane with the mythical and impacting the game's thematic exploration of coming-of-age and existential threats."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-128f2607f51dab7bc57e5525a3e07b3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8cb6655fd17d00c0d51e7fddac5d774</data>
