  <data key="d1">"Music Business Worldwide is a category and publisher of the report, positioning itself as a news source for the music industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Music Business Worldwide is a publication that discusses the music industry and Hipgnosis Songs Fund's activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Music Business Worldwide is the publisher and source of the article discussing Iñigo Quintero and Believe's success with Si No Estás, relevant to the topic at hand."&lt;SEP&gt;"Music Business Worldwide is the publishing platform where the discussion about the music industry and various initiatives, like those of Ice Spice and The Beatles Now And Then, took place."&lt;SEP&gt;"Music Business Worldwide is the publisher of the article discussing HSF's valuation and transaction issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Music Business Worldwide is an organization that publishes commentaries and analyses on entertainment events, including those involving AI technologies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Music Business Worldwide is the entity that published an article analyzing the context behind the major music industry talking point of YouTube's 'Dream Track' experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Music Business Worldwide is an organization that operates platforms globally and deals with complex matters in the music industry, emphasizing ownership."&lt;SEP&gt;"Music Business Worldwide is the publication where the article about Hipgnosis Songs Fund is featured."</data>
