  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Capitol Music Group is a key pillar of Universal Music Group, where Jubelirer is leading a turnaround and driving success."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capitol Music Group is described as a company that has managed to re-energize and regain market share through modernization and a focus on artist diversity, particularly in hip-hop and R&amp;B."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capitol Music Group is involved in the music industry collaboration and is expected to have artists like Lil Yachty and Offset."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capitol Music Group, under which Taylor Swift signed, is working towards increasing diversity and women representation within the label's senior ranks."</data>
