  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ice Spice is a musical artist known for her lyrics, style, and strategic collaborations, and gaining significant attention in the US and globally."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ice Spice is a rising artist in the Capitol Music Group roster, noted for global success and chart-topping singles.&lt;SEP&gt;"Ice Spice is an artist group that is part of the Capitol Music Group's strategy to diversify and expand its influence within the music industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ice Spice is described as a strong woman with a potential global superstar status, who has aligned with other strong women and is growing in popularity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ice Spice is highlighted as an artist who benefits from the international strategy and brand building, recognized globally despite not having released a debut album yet.&lt;SEP&gt;"Ice Spice is mentioned as an act that CMG continues to work with, indicating an event or ongoing project related to this music group."</data>
