  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Universal Music Group is a key player in the music industry engaging with copyright law issues related to AI."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universal Music Group is a major player in the music industry, involved in discussions about AI and copyright issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universal Music Group is a multinational music corporation that has been involved in the production and distribution of Taylor Swift's music, including her album '1989'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universal Music Group is the parent company of Capitol Music Group, where Michelle Jubelirer serves as a significant leader and the Chief Executive Officer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universal Music Group is the third major global recording company featured in TikTok Music's catalog."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universal Music Group is another label within the major and has offered a limited license to 'Dream Track' experiment."</data>
