<node id="&quot;GOOGLE PIXEL BUDS PRO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Google Pixel Buds Pro are high-quality wireless earbuds with punchy bass, good ANC, and touch controls, available at a reduced price during Prime Day for Android users."&lt;SEP&gt;"Google Pixel Buds Pro are wireless earbuds from Google, offered at a notable discount during the Black Friday sale."&lt;SEP&gt;"Google Pixel Buds Pro wireless earbuds are offered at a substantial Black Friday discount, appealing to audio-conscious Android users."&lt;SEP&gt;"Google Pixel Buds Pro are noise-canceling earbuds that provide excellent sound quality and battery life, with features like multipoint Bluetooth connectivity, head-tracking spatial audio, and easy access to settings. They are particularly suitable for Pixel phone owners, with a sale price of around $119.99 at Amazon, Walmart, and Best Buy, after an $80 discount.&lt;SEP&gt;"Google Pixel Buds Pro are wireless earbuds with tight Android OS integration, offering decent ANC and sound, priced at $115 with a $50 discount currently.&lt;SEP&gt;"Google Pixel Buds Pro are regarded as excellent earbuds, particularly for Android users, with comfortable wear and impressive battery life."&lt;SEP&gt;"Google Pixel Buds Pro offers ANC and V-shaped sound, integrates with Pixel phones, with upcoming firmware improvements, and a comfortable fit, available at a discount, suitable for Android users."</data>
