  <data key="d2">chunk-abdc59f1db4150d9dc860c5df7f98064</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OPEN SOURCE PLATFORMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY COLLABORATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Open Source Platforms might refer to initiatives that allow developers to share and collaborate on controller software, driving innovation and adaptability in the gaming industry."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abdc59f1db4150d9dc860c5df7f98064</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;E-COMMERCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"E-Commerce is mentioned as a means by which gamers can purchase gaming controllers, highlighting the importance of online retail and digital marketplaces in the gaming industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"E-commerce refers to the buying and selling of goods and services through the internet, which is the primary industry Deft's search solution is designed to serve. It encompasses online furniture and home décor, which are the initial focus of Deft's search capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;"E-commerce is the buying and selling of goods and services online, and its rapid growth is transforming traditional retail markets and consumer habits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abdc59f1db4150d9dc860c5df7f98064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-864a0ca46812c82e9e7b942cc4b4b359&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3d644c00cc8a6357eb9492f272b5f81</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WARRANTY AND SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CUSTOMER CARE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Warranty and Service discusses the guarantees and support services offered by manufacturers for gaming controllers, which are significant to consumers for after-sales care and satisfaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abdc59f1db4150d9dc860c5df7f98064</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PS5 DUALSENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PS5 DualSense is described as a highly precise controller with features such as haptic feedback and motion controls, and it is the official controller for the PS5."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NICOLE CLARK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Nicole Clark is a journalist specializing in game-related entertainment content, whose role likely involves writing and analyzing articles about trends and gaming experiences like those offered for the Nintendo Switch."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicole Clark is an author and contributor for Polygon, responsible for creating content on entertainment topics such as Nintendo Switch games."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicole Clark is an individual providing a positive personal account of using the PS5 DualSense, comparing it to experiencing focused vision."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicole Clark is the author of a piece discussing couch co-op games for Nintendo Switch, writing for Polygon."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cfca7fa40d1da5cedac9ffcfddc83b58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-884abe53a8dea2055d50c34d004cea38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DS4WINDOWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"DS4Windows is an app that emulates the DualSense controller on PC, providing compatibility and customization options for games that support the DualSense features."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PCGAMINGWIKI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
