  <data key="d2">chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;8BITDO USB ADAPTER 2&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"8BitDo USB Adapter 2 is a third-party device that allows the DualSense to be used wirelessly with a PC, supporting free remote wake-up of the console.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SWITCH PRO CONTROLLER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Switch Pro controller is a wireless controller for the Nintendo Switch, known for its ergonomics, HD rumble, and amiibo connectivity, and compatible with PC via Steam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Switch Pro controller is considered a top choice for its comfort, durability, and additional features when playing PC games through Steam."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;8BITDO ULTIMATE 2.4G CONTROLLER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"8BitDo Ultimate 2.4g controller is a third-party controller with features and customization options available via Ultimate software, targeting users familiar with Xbox controllers and aiming to provide a high-quality gaming experience.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STEAM LIBRARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Steam Library is a digital library platform that allows users to add and play non-Steam games on Steam, facilitating compatibility with various controllers like the PS5 DualSense and Switch Pro controller through Steam's universal installation system."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GAMEPAD COMPATIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gamepad Compatibility refers to the ability of a gaming platform or controller to work with a range of games, which is crucial for the mentioned controllers (PS5 DualSense and Switch Pro controller) to provide a seamless gaming experience on PC."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REMOTE PLAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Remote Play is a feature on Steam and Nintendo Switch that allows users to stream their game console to another device, such as a PC or Android device, for playing games wirelessly. It's mentioned as a solution for using non-Plug-and-Play controllers like the Switch Pro controller on PC via Steam."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADAPTIVE TRIGGERS AND HAPTICS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adaptive Triggers and Haptics are advanced features of the PS5 DualSense controller that provide tactile feedback and enhance gameplay. These features are highlighted as important aspects to consider when looking for compatible controllers for PC gaming via platforms like Steam or third-party apps."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTROLLER SUPPORT ON STEAM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Controller Support on Steam refers to the ability of the Steam platform to allow the use of non-Steam game controllers, like the Switch Pro controller, which is achieved by adding non-Steam games to the Steam library through the PC client."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3550a05ec2b3b6d1c8f2f0f7e7da1465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;8BITDO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"8BitDo is a company that manufactures controllers for gaming consoles, offering customization and compatibility with various systems."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4686ce51b8d343d86a2ce5a3809e9607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ULTIMATE SOFTWARE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ultimate Software is a tool provided by 8BitDo for customizing controllers on mobile devices and PCs, allowing users to remap controls and adjust settings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4686ce51b8d343d86a2ce5a3809e9607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHARGE DOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Charge Dock is a feature included with the Ultimate controller for convenient charging and connectivity to a PC."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4686ce51b8d343d86a2ce5a3809e9607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;2.4 GHZ TRANSMITTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"2.4 GHz Transmitter is a component of the Ultimate controller that enables fast wireless connection to PCs, supporting XInput and DirectInput."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4686ce51b8d343d86a2ce5a3809e9607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ULTIMATE BLUETOOTH CONTROLLER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ultimate Bluetooth Controller is a higher-end version of the Ultimate controller with Nintendo-style face buttons and analog sticks designed to resist drift, targeting the Nintendo Switch market."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4686ce51b8d343d86a2ce5a3809e9607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GULIKIT HALL EFFECT ANALOG STICKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gulikit Hall effect analog sticks are a type of gamepad technology used in the Ultimate Bluetooth Controller, known for their durability and lack of drift compared to potentiometer-based sticks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4686ce51b8d343d86a2ce5a3809e9607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NINTENDO SWITCH PRO CONTROLLER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Nintendo Switch Pro Controller is a reference point for comparing features of the Ultimate Bluetooth Controller, with both designed for the same gaming platform but with different capabilities and features."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nintendo Switch Pro Controller is another gaming controller that shares some features with the Ultimate Bluetooth Controller but lacks NFC and superior haptic feedback."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4686ce51b8d343d86a2ce5a3809e9607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WIRELESS CONNECTIVITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Wireless Connectivity is a key feature in many of the devices mentioned, allowing for Bluetooth and smart home integration, as well as the ability to control audio devices remotely via applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wireless Connectivity refers to the ability of the controller to connect to a PC or console without the need for cables, using a 2.4 GHz transmitter for communication."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-024f8b28d8a746c5e2e63d8c411e5650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4686ce51b8d343d86a2ce5a3809e9607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECTINPUT (DI)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"DirectInput is a gaming protocol for input devices, which the Charge Dock supports through its switch for connecting to different types of games and systems."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4686ce51b8d343d86a2ce5a3809e9607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;XINPUT (XBOX)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"XInput is another gaming protocol for input devices, supported by the Charge Dock's switch for compatibility with Xbox games."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4686ce51b8d343d86a2ce5a3809e9607</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNITED NATIONS PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The United Nations program is an ambitious international effort aimed at ending the AIDS epidemic by 2030, involving multiple countries and global health organizations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COUNTRIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Countries are the participants in the United Nations program, representing various geographic areas where the HIV epidemic is present."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AIDS EPIDEMIC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The AIDS epidemic is the global health crisis that the United Nations program aims to address and potentially end by 2030."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DR. MONICA GANDHI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dr. Monica Gandhi is identified as a medical director involved in HIV research and treatment, and her statements on the progress of HIV treatments provide insight into the medical aspect of the AIDS epidemic."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DR. RAPHAEL LANDOVITZ&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dr. Raphael Landovitz is mentioned as a co-director of a center focusing on HIV prevention and treatment services, contributing to the understanding of HIV transmission and management.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMBINATION ANTIRETROVIRAL THERAPY (ART)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"ART refers to the advanced treatment regimen used to manage HIV, which suppresses the viral load to undetectable levels and prevents transmission."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRE-EXPOSURE PROPHYLAXIS (PREP)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PrEP is a preventive medication for HIV that reduces the risk of infection in HIV-negative individuals."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CABOTEGRAVIR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cabotegravir is a potential game-changing drug for HIV treatment, though its high cost is a barrier to widespread use."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cabotegravir is an antiretroviral medication mentioned as a potential game-changer in HIV prevention, particularly for women.&lt;SEP&gt;"Cabotegravir is an injectable drug mentioned as an alternative to daily PrEP pills for HIV prevention."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5a728a4f2eff4060efc29d1a811af3a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VAGINAL RING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The vaginal ring mentioned is a HIV prevention tool licensed by some African countries, representing another technological approach to reducing transmission risk."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONDOMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Condoms are widely recognized as an effective method for preventing HIV transmission, representing another prophylactic technology in the fight against the epidemic."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VOLUNTARY MALE CIRCUMCISION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Voluntary male circumcision is noted as a method that reduces HIV transmission risk, indicating a technological and behavioral intervention in the context of HIV prevention strategies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;95-95-95 TARGET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 95-95-95 target is a specific goal set by UNAIDS for 2025, representing a significant milestone in the global strategy to end the AIDS epidemic."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GLOBAL HEALTH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Global health is a concern mentioned in the context of addressing the addictive nature of ultra-processed foods, especially in low- and middle-income countries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Global health represents the overall health and well-being of people worldwide, which is affected by the AIDS epidemic."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89039206f849c78fab340ed6f0292d8a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;40 MILLION AIDS-RELATED DEATHS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"40 million AIDS-related deaths is a historical statistic reflecting the devastating impact of the HIV/AIDS epidemic over the past several decades."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HIV-POSITIVE POPULATION POOL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The HIV-positive population pool refers to the growing number of individuals living with HIV, which poses challenges for sustained treatment and prevention efforts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;41.5 MILLION HIV BY 2030&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"41.5 million HIV by 2030 is a projection that underscores the urgency of ramping up HIV prevention and treatment efforts to avoid a potential surge in infections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCALING UP GLOBAL HIV RESPONSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Scaling up the global HIV response is a concerted effort to meet ambitious targets by increasing the number of people on treatment and achieving key prevention strategies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-481ce52314d2e17f0d1eebbd2667e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PEOPLE WITH HIV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"People with HIV include individuals who have been diagnosed with the virus and are receiving or eligible for treatment and prevention measures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TREATMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Treatments refer to the medical interventions, such as antiretroviral therapy (ART), aimed at managing HIV infection and preventing its progression."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;39 MILLION PEOPLE WITH HIV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"39 million people are individuals worldwide diagnosed with HIV, highlighting the scale of the epidemic."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;76% ON ART&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"76% of the total 39 million people with HIV were taking ART (antiretroviral therapy) in 2022, indicating the prevalence of treatment among this population."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;71% VIRALLY SUPPRESSED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"71% of the total 39 million people with HIV were virally suppressed in 2022, suggesting the effectiveness of the treatments among those who received them."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;57% CHILDREN UNDER 15&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"57% of the 1.5 million children under 15 with HIV received treatment, underscoring the challenges in reaching this vulnerable group."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;46% VIRALLY SUPPRESSED CHILDREN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"46% of children under 15 with HIV were virally suppressed, indicating room for improvement in pediatric care.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;84,000 AIDS-RELATED DEATHS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"84,000 deaths were attributed to AIDS-related illnesses among children under 15 with HIV, emphasizing the severity of the issue.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRANSGENDER PEOPLE WITH HIV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Transgender people with HIV represent a specific demographic within the population with HIV, with an estimated 44% on ART."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HIV-POSITIVE MEN WHO HAVE SEX WITH MEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HIV-positive men who have sex with men represent a key demographic in the HIV epidemic, with 78% ART coverage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEX WORKERS WITH HIV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sex workers with HIV have a high prevalence of the virus, with 65% taking ART."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PEOPLE WHO INJECT DRUGS WITH HIV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"People who inject drugs with HIV have a lower ART coverage at 69%, compared to the general adult population.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PREP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PrEP (Pre-Exposure Prophylaxis) refers to a preventive strategy using medication to reduce the risk of HIV infection in people who are at high risk."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HIGH COST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The high cost of cabotegravir, at $3,700 per course, is a barrier to widespread use and accessibility of this potent HIV prevention tool.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNAIDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"UNAIDS (Joint United Nations Programme on HIV/AIDS) is involved in reporting and setting targets for HIV treatment and prevention globally.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NATIONAL INSTITUTES OF HEALTH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"National Institutes of Health is supporting research into adapting drugs for long-acting ART suitable for children under 12.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHILDREN UNDER 5 WITH HIV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Children under 5 with HIV represent a vulnerable demographic within the HIV population that experiences high mortality rates, emphasizing the need for targeted interventions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PEDIATRIC CARE INTEGRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pediatric care integration refers to the necessity of combining HIV treatment for children with other services and family-based support to improve adherence and accessibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0028a47bb34f0f5ae77e5e54f2d202e</data>
</node>
