  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Democracy in a Hotter Time: Climate Change and Democratic Transformation" is an edited book discussing the intertwined fates of American ecology and democracy, and the challenges of authoritarianism and climate change."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c5e3a0b2e5f17753a03ce1a08fe3e4d7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUTHORITARIANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Authoritarianism is presented as a political environment hindering progress towards Energy Democracy and sustainable futures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Authoritarianism refers to the presence of tyrannical regimes and the struggle against rising forms of authoritarianism, impacting global democracy and actions on climate change."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3ecd1f5290685b38aca900734c260f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e3a0b2e5f17753a03ce1a08fe3e4d7</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTERNET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Internet is the broader context within which Netscape's influence was exerted, marking a significant period in the evolution of global connectivity and web services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Internet is discussed as a force with the potential to influence political actions, including both networking democratic uprisings and amplifying authoritarian leaders, affecting the transition to energy democracy and response to climate change."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-56dbc4a15e39152fa7f9d5f87d675ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e3a0b2e5f17753a03ce1a08fe3e4d7</data>
</node>
