<node id="&quot;ENERGY DEMOCRACY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Energy Democracy is a concept within the climate movement advocating for renewable, small-scale, community-controlled energy systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Energy Democracy is a concept within the climate movement that advocates for renewable, small-scale, and community-controlled energy systems."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7dc0aa3fe6e9c6cdb5632f28ac7664f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3ecd1f5290685b38aca900734c260f4</data>
