  <data key="d1">"Attention Economy is the economic model in which human attention is a scarce commodity, exploited by social media platforms to sell advertising, often criticized for distracting users from important issues like climate change.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7dc0aa3fe6e9c6cdb5632f28ac7664f8</data>
