<node id="&quot;PATENT INFRINGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Patent Infringement refers to the legal issue of using another's patented technology without permission, which is at the heart of the dispute between Apple and AliveCor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Patent infringement refers to the legal conflict where one party is accused of using another's patented technology without permission, which is central to the disputes Apple is facing with Masimo and AliveCor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b76c81c445c4cc4d927995e223dd924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59ecd88b784f45eb95c2455a5e4c281b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VETO&quot;">
