  <data key="d1">"Licensing negotiations are discussions that could resolve patent disputes amicably, but according to Masimo's CEO, have not yet taken place as mentioned in the context.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b76c81c445c4cc4d927995e223dd924</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUPPLY CHAIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Supply chain refers to the entire network of entities involved in the production, distribution, and sale of Apple's products, which could be significantly affected by changes in manufacturing location or design alterations to comply with patent issues.&lt;SEP&gt;"The supply chain refers to the network of organizations, people, activities, resources, and technology involved in the creation and sale of a product or service. In the context of Check Point (CHK), it is significant as it indicates the company's strategy to distribute operations and mitigate risks globally."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b76c81c445c4cc4d927995e223dd924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2b0f4c8b3ee62ae22c242cc7bd116a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MARKET SEGMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ECONOMIC CONCEPT"</data>
