  <data key="d2">chunk-1b76c81c445c4cc4d927995e223dd924</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GEOPOLITICAL STRATEGY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Geopolitical Strategy involves the decision-making process and actions taken by countries or groups in response to international events, such as the conflict between Israel and Hamas, affecting economic and political landscapes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Geopolitical strategy may encompass Apple's broader considerations in navigating international trade disputes, import bans, and its global supply chain logistics.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b76c81c445c4cc4d927995e223dd924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f6c1af394ff37b622d7c07d89d3dcb3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LONG-TERM IMPLICATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LONG-TERM IMPLICATIONS OF SUCH EVENTS ARE HINTED AT THROUGH DISCUSSIONS ON DIVISION UNIFICATION, ATHLETES' CAREERS, AND THE POTENTIAL FOR REDEFINING THE SPORT, INDICATING THE LASTING EFFECTS OF THESE MATCHES AND BOXING'S IMPACT ON THE WIDER LANDSCAPE."</data>
  <data key="d1">"Long-term Implications consider the lasting effects of quantum dot technology on various sectors, from healthcare to environmental sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Long-term implications consider the future effects of the current patent dispute and import ban on Apple's ability to innovate and sustain its market segments, such as the Apple Watch industry.&lt;SEP&gt;"long-lasting effects, influence projection"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6003eef8a0fcd2849f7d3dd40161e9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b76c81c445c4cc4d927995e223dd924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd46633478af2c632e7d3e1b937b5f58</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MULTINATIONAL CORPORATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A multinational corporation is a company like Apple that operates in multiple countries, dealing with diverse regulations and international trade issues as part of its business operations.</data>
