<node id="&quot;KYNAN BROWN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Kynan Brown is a promising footy player from Victoria, noted for his midfield skills, ball-winning ability, and comparison with Errol Gulden. He has impressed at the Oakleigh Chargers and during the U/18 National Championships, and is a potential father-son draft pick under the rule."</data>
