</node>
<node id="&quot;NATE CADDY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Nate Caddy is a pack marking forward with goalkicking prowess, noted for his impact inside 50. He has excelled at the Northern Knights and in national competitions, with a comparison to Taylor Walker. His athletic abilities were tested at the national Draft Combine."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CAL TWOMEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
