  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The West Coast Eagles is the professional club associated with Lance Collard, showing the level of the organization and its role in player development for the AFL.&lt;SEP&gt;"West Coast Eagles is a professional football club based in Perth, Australia, that Lance Collard is part of.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14</data>
