<node id="&quot;NATIONAL CHAMPIONSHIPS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"National Championships are a platform for state-level teams to compete at a higher level, often featuring top-tier young athletes and involving a broader range of challenging competitions that can influence player development and exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;"National Championships is a significant event where South Australian players competed and earned honours, showcasing their skills and potential at the national level."&lt;SEP&gt;"National Championships is an event where players represent their clubs and states to compete at a higher level, often leading to All Australian honours."&lt;SEP&gt;"The National Championships is an event where players like Kynan Brown and Caiden Cleary have demonstrated their skills, playing a pivotal role in showcasing their football prowess and contributing to their draft prospects."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-04b675d29441b1690d3d90e6e9afc3cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcee3fd9a0053b638a37cd7b4ed221b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06b83f477865b89437e1109852bb228b</data>
</node>
