  <data key="d2">chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COATES TALENT LEAGUE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Coates Talent League is a competition in which junior AFL talent is showcased. It serves as a proving ground for young athletes to demonstrate their abilities and progress towards professional opportunities within the sport.&lt;SEP&gt;"Coates Talent League is a competition that features talented young players, providing a platform to showcase and develop their skills for future football opportunities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coates Talent League is a state football talent competition that recognizes the highest-performing players across Victoria, influencing the recruitment and career development of many young athletes, including Zane Duursma and Charlie Edwards.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coates Talent League is an event that featured players from various clubs, including Kynan Brown and Nate Caddy, highlighting their consistent performances and impacting their draft status."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bcee3fd9a0053b638a37cd7b4ed221b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5813d33ce7a9a40dd0db0323816b6db4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06b83f477865b89437e1109852bb228b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALLIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TEAM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Allies is a team where Taylor Graham has adapted to playing in defence, showcasing his clean hands and speed. He had an impressive performance in the National Championship-winning run, averaging 10.3 disposals and three goals per game, indicating strong versatility and impact on the team's success.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Allies is the team that Caiden Cleary played for, where he demonstrated elite skills and helped dominate the midfield battle, contributing to his All Australian honours and draft assessment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06b83f477865b89437e1109852bb228b</data>
</node>
