<node id="&quot;CONTESTED MARKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contested marks are a concept in football representing the skill of players such as Nate Caddy to win the ball in challenging situations, a valued ability in the AFL.</data>
