</node>
<node id="&quot;SHARP VISION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sharp vision is a concept related to a player's on-field awareness and skill, as exemplified by Kynan Brown's ability to create play through the middle of the ground in the National Championships.</data>
