<node id="&quot;QUICK HANDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Quick hands are a concept in football referring to a player's agility and speed in handling the ball, as shown by Kynan Brown's creativity and playmaking skills.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14</data>
