</node>
<node id="&quot;CLEAN HANDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clean hands denotes a player's fair play and sportsmanship, an overarching theme for athletes like Caiden Cleary, who played without infractions during the season.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALL AUSTRALIAN HONOURS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"All Australian honours are a concept of recognition for players like Caiden Cleary, reflecting his exemplary performance and selection for national teams, an important criterion in draft assessments.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SOLO 20M SPRINT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Solo 20m sprint is a concept in athletic testing, with Caiden Cleary's top ten finish demonstrating his speed and agility, important attributes for AFL players.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GRAND COSMIC PLAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Grand cosmic play symbolizes the overarching significance of the AFL within popular culture and societal engagement, an abstract concept that highlights the sport's vast influence.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POTENTIAL ANSWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Potential answers from the first contact with an unknown intelligence could range from scientific to philosophical, affecting humanity's trajectory and understanding, a concept that holds immense importance for the role of sports in societal development.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-371d2c0d1c17a089f436005f276ecb14</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JORDAN CROFT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Jordan Croft is an elite runner, sharp kicker, and strong mark with a potential AFL career. He showcased his athletic prowess at the national Draft Combine and won MVP awards at the National Championships. He is a talented cricketer and the son of a former Bulldogs utility player, making him eligible as a father-son prospect for the Western Bulldogs under the father-son rule. His weapons in football are his speed, aerial ability, and precise kicking, with comparisons to Max King and Isaac Heeney in AFL."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5813d33ce7a9a40dd0db0323816b6db4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DANIEL CURTIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Daniel Curtin is a left-footed defender from Claremont who overcame an injury run and excelled in AFL Futures and AFL National Championships, comparing favourably with Steven May in AFL. He also plays cricket at the under-19 level."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5813d33ce7a9a40dd0db0323816b6db4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HARRY DEMATTIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Harry DeMattia is a midfielder/forward with speed, endurance, and aerial skills from Dandenong Stingrays. He was Co-captain of Victoria Country and performed well in the Coates Talent League Team of the Year. A dual sports athlete who also plays cricket at the under-19 level."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5813d33ce7a9a40dd0db0323816b6db4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ZANE DUURSMA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Zane Duursma is a mercurial forward/midfielder with exceptional play-reading ability, strong overhead skills, and precise kicking for his size. He was dominant in Victoria Country at the National Championships and earned All-Australian honours. He also played cricket and has a talented football family, with his brother Xavier at Essendon and sister Yasmin at Port Adelaide. His weapons in football are aerial skill and goal sense, with comparisons to Isaac Heeney in AFL."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5813d33ce7a9a40dd0db0323816b6db4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHARLIE EDWARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Charlie Edwards is a medium defender and midfielder with a rapid progression for Sandringham Dragons. He has shown athleticism and ball use once moving into the midfield. He is a talented cricketer and could be a draft bolter due to his progression in football. His weapons in football are his defensive skill and cricket prowess."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5813d33ce7a9a40dd0db0323816b6db4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAREMONT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Claremont is a State League Club where Daniel Curtin played and had an impressive AFL season. The club also has a cricket team involved in state competitions.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5813d33ce7a9a40dd0db0323816b6db4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DANDENONG STINGRAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dandenong Stingrays is a State League Club where Harry DeMattia played and had a notable year with the team. The team competes in the Coates Talent League and has represented Victoria Country in cricket as well.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5813d33ce7a9a40dd0db0323816b6db4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SANDRINGHAM DRAGONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sandringham Dragons is a State League Club where Charlie Edwards played, showed significant progress and has potential of being drafted into AFL. The club also has a cricket team."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5813d33ce7a9a40dd0db0323816b6db4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GIPPSLAND POWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gippsland Power is a State League Club where Zane Duursma played, contributing significantly to the team's success. The club also contributes to cricket competitions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5813d33ce7a9a40dd0db0323816b6db4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUSTRALIA’S UNDER-19 CRICKET PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Australia’s under-19 cricket program is a youth cricket competition that participants from various clubs, including Zane Duursma, engage in."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5813d33ce7a9a40dd0db0323816b6db4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATTHEW CROFT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Matthew Croft is the father of Jordan Croft, a former utility player for the Western Bulldogs, who has played 186 games for the club. His connection to the club through his son makes him a notable figure in the club's history and family ties within the organization.</data>
