  <data key="d2">chunk-0660fbf278da0bca8be3bfaa9e981190</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BETTING WAGERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Betting Wagers are the choices made by bettors to place a stake on the outcome of a sports event or game."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0660fbf278da0bca8be3bfaa9e981190</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;9 INNINGS RULE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"9 Innings Rule stipulates that the game must go at least 9 innings for bets on the run line to be active.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0660fbf278da0bca8be3bfaa9e981190</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEAM TO SCORE FIRST WAGERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Team to Score First Wagers are bets placed on which team will score first in a game, with the prop being graded once a run is scored.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0660fbf278da0bca8be3bfaa9e981190</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POSTSEASON BASEBALL SERIES WAGERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Postseason Baseball Series Wagers are bets made on the team predicted to win a series of MLB postseason games.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0660fbf278da0bca8be3bfaa9e981190</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERMS AND CONDITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Accepting the terms and conditions is a mandatory step before finalizing the account setup to understand betting rules and platform regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Terms and Conditions are the rules and regulations that sportsbooks must follow for games and bets offered to customers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05fa83179c1c7eaf784f471825720c37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0660fbf278da0bca8be3bfaa9e981190</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MLB BETTING ODDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"MLB Betting Odds are the odds provided by sportsbooks for the outcomes of MLB events."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0660fbf278da0bca8be3bfaa9e981190</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ODDS FEED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Odds Feed is a tool or service that aggregates and displays odds from multiple sportsbooks for comparison."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0660fbf278da0bca8be3bfaa9e981190</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPARISON SHOPPING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Comparison Shopping is the process by which Bettors evaluate and compare odds from different sources, including odds feeds, to maximize their potential winnings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0660fbf278da0bca8be3bfaa9e981190</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNDERSTANDING TEAM STATISTICS&quot;">
