<node id="&quot;ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE (AI)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Artificial Intelligence (AI) is a broad concept discussed throughout the text as a driving force in creative industries, influencing music, copyright issues, and the future of creative work.&lt;SEP&gt;"Artificial Intelligence (AI) is a technology used in product development to create systems capable of performing tasks that typically require human intelligence, influencing product design and strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Artificial intelligence is highlighted as a key technology impacting computing experiences, necessitating a strategic approach in product innovation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Artificial Intelligence (AI) is the overarching field of study and application, which encompasses general purpose AI models and generative AI tools, central to the topic of AI regulation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5a04636b49c5d8346d1ca2fd6e5201fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6a32626c7394869f547f4ee6ccac459&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e2f2555285deec6246e71979792ba10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-997f053f3805e2768d953a251a2dd43c</data>
