</node>
<node id="&quot;RECHARGEABLE ZINC IODINE BATTERIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rechargeable zinc iodine batteries are proposed as an alternative to lithium-ion batteries, focusing on their potential for improved stability and safety."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HYDROGELS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hydrogels are the materials used as electrolytes in the hydrogel-based batteries, a critical component in achieving the batteries' desired properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydrogels are used as a key component in the design of electrolytes for the batteries, with their network structure being crucial for the research's approach to battery improvement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0c574d5326e485adac6db413cac7ba1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NANYANG TECHNOLOGICAL UNIVERSITY (NTU)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Nanyang Technological University is associated with the research team, led by professor Hongjin Fan, exploring the development of the new battery technology."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HONGJIN FAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hongjin Fan is a professor at NTU who leads the research team working on the aqueous zinc iodine batteries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANODE AND CATHODE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Anode and Cathode refer to parts of the battery where zinc and iodine are involved, determining the battery's efficiency and stability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POLYSULFIDE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Polysulfide relates to a byproduct in batteries that contributes to the shuttle effect and battery instability when poorly managed.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SHUTTLE EFFECT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Shuttle effect is a phenomenon in batteries where polysulfide migrates between anodes and cathodes, leading to reduced efficiency and potential short-circuiting.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IONIC TRANSPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ionic transport refers to the movement of ions within the battery, which is crucial for the battery's function and performance.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POLYANIONIC AND POLYCATIONIC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Polyanionic and Polycationic components are part of the hydrogel electrolyte, working together to mitigate battery challenges.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CELLULOSE PAPER SCAFFOLD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPONENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cellulose paper scaffold is mentioned as part of the battery design, likely used as a support structure in the initial research, although its role is being optimized to eliminate in the hydrogel electrolyte.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENERGY STORAGE CAPACITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Energy storage capacity indicates the battery's ability to store and retain energy over multiple cycles, which is a key performance metric being improved by the research.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;18,000 DISCHARGE AND RECHARGE CYCLES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NUMBER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"18,000 cycles is the benchmark for testing the new batteries' durability, beyond the performance of current zinc iodine batteries.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AQUEOUS ZINC ION BATTERIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
