  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THERMAL RUNAWAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Thermal Runaway is a dangerous condition in batteries that can lead to fires or explosions, mentioned as a drawback of current lithium-ion batteries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELECTROLYTES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Electrolytes are a crucial component of batteries, conducting ions between the anode and cathode, and are being modified in the research with hydrogels for improved performance.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POLYIODIDES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Polyiodides are negatively charged ions composed of iodine atoms that are mentioned as affecting the battery's shuttle effect and potential for uniform zinc deposition."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REDOX REACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Redox Reactions involve the transfer of electrons, which are accelerated in the context of the hydrogel electrolyte's improved design for battery reactions.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DENDRITES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dendrites are projections that can cause short-circuiting in batteries, and their growth is limited by the mechanical strength of the hydrogel electrolyte in the new battery design."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BATTERY STABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Battery Stability refers to the ability of a battery to maintain its performance over time and under various conditions, a major research focus for the improved zinc iodine batteries.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EFFICIENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Efficiency in batteries is related to how well they convert stored energy into usable power, impacted by the management of dendrites and the shuttle effect.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-639911c906ae64992990e51e9649e2af</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ION CONDUCTIVITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
