</node>
<node id="&quot;ORPHANAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The orphanage represents a place in Melissa's father's childhood where he faced adversity and was part of his family's struggle against racial injustice."</data>
