  <data key="d2">chunk-3e5e03c0388afabca24b7743d67d73ac</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CARLOS DÍAZ-MARÍN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Carlos Díaz-Marín is a mechanical engineer at MIT working on a device to address water shortages using a new hydrogel technology."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HYDROGEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hydrogel is a mesh of polymers that captures moisture from the air, which is a new technology being developed for extracting drinking water."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydrogel refers to the key material used in the device that absorbs and releases water vapor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0897d199d83904904c800e61d22f120b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POLYACRYLAMIDE (PAH-LEE-UH-CRIH-LAH-MYDE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATERIAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Polyacrylamide is the material used to create the hydrogel, a key component in the new water extraction technology."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LITHIUM CHLORIDE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INGREDIENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lithium chloride is used as a salt to enhance the water capturing capabilities of the hydrogel."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SMARTFARM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEVICE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"SmartFarm is a gel-based device designed to capture water from the air for plant irrigation, another technology related to water conservation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IPOMOEA AQUATICA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CROP"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ipomoea aquatica is a leafy green vegetable grown using the SmartFarm technology in a study mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SWEE CHING TAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Swee Ching Tan is a materials scientist at the National University of Singapore who comments on the potential impact of the hydrogel technology, indicating an interest in its implications for water solutions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NATIONAL UNIVERSITY OF SINGAPORE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"National University of Singapore is associated with Swee Ching Tan, who evaluates the hydrogel technology's significance.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WATER SCARCITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Water scarcity is a global issue exacerbated by climate change, impacting water supply for drinking and agriculture, central to the discussion in the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIVE BILLION PEOPLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STATISTIC"</data>
  <data key="d1">"By 2050, five billion people are expected to experience water scarcity for at least one month per year, highlighting the urgency of the problem the technology aims to address."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WARMER TEMPERATURES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CAUSE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Warmer temperatures are one of the causes of water scarcity, contributing to the stress on water supplies mentioned in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SNOW FEED INTO RIVERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reduction in snow feed into rivers is mentioned as a stress factor for water supplies, affecting availability for drinking and crop irrigation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DRINKING WATER SUPPLY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NEED"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The need for drinking water supply is emphasized as a critical aspect of the water crisis addressed by the new technologies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CROP IRRIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"APPLICATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Crop irrigation is mentioned as an activity impacted by water scarcity, which the SmartFarm technology aims to improve through water collection from the air."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SOLAR-POWERED MOTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPONENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The solar-powered motor is a part of the SmartFarm device, which operates in conjunction with the hydrogel to capture and release water."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NIGHT AND DAY OPERATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FUNCTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The SmartFarm operates by opening at night to capture water vapor and closing during the day to retain heat for releasing water, emphasizing its operation cycle relevance to water conservation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENSUING SILENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 'ensuing silence' refers to the collective introspection of humanity's role in the cosmic event, reflecting the emotional and intellectual response of the people involved in the first contact scenario.&lt;SEP&gt;"The ensuing silence after communication with an unknown intelligence is metaphorically described as a moment of introspection relevant to the anticipation of the unknown in the context of 'First Contact'."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c45b9dd921ba16449e1f1a18145de18</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORLD RECORD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACHIEVEMENT"</data>
