  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HUMANITY'S FIRST CONTACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Humanity's first contact with an unknown intelligence is a major event discussed in the context of this technological leap, symbolizing a turning point in human history."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TREPIDATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Trepidation is the emotion felt by the team, indicating the uncertainty and anxiety associated with making first contact with an unknown intelligence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trepidation is the mix of feelings of awe and anxiety described in Sam Rivera's response to the intelligence's capabilities, reflecting the emotional state of the team as they prepare for first contact."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b35fcf151f20a401d073e4c43ff0aeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbae21da58e394d7750b98ee01645e9f</data>
