  <data key="d1">"Donald Trump is a former president and GOP frontrunner who is using electric vehicles as a political wedge issue, arguing they are too expensive and harm the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The depiction of Donald Trump in a humorous light serves as an irreverent tribute, playing on the intersection of politics and cultural identity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Donald Trump is mentioned as a potential presidential candidate whose actions regarding Ukraine are uncertain, despite his claims to potentially resolve the conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;"Donald Trump is referenced regarding his past relationship with Russia and potential impact on U.S. support for Ukraine.&lt;SEP&gt;"Donald Trump is the former president facing scrutiny over asset valuations and fraud allegations, as per a fraud lawsuit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Donald Trump is the subject of the lawsuit, accused of committing fraud in building his real estate empire, and is defending his actions and reputation."</data>
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
</node>
