<node id="&quot;MODERN-DAY ZELDA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild is a continuation of the Zelda franchise, known for its rich storytelling, mythology, and open-world exploration that has resonated with gamers over decades."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild is recommended as a classic Nintendo franchise game with open world exploration for Switch users."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-884abe53a8dea2055d50c34d004cea38</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANIMAL CROSSING: NEW HORIZONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Animal Crossing: New Horizons is a farming sim game that allows players to build and customize their own island, interact with villagers, and manage resources."&lt;SEP&gt;"Animal Crossing: New Horizons is part of the long-running Animal Crossing series, which is celebrated for its relaxing nature simulation and social dynamics that mimic real-life village life."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-884abe53a8dea2055d50c34d004cea38</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUPER MARIO ODYSSEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Super Mario Odyssey is a Mario platforming game with expansive world exploration, featuring the character Cappy for power boosts and collecting Power Moons to save the day, targeted towards fans of the Mario series."&lt;SEP&gt;"Super Mario Odyssey is part of the classic Super Mario series, which is renowned for its platforming adventures and continues to captivate gamers with its expansive, side-scrolling gameplay."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-884abe53a8dea2055d50c34d004cea38</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HADES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hades is an indie roguelike game set in the underworld, featuring a full cast of gods and a narrative that unfolds as players repeatedly try to escape hell, acclaimed for its depth and replayability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hades is recognized as a modern example of the roguelike genre in gaming, offering procedurally generated levels, character abilities, and a compelling narrative that explores the concept of death and rebirth in the underworld."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-884abe53a8dea2055d50c34d004cea38</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STARDEW VALLEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Stardew Valley is a game developed by Eric Barone, where players inherit a farm and engage in various activities such as farming, mining, and interacting with locals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stardew Valley is an RPG farming game that allows players to live out a peaceful life on a newly inherited farm, engaging in activities like farming, fishing, and crafting, which can be played over a long period of time, resonating with fans of the Harvest Moon series."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stardew Valley is emblematic of the farming simulation genre, providing an immersive experience that simulates life on a farm, emphasizing peacefulness, resource management, and community building."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-884abe53a8dea2055d50c34d004cea38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b81951ef606d022ffe11ee975666b39</data>
</node>
