  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY, PAID GAMES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"MONOPOLY is a classic board game adapted into a mobile game, ranking as the top paid app in the list, suggesting its enduring popularity and appeal to gamers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monopoly refers to a situation where a single company dominates a market or industry, which Epic Games claims Google holds through its Play Store practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-82ef6612b6aebc4c34f55e1e050f5dad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0952c6f1db7260a984139b544391d19a</data>
</node>
