  <data key="d2">chunk-1160e94e0f66699ff768b798c4132e67</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FASTING-MIMICKING DIET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fasting-mimicking diet is a concept in nutrition technology that aims to replicate the benefits of fasting without the complete abstention from food, showing potential cognitive benefits and support for brain health."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d71f5203110cdf0ffe66b7c70dfc3ac2</data>
</node>
