<node id="&quot;SOLAR WIND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Solar Wind is the flow of charged particles released from the upper atmosphere of the Sun, impacting planetary environments and space weather."&lt;SEP&gt;"Solar wind refers to the stream of charged particles released from the sun's corona, relevant in the study of space weather and astrophysics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Solar Wind is the stream of charged particles emitted by the sun, which interacts with Earth's magnetosphere to create auroras and related phenomena like STEVE."</data>
