<node id="&quot;POINT SPREAD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SPORT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Point Spread is a concept explained in the article, referring to the odds set to level the playing field between two teams in a game."&lt;SEP&gt;"Point Spread, in this context, is another concept that is central to the article's explanation of how the betting odds are structured.&lt;SEP&gt;"Point spread is the betting system used in sports betting to level the playing field between two competing teams or individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Point spread is the predicted margin of victory or defeat, crucial for point spread bets in sports."&lt;SEP&gt;"Point Spread is an aspect of sports betting, including the NBA, which suggests the margin of victory in a game between two teams."</data>
