  <data key="d2">chunk-50bfefcee6837f23c6272648c1b4662c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UBER'S DISMISSAL MOTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Uber's Dismissal Motions are the company's attempts through legal filings to prevent the consolidation of sexual assault lawsuits, arguing against the duty to protect passengers from criminal behavior."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50bfefcee6837f23c6272648c1b4662c</data>
</node>
