  <data key="d1">"The US Congress extended copyright protections and is contrasted with the EU's approach in the copyright protection debate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The US Congress passing legislation in 1971 and 1995 related to music copyright protections is a significant event in the music industry's legislative history."</data>
