  <data key="d2">chunk-05f30bb173fe6db60e7dcd8827ab3372</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GLOBAL MUSIC MARKET SHARE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Global Music Market Share refers to the share of the worldwide music market controlled by different regions or companies, relevant for international copyright and distribution strategies.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05f30bb173fe6db60e7dcd8827ab3372</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-PROFIT MUSIC ORGANIZATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-Profit Music Organizations are entities that operate for the public benefit in the music sector without primary profit motive, potentially influencing copyright and music policy influence.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05f30bb173fe6db60e7dcd8827ab3372</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CULTURAL MUSIC HISTORIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
