  <data key="d2">chunk-18308a2314bab43f38e105e4bcb3e3d3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LARGE LANGUAGE MODELS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Large language models are discussed concerning their capabilities and limitations, with an expectation of clearer understanding in 2024 regarding their emergent capabilities and limitations.&lt;SEP&gt;"Large language models represent advanced AI technologies being applied to develop cognitive intelligence in robots within the research community."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-18308a2314bab43f38e105e4bcb3e3d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d460d57b29c86d7dbfee71ee9b5c47a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIRI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Siri is a virtual assistant on the Apple Watch used for various commands and interactions, which can be controlled by double tap in some contexts such as quick replies in an email app.&lt;SEP&gt;"Siri is used as an alternative to navigate and perform actions on Apple Watch when the double tap gesture is insufficient."&lt;SEP&gt;"Siri is used as an example of an AI agent with specific capabilities, showcasing the types of AI advancements Apple might focus on.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-281c85cdb8b39dc5d7d1ea7f4dc15d59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18308a2314bab43f38e105e4bcb3e3d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e12dc7da779249348839cbb839df513</data>
</node>
