<node id="&quot;BEATS STUDIO PRO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Beats Studio Pro are high-quality earbuds with new features such as lossless audio support over USB-C, noise cancellation, and compatibility with iOS and Android features like Fast Pair and Google’s Find My Device platform."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beats Studio Pro is a wireless earbud technology that offers good sound quality and ANC, available at a discounted price.&lt;SEP&gt;"Beats Studio Pro is a product by Beats, a company that designs and markets audio equipment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beats Studio Pro headphones are on sale for $180 with good sound quality and noise cancellation, produced by Apple and suitable for both Android and iOS platforms, but lack wear detection features."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beats Studio Pro are wireless over-ear headphones with various features, presented with a substantial discount during the prime day sales."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-024f8b28d8a746c5e2e63d8c411e5650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afeb7a5884a03be8ae0124b38cd0f1ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2882ef40fb38750a8c979f4a03e4610e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BOSE QUIETCOMFORT HEADPHONES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bose QuietComfort Headphones are a pair of foldable noise-canceling headphones that offer adjustable noise cancellation levels, custom modes, and 24 hours of battery life. They come in green and are similar to the previous QuietComfort 45 series, with a current sale price of $249 at various retailers after a $100 discount. They are suitable for carrying around due to their design and provide an immersive audio experience with customizable settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bose QuietComfort Headphones are a revised version of the QuietComfort 45 with adjustable noise cancellation levels, custom modes, and come in green color."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e418562c09ecc65ef7740f559f5db716&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SONY WH-1000XM4&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sony WH-1000XM4 headphones are known for their noise cancellation, sound quality, and ability to pair with two devices simultaneously. They are more compact for travel and have up to 30 hours of battery life."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sony WH-1000XM4 is a previous generation of Sony's noise-canceling headphones, offering similar features as WH-1000XM5 but with the added benefit of being foldable, now more affordable due to Black Friday sales."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sony WH-1000XM4 is a wireless noise-canceling headphone available at a discounted price during the prime day sales."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-82cb9857637c700cd31e747d57c809a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2882ef40fb38750a8c979f4a03e4610e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SONY LINKBUDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sony LinkBuds have an open-style donut-shaped design, providing better spatial awareness and a comfortable fit. They offer crisp sound and excellent voice call performance, but less practical in louder environments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SONY LINKBUDS S&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sony LinkBuds S are compact wireless earbuds with noise-canceling and other features, also available at a discounted price during the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sony LinkBuds S are lightweight, comfortable earbuds that offer active noise cancellation and support for Sony’s LDAC Bluetooth codec, allowing for high-quality audio streaming."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2882ef40fb38750a8c979f4a03e4610e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SONY WH-CH720N&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sony WH-CH720N are budget-friendly noise-canceling headphones, weighing 4.8 grams per bud, offering up to 35 hours of battery life, available in blue, white, and black for around $98."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SONY WF-C700N&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sony WF-C700N are comfortable noise-canceling earbuds with decent sound quality and support for Fast Pair on Android and location-based sound settings. They provide basic noise cancellation and have a limited battery life of up to 35 hours on a single charge."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BLUETOOTH SUPPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bluetooth Support is a technical feature of wireless headsets that allows connectivity with various devices without the need for cables, mentioned as an advantage for the Logitech G535 model."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bluetooth Support refers to the ability of the Beats Studio Pro earbuds and other devices to connect wirelessly using Bluetooth technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bluetooth support enables wireless connectivity between the earbuds and other devices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c6710796730da0bb12c3d01373c70ee1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b898230fc018d67a517f9e8dddd8408e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WIRELESS CHARGING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Wireless Charging is a feature available in some devices like the Google Pixel 7A, offering convenience and efficiency in charging without the use of cables."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wireless Charging is a feature not present in the charging case of the Beats Studio Pro, which is considered a minor shortcoming compared to the price point."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wireless Charging is a technology that allows earbuds and headphones to be charged without connecting to a power source, typically using a special case or stand."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wireless Charging is a technology feature that allows Kindle Paperwhite Signature Edition to charge without a cable."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wireless charging is a feature of the Sonos Roam, providing a convenience factor and ease of setup for travelers who do not wish to deal with cables."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2afe0e9534dea316b890f39b7c0282ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea2060e55b58fc9eaf22b36edafc0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45301fb5a95549f1651efbffbf70d6ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d4ec06372c78a987da35c09bce2d282</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOSSLESS AUDIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lossless Audio is a high-quality audio format supported by the Beats Studio Pro earbuds via USB-C, which preserves the full fidelity of the original recording."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FOLDABLE DESIGN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Sony WH-1000XM4 headphones feature a foldable design, making them more compact for travel and storage compared to previous models."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;30 HOURS OF BATTERY LIFE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The noise-canceling headphones, such as the Sony WH-1000XM4 and WH-CH720N, offer up to 30 hours of battery life on a single charge."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GREEN COLOR OPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bose QuietComfort Headphones now come in a green color option, adding variety to the product lineup."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70608054a97c24d18507b015f5502677</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BOSE QUIETCOMFORT ULTRA HEADPHONES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Headphones are a new release technology praised for comfort, ANC performance, and spatial audio, available at a discounted price.&lt;SEP&gt;"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Headphones offer superior Bluetooth codecs, an immersive audio mode, better call quality, and improved noise cancellation compared to the QuietComfort 45. They have a foldable design and new physical controls, including a volume slider but lack multipoint support and a built-in wireless charging case. Currently priced at $379 at Amazon, Best Buy, and Bose, they are on sale with a $50 discount."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e418562c09ecc65ef7740f559f5db716&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BOSE QUIETCOMFORT ULTRA EARBUDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds are an in-ear wireless headphone technology noted for exceptional noise cancellation, available at an all-time low price point."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Wireless Earbuds outperform other earbuds on the market regarding noise cancellation. They share a similar design and fit with their predecessors but include improvements like immersive audio, better voice call quality, and silicone stabilizer wings. They are available for $279 at Amazon, Best Buy, and Bose, with a current discount of $20. They lack multipoint support and built-in wireless charging."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e418562c09ecc65ef7740f559f5db716&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SAMSUNG GALAXY BUDS 2 PRO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Samsung Galaxy Buds 2 Pro are premium wireless earbuds with active noise cancellation, wireless charging, and good sound quality targeted for Android users or Samsung enthusiasts. The best price is currently $169.99 at Amazon, B&amp;H Photo, and Best Buy, with a $60 discount. They offer features like IPX7 sweat and water resistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Samsung Galaxy Buds 2 Pro are wireless earbuds for Samsung users, with good clarity, well-controlled bass, and waterproof design, but no multi-device pairing and a short battery life."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45301fb5a95549f1651efbffbf70d6ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e418562c09ecc65ef7740f559f5db716</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SAMSUNG GALAXY BUDS 2&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Samsung Galaxy Buds 2 are entry-level wireless earbuds offering good sound quality and active noise cancellation. The best price is available at Best Buy for $89.99 with a $60 discount. They also have a discount available at Amazon and Verizon. They lack noise cancellation, wireless charging, and may experience occasional connectivity issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Samsung Galaxy Buds 2 are wireless earbuds that provide active noise cancellation, wireless charging, and a sleek design. They are positioned as a mid-range option between entry-level and premium models, offering good sound and comfort at a discounted price of $89.99 with a $60 discount from Best Buy.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e418562c09ecc65ef7740f559f5db716</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOOGLE PIXEL BUDS A-SERIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Google Pixel Buds A-Series offer good sound, voice call quality, and integration with Google Assistant at an IPX4 rating for sweat and water resistance. They lack noise cancellation, wireless charging, and are prone to occasional connectivity issues, with a current sale price of $83.34 at Amazon and Best Buy, with a 17% discount from the previous low.&lt;SEP&gt;"Google Pixel Buds A-Series offers features like extensive battery life and water resistance, catering to general and some iPhone users' needs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Google Pixel Buds A-Series' IPX4 water resistance indicates its suitability for activities where exposure to water is possible, such as workouts.</data>
