  <data key="d1">"AirPods Pro (third-gen) are an iteration of the AirPods Pro line, sharing similar features like noise cancellation and water resistance but with improved sound quality."&lt;SEP&gt;"The AirPods Pro (third-gen) are a continuation of the AirPods Pro series, related to the base model by their shared features and company."&lt;SEP&gt;"AirPods Pro are an iteration of Apple's AirPods with new features like Conversation Awareness mode, maintaining sound quality and fitting.&lt;SEP&gt;"AirPods Pro is introduced with improvements in sound, Adaptive Audio features, and Conversation Awareness mode aimed at enhancing audio interaction, specifically appealing to users preferring wireless earbuds with physical buttons for control and comfort during workouts."</data>
