  <data key="d1">"Wireless Earbuds are a category of earbuds that connect to devices via Bluetooth or other wireless standards, offering features like multiple-device pairing and touch controls."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wireless Earbuds represent a category of products that includes the AirPods Pro and Beats Studio Pro, emphasizing the portability and convenience of modern earphones."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wireless earbuds are mentioned as a frequently charged device, part of the ongoing conversation about the safety and management of electronic gadgets.&lt;SEP&gt;"Wireless earbuds are part of the charging routine and contribute to productivity by helping stay connected."</data>
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
