<node id="&quot;HAUNTED CHUCK E. CHEESE-TYPE LOCATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The haunted location in Willy’s Wonderland is a themed setting that draws inspiration from family-friendly restaurants with a horror twist."&lt;SEP&gt;"The location serves as a creative setting for the film, connecting with fans familiar with the themed entertainment in the Five Nights at Freddy’s series."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c2665ecd335788a91ddafc234f8d4465</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUNIOR-LEVEL GORE&quot;">
