  <data key="d1">"Dr. Sandhya Prashad holds a presidential position in a professional society, which reflects her authority and involvement in the clinical use of ketamine."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dr. Sandhya Prashad is the president of the American Society Of Ketamine Physicians and Practitioners."</data>
