</node>
<node id="&quot;IDEA OF SUPERVISION IN KETAMINE USE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The concept of supervision is crucial when using ketamine to avoid abuse, highlighting the contrast between safe medical use and the risks of unsupervised self-administration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ecc0aad04f33f8be38b30f571bfcec58</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL STATUS OF KETAMINE&quot;">
