</node>
<node id="&quot;AUTUMN WRIGHT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Autumn Wright is the author of the article discussing the representation of queer themes in The Legend of Zelda games."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LINK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CHARACTER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Link is a central character who is subjected to gender-based ridicule in Tears of the Kingdom, as women and girls react with mockery to his male appearance and short stature."&lt;SEP&gt;"Link is the player character of The Legend of Zelda series, notably discussed for his androgyny and the potential for queer interpretation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ZELDA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CHARACTER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Zelda is a playable character in The Legend of Zelda series, who is central to discussions of gender representation in the game."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GERUDO TOWN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gerudo Town is an all-female settlement in Breath of the Wild, which in Tears of the Kingdom undergoes a transformation. The town's armor for men is no longer for sale, and Link is received as a threat upon entering, reflecting shifts in gender perception within the community."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gerudo Town is an all-female, culturally distinct settlement in The Legend of Zelda series, notable for its matriarchal society and interactions with the player character."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gerudo Town is depicted as a space of gender and cultural friction in Breath of the Wild, affecting how characters of different genders interact."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EIJI AONUMA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eiji Aonuma is a Zelda producer who commented on the gender dynamics of Link and Zelda in The Legend of Zelda series."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SARAH STANG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sarah Stang is an academic commenting on the representation and interpretation of Link's gender in The Legend of Zelda series."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEMALE HERO OF TIME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Female Hero of Time is a hypothetical interpretation of the player character Link as a potential female protagonist."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VILIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CHARACTER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vilia is a character in The Legend of Zelda series, involved in discussions about gender and sexuality through her interactions in Gerudo Town."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vilia is depicted as a character that dresses as a woman, suggesting a trans man within the Gerudo race, and interacts with male characters in Gerudo armor deals despite the race's female-only status."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CROSSDRESSING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Crossdressing refers to the practice of dressing and presenting oneself as another gender, which is a significant element in the discussion of queer representation in The Legend of Zelda games."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BREATH OF THE WILD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GAME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Breath of the Wild is recognized for its thematic space allowing for queer interpretation and player expression."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHARACTER INTERPRETATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Character Interpretation refers to the diverse ways players and critics view and understand the gender presentation and implications within The Legend of Zelda series."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CROSS-PLATFORM DISCUSSIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cross-Platform Discussions denotes the conversations and debates occurring across various media and platforms regarding the gender and queer elements in The Legend of Zelda games."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLAYER AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Player Agency describes the level of choice and freedom players have in exploring and interpreting gender aspects in The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NARRATIVE IMPLICATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Narrative Implications are the consequences and potential changes in game storytelling due to gender representation and player interpretation in The Legend of Zelda."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3f5b7fb4d3d9c96668027b20a33fd77</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HYLIAN MAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Hylian man's interaction with Link about searching for a black market armor shop introduces the concept of gender-specific armor in a derogatory manner, implying trans masculinity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CECE’S HAT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cece’s Hat, a piece of clothing introduced by a Hylian in Hateno, lacks a matching set of top and bottoms, symbolizing the absence of gender nonconforming options in the game."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEARS OF THE KINGDOM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tears of the Kingdom is an event in the game that portrays a society with rigid gender binaries, where characters mock Link's masculine appearance, and there are no gender-nonconforming clothing options like the vai armor from Breath of the Wild."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GERUDO COMMUNITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GROUP"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Gerudo Community represents the all-female society in Breath of the Wild, which in Tears of the Kingdom experiences a shift in how they perceive gender roles, particularly in relation to armor and appearance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LURELIN REFUGEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Lurelin Refugee at a stable exhibits humor at the idea of a 'skinny little guy' attempting to rescue, showcasing attitudes towards masculinity present in the game's society."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GERUDO PILGRIM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Gerudo Pilgrim engages in a mocking conversation with Link about him not being her destined lover, illustrating the game's reinforcement of gender stereotypes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GREAT FAIRY MIJA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Great Fairy Mija, despite her fondness for Link, uses a term that plays on gender stereotypes, calling him a "slim little lad" with a hint of condescension."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HYRULE'S SOCIAL NORMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hyrule's Social Norms encompass the gendered expectations and beauty standards that pervade the game world, particularly in its reaction to Link's masculinity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARMOR SHOP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Armor Shop, now associated with a black market, plays into the game's gendered narrative by offering gender-specific armor that reinforces binary gender presentations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRIVIALIZATION OF GENDER DIVERSITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The trivialization of gender diversity is evident in the way queer elements from Breath of the Wild are downplayed or transformed into insignificant tchotchkes in Tears of the Kingdom."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEW SETTLEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The establishment of new settlements and side quests in Tears of the Kingdom signifies a move away from the unstructured wilderness that once valued gender nonconformity, reinforcing strict gender binaries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NARRATIVE SHIFT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The overall narrative shift in Tears of the Kingdom from a world of calamity to one governed by strict gender norms reflects the diminished significance of queer characters and themes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a5889244dbe6d9f7e5b07bc189785ad</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JOE BIDEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Joe Biden is the President of the United States, involved in a significant meeting with Chinese President Xi Jinping to address U.S.-China relations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Joe Biden's campaign is creating an "army of influencers" to reach digitally-savvy viewers, including Gen Z."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e8d91617e44ef2c70e9cf01f37f32d4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ffb41463d4c8515229c2a00fa88a660</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;XI JINPING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Xi Jinping is the General Secretary of the Communist Party of China, a key political figure relevant to the narrative."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xi Jinping is the President of China, participating in a critical summit with U.S. President Joe Biden to manage tensions between the U.S. and China."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1fb4ebe15afd997b000659371d31f0a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ffb41463d4c8515229c2a00fa88a660</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;G20 SUMMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"G20 summit is an international forum where world leaders, including Joe Biden and Xi Jinping, gather to discuss global economic, political, and environmental issues."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0ffb41463d4c8515229c2a00fa88a660</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANTONY BLINKEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
