<node id="&quot;CAVEFISH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANISM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cavefish are subjects of experiments that study behavioral conditions, providing insights into the biology and evolution relevant to human autism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cavefish are the eyeless species of fish being used as a model system to understand autism and the effects of the ketogenic diet."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3ef96d4e285264f89ba3c934bbb0869c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78c1f2b5c8f3560d06e373c8068c9452</data>
