</node>
<node id="&quot;SOCIAL-LIKE AFFINITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Social-like affinity refers to the observed changes in behavior, such as following each other and ceasing repetitive swimming patterns, in cavefish after being on a ketogenic diet."</data>
