<node id="&quot;CUSTOMER JOURNEY ANALYSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ANALYTICAL TOOL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Customer Journey Analysis examines the complete path a customer takes when interacting with a service, including how price matching and refund policies affect the experience."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f8ee069fe16da677ea6e8384773ee99</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POST-PURCHASE EVALUATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CUSTOMER BEHAVIOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Post-Purchase Evaluation involves how customers assess their satisfaction with a purchase, which can be influenced by successful price matching or refunds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f8ee069fe16da677ea6e8384773ee99</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPURCHASE INTENTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CUSTOMER LOYALTY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Repurchase Intentions are the inclinations of a customer to buy again, potentially influenced by positive refund or price matching experiences.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f8ee069fe16da677ea6e8384773ee99</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BUSINESS STRATEGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Customer Experience Management focuses on optimizing the overall experience of customers with a brand, where effective refund and price matching policies can contribute significantly."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f8ee069fe16da677ea6e8384773ee99</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ECONOMIES OF SCALE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ECONOMIC CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Economies of Scale might influence pricing decisions and the feasibility of price matching or offering refunds, affecting overall business sustainability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f8ee069fe16da677ea6e8384773ee99</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGILE MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BUSINESS STRATEGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Agile Management allows companies to respond swiftly to market changes, including adjusting refund policies or price-matching practices to meet consumer needs.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f8ee069fe16da677ea6e8384773ee99</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BRAND DIFFERENTIATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BUSINESS STRATEGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Brand Differentiation refers to the ways a brand distinguishes itself from competitors, which can be enhanced by unique refund or price-matching policies.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f8ee069fe16da677ea6e8384773ee99</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRODUCT LIFE CYCLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BUSINESS CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Product Life Cycle details the stages a product goes through, from introduction to decline, which can inform refund and price-matching policies at different stages.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f8ee069fe16da677ea6e8384773ee99</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SHELF LIFE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT ATTRIBUTE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Shelf Life is relevant for products that might be returned or subject to refunds, impacting the timing and terms of such policies.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f8ee069fe16da677ea6e8384773ee99</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERISHABLE GOODS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT ATTRIBUTE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Perishable Goods are items with a limited time of usability, whose product-related policies must consider appropriate handling and refund protocols.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f8ee069fe16da677ea6e8384773ee99</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAN CLANCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dan Clancy is highlighted as the person at the helm of Twitch, who had a controversial start but is perceived to have made positive changes following interaction with the community."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dan Clancy is the CEO of Twitch, leading the company's response to monetization controversies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d3ca70453ccd044719c2e1fe9970bea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fdaef228ab952c2e7900b1becda600d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TWITCH CON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Twitch Con is an annual convention for the Twitch community, signaling a moment of significance for its participants and wider industry relevance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d3ca70453ccd044719c2e1fe9970bea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTNER PLUS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROGRAM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Partner Plus is a Twitch program designed to offer better monetization options for streamers, aiming to retain talent by addressing their concerns about revenue sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Partner Plus is a new monetization program by Twitch that attempts to address community concerns about eligibility and revenue share."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d3ca70453ccd044719c2e1fe9970bea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84896a2c7a95d6dd64e63b783f7dbc81</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AD INCENTIVE PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PART OF"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Twitch's monetization strategy, aimed at increasing reliability of ad revenue for streamers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d3ca70453ccd044719c2e1fe9970bea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STREAMER SUPPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Streamer support encompasses all aspects of assistance or programs put in place to help creators monetize their content on Twitch."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d3ca70453ccd044719c2e1fe9970bea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUB POINTS SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"METHOD"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A points-based system for calculating progress toward the Partner Plus program, aimed at giving higher value to more expensive subscriptions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d3ca70453ccd044719c2e1fe9970bea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;350 SUBSCRIPTIONS REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CRITERIA"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Initial requirement set by Twitch for Partner Plus program eligibility, subject to change in response to community feedback."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d3ca70453ccd044719c2e1fe9970bea</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dan is Twitch's CEO, known for engaging with streamers and prioritizing community feedback in company decisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84896a2c7a95d6dd64e63b783f7dbc81</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIMULCASTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Simulcasting is a feature introduced by Twitch, allowing simultaneous streaming on multiple platforms, potentially in response to competitive pressures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Simulcasting is a technological feature introduced by Twitch to allow live streaming on multiple platforms simultaneously."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84896a2c7a95d6dd64e63b783f7dbc81</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STORIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Stories is a feature that Twitch is developing to enhance its product offering for streamers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stories is a product feature under development by Twitch aimed at enhancing engagement and providing additional content options for streamers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84896a2c7a95d6dd64e63b783f7dbc81</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INFLUENCER DEALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT_SERVICE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Influencer Deals is a product service provided by Twitch in partnership with Amazon, enabling streamers to set up promotional content with advertisers easily."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84896a2c7a95d6dd64e63b783f7dbc81</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AFFILIATE MARKETING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ADVERTISING_MODEL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Affiliate Marketing is a model being utilized by Twitch, offering a performance-based approach for brands to advertise on the platform."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84896a2c7a95d6dd64e63b783f7dbc81</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERFORMANCE MODEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ADVERTISING_MODEL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Performance Model refers to a type of advertising where Twitch aims to reach a wider audience and increase brand awareness, as opposed to a purely performance-based model like Partner Plus."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84896a2c7a95d6dd64e63b783f7dbc81</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BRAND AWARENESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ADVERTISING_GOAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Brand Awareness is the objective that Twitch strives to achieve through its Affiliate Marketing services, helping brands to be recognized by a larger audience on the platform."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84896a2c7a95d6dd64e63b783f7dbc81</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BEEPER MINI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Beeper Mini is an app that aggregates iMessage chats for Android users, providing features like high-quality media support and end-to-end encryption."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2956b0576cf864c9ef5bfa266f4f59d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ERIC MIGICOVSKY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eric Migicovsky is a co-founder of Beeper and a former Y Combinator partner, motivated by personal experience and a need for a more natural messaging interface on Android devices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eric Migicovsky is the founder of Beeper Mini, a startup that originally worked on a similar app before pivoting its focus."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2956b0576cf864c9ef5bfa266f4f59d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45faad34713062a2a02694649b4ffb0e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IMESSAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"iMessage is Apple's messaging app, which Beeper's original app sought to effectively integrate with for Android users."&lt;SEP&gt;"iMessage is Apple's messaging service that may play a role in the context of fixing or disabling the issues caused by Beeper."&lt;SEP&gt;"iMessage is the messaging platform that Beeper Mini interfaces with, for users on Apple devices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b8d8e1efae80c91df57099d21d84dee1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2956b0576cf864c9ef5bfa266f4f59d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45faad34713062a2a02694649b4ffb0e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHAOTIC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The chaotic nature of Beeper Mini's operational status refers to the app's sudden shutdown and subsequent restabilization, affecting user experience and access.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2956b0576cf864c9ef5bfa266f4f59d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;3RD PARTY SECURITY FIRM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 3rd party security firm is mentioned as a potential entity that Beeper Mini would share its codebase with to verify its security claims, though this has not yet occurred.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2956b0576cf864c9ef5bfa266f4f59d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;U.S. SENATOR ELIZABETH WARREN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
