  <data key="d2">chunk-2956b0576cf864c9ef5bfa266f4f59d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOS ANGELES, CA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Los Angeles, CA is mentioned in the context of an Apple prompt, although not the actual location of the author, it is related to the geographical context of the app's operations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2956b0576cf864c9ef5bfa266f4f59d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIDELOADING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sideloading is the process of installing apps from sources other than the official app store, which is associated with risks due to lack of security checks, relevant to the distribution of the Beeper Mini app."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2956b0576cf864c9ef5bfa266f4f59d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ERROR MESSAGE&quot;">
