  <data key="d2">chunk-2956b0576cf864c9ef5bfa266f4f59d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLE PROMPT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Apple prompt mentioned in the context is part of Apple's security measures, indicating an attempt to trace the device and account information associated with Beeper Mini."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2956b0576cf864c9ef5bfa266f4f59d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BEEPER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Beeper is a company founded in 2020 known for developing messaging apps that integrate with multiple networks, including RCS and iMessage, with a history tied to the smartwatch industry and notable co-founders with experience in the technology sector."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beeper is a startup company working on a multi-platform messaging aggregator, aiming to provide end-to-end encrypted iMessage chats for Android users by reverse-engineering the iMessage protocol."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beeper is another entity involved, presumably offering messaging services that have been disrupted by Apple's actions or updates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b8d8e1efae80c91df57099d21d84dee1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a70d758e0cc22d57647cf8ff9764d4e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45faad34713062a2a02694649b4ffb0e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCOUNT UPDATE&quot;">
