  <data key="d2">chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BEATS FIT PRO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Beats Fit Pro headphones provide high sound quality and comfort with compatibility for both iOS and Android, with discounted prices observed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beats Fit Pro is a wireless earbud technology targeted for workouts, praised for its sound and physical controls, available at a discounted price.&lt;SEP&gt;"Beats Fit Pro is a subsidiary of Apple, known for their wireless earbuds aimed at a workout-oriented audience with a modern design."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beats Fit Pro is a wireless earbud model designed for fitness tracking and portability, offered at a discounted price during the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beats Fit Pro is recommended for its comfortable fit, great sound, and seamless integration with both iOS and Android, with features such as active noise canceling and decent microphones, functioning well even during intensive workouts and water-resistant up to IPX4, making them suitable earbuds for exercises.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-190c4a227b18304bad84f978960550d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-162798e2eed47b5ad476835cf50000eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2882ef40fb38750a8c979f4a03e4610e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-892fb2cdf4101ac552e42e253b2f298e</data>
</node>
