</node>
<node id="&quot;ECHO BUDS (2023)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Echo Buds (2023) are a semi-open design budget wireless earbud product that's available at a Black Friday discounted price.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEMI-OPEN DESIGN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Semi-open design refers to a structural feature of certain wireless earbud models that allows for more sound leakage and ambient sound but can be preferred for comfort."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EQ TWEAKING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"EQ tweaking is a feature of earbuds that allows users to adjust the sound settings, particularly the bass and treble, to their liking."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PHYSICAL CONTROL BUTTONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Physical control buttons are tactile controls found on some earbuds, as an alternative to touchpads, providing a more traditional and potentially more durable interface."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLASTIC DESIGN&quot;">
