  <data key="d2">chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;USB-C CABLE STREAMING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"USB-C cable streaming is a feature of the Beats Studio Pro earbuds that enables higher-quality audio streaming through a direct cable connection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CALL QUALITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Call Quality refers to the clarity and functionality of the microphone on wireless earbuds, which is important for phone calls."&lt;SEP&gt;"Call quality is a measure of clarity and fidelity of the audio during phone calls, an important consideration for wireless earbuds.&lt;SEP&gt;"Call quality is acceptable but not superior, especially in noisy environments, with the reviewer mentioning the issue of ambient noise being heard during calls."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45301fb5a95549f1651efbffbf70d6ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0448b2524f8271b48012800c85c02004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f78dd9d0d5ae5e7c919bc273b128d725</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANKER SOUNDCORE LIBERTY 4 NC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Anker Soundcore Liberty 4 NC is a larger, stem-design budget wireless earbud with a bass-forward sound, slight touch controls extension, and no wireless charging, at a lowered price."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45301fb5a95549f1651efbffbf70d6ab</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANKER SOUNDCORE SPACE Q45&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Anker Soundcore Space Q45 is a budget noise-canceling over-ear headphone with good ANC, soft padding, multi-device pairing, a V-shaped sound profile, and customizable settings; downsides include mediocre call quality."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45301fb5a95549f1651efbffbf70d6ab</data>
