  <data key="d2">chunk-45301fb5a95549f1651efbffbf70d6ab</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EARFUN FREE 2S&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"EarFun Free 2S is a budget earbud with a hugely bass-forward sound, customizable profile through the EarFun app, waterproof design, touch controls, and a long battery life, but lacks ANC, multi-device connectivity, and suffers from wind noise during calls."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45301fb5a95549f1651efbffbf70d6ab</data>
</node>
