  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Jabra Elite 3 is a budget wireless earbuds option with mild bass-boosted sound, suitable for workouts, lacking some advanced features like ANC and multi-device pairing, priced at $40."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jabra Elite 3 is a product in the budget wireless earbuds guide, with preferable design and capabilities but no specific details given in the text."</data>
