  <data key="d2">chunk-4feba597c2dd25bbb78301549e87548c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISSOLVED OXYGEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dissolved oxygen in the ocean is vital for the survival of deep sea creatures, and its availability is being reduced due to climate change."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dissolved oxygen is a crucial component of seawater that supports deep sea life, which is under threat from the reduced capacity of the ocean to carry oxygen due to warming temperatures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e52655219f2d13e48ea897fac7c72a41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4feba597c2dd25bbb78301549e87548c</data>
