<node id="&quot;CASH BACK RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY/PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cash Back Rate is the percentage earned as cash back on purchases for cardholders, a key feature of the Fifth Third 1.67% Card, which is set at a fixed 1.67% for all purchases."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cash back rate is a feature of some credit cards that provides a percentage of the user's spending back to them as rewards. The 1.67% rate on the Fifth Third 1.67% Cash/Back Card is unique because it is fixed, and uncapped, offering a simple and potentially lucrative rewards structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The flat cash back rate of 1.5% on all purchases is a defining feature of the American Express Cash Magnet® Card's reward structure, representing a technological product offering for cardholders."</data>
