<node id="&quot;JOSEPH HOSTETLER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Joseph Hostetler is the author analyzing the Fifth Third 1.67% Cash/Back Card, providing insights into its rewards system and banking operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Joseph Hostetler is the author of the article about the Fifth Third 1.67% Cash/Back Card, providing information and analysis on the card's features."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d372b955d9ef5d42bcc5d7c927606f6e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIFTH THIRD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fifth Third bank operates branches from Illinois to Florida, which is relevant to the availability of the card in certain regions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fifth Third is a bank that operates primarily in the Midwest, offering the 1.67% Cash/Back Card."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fifth Third is a bank that primarily operates in the Midwest, relevant to the card's availability and operation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d372b955d9ef5d42bcc5d7c927606f6e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIFTH THIRD 1.67% CASH/BACK CARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BUSINESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Fifth Third 1.67% Cash/Back Card is a business product, a credit card, offered by the Fifth Third organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fifth Third 1.67% Cash/Back Card is a financial product designed to offer cash back on purchases, highlighting the bank's role in providing such offerings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d372b955d9ef5d42bcc5d7c927606f6e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;1.67% RETURN RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"1.67% return rate is the fixed cash back earning rate for purchases on the Fifth Third 1.67% Cash/Back Card, which is atypical for credit cards."&lt;SEP&gt;"1.67% return rate is the unique earning rate for cash back on purchases, distinguishing the card in the marketplace."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d372b955d9ef5d42bcc5d7c927606f6e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT CARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A credit card is a general financial instrument issued by banks that allows cardholders to borrow funds at the point of sale for consumer goods or services. Credit cards are widely used for their convenience in transactions and the ability to build credit history when managed responsibly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Credit Card refers to a financial technology tool that allows for transactions, rewards earning, and cash back percentages."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fifth Third 1.67% Card is categorized as a credit card offering various features and incentives."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d372b955d9ef5d42bcc5d7c927606f6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6323f1c3b6acede9c7c36b10402c7dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72a7b9a25301b7267bc40d465b842356</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTRODUCTORY APR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An introductory Annual Percentage Rate (APR) is a promotional interest rate offered to new cardholders for a certain period, in this case, 0% for the first 12 billing cycles after account opening with the Fifth Third 1.67% Cash/Back Card, incentivizing new cardholders to sign up and use the card regularly."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d372b955d9ef5d42bcc5d7c927606f6e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BALANCE TRANSFER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Balance transfer refers to the movement of credit card balances from one credit card to another. The Fifth Third 1.67% Cash/Back Card allows balance transfers but does come with a variable APR (20.74%–29.99%) after the introductory period, and additional fees for transferring balances, which affects the cost of carrying previous debt on the card."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d372b955d9ef5d42bcc5d7c927606f6e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FOREIGN TRANSACTION FEE WAIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Waiving foreign transaction fees is a significant benefit for international cardholders, as it prevents additional charges on purchases made outside the user's local currency zone, making the card more attractive for global travelers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d372b955d9ef5d42bcc5d7c927606f6e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REWARDS POINTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rewards points are a form of currency that cardholders earn on their spending, which can be redeemed for various rewards, including statement credits or direct deposit. The Fifth Third 1.67% Cash/Back Card awards points at a rate of 1 cent per point on purchases, which are then redeemable at 1 cent each for benefits like statement credits or direct deposit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d372b955d9ef5d42bcc5d7c927606f6e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECT DEPOSIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Direct Deposit is a banking service that allows for the electronic transfer of funds from a checking account to a specified account, useful for redeeming points or cash back earned through a credit card."&lt;SEP&gt;"Direct Deposit refers to the option available for cardholders to transfer the cashback amount directly to their bank account."&lt;SEP&gt;"Direct deposit is a feature that allows cardholders to receive their earned points directly deposited into their bank account. This provides cardholders with a practical way to utilize their rewards without incurring interest on their statement credit. The Fifth Third 1.67% Cash/Back Card offers this option for the redemption of earned points."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d372b955d9ef5d42bcc5d7c927606f6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6323f1c3b6acede9c7c36b10402c7dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72a7b9a25301b7267bc40d465b842356</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIFTH THIRD 1.67% CARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fifth Third 1.67% Card is a credit card issued by Fifth Third Bank, offering a fixed cashback rate on purchases."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fifth Third 1.67% Card is a credit card offering from Fifth Third Bank, intended for cash back rewards on purchases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c6323f1c3b6acede9c7c36b10402c7dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72a7b9a25301b7267bc40d465b842356</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUTOMATIC REDEMPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEATURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Automatic Redemptions is a feature that allows for the automatic conversion of reward balance into a user's checking or savings account, ensuring regular rewards capitalization without the need for manual transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c6323f1c3b6acede9c7c36b10402c7dc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CELL PHONE PROTECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BENEFIT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cell Phone Protection is a benefit that covers losses due to theft or damage, up to $800 per claim, subject to a $50 deductible."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c6323f1c3b6acede9c7c36b10402c7dc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MASTERCARD ID THEFT PROTECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mastercard ID Theft Protection is a security feature that monitors for compromised credentials online, protecting customers against identity theft."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c6323f1c3b6acede9c7c36b10402c7dc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CITI DOUBLE CASH CARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Citi Double Cash Card is a credit card offering from Citi Bank, providing 1% cash back on purchases and on payments, but with less cash back opportunities than the Fifth Third 1.67% Card.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c6323f1c3b6acede9c7c36b10402c7dc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CAPITAL ONE QUICKSILVER CASH REWARDS CREDIT CARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Capital One Quicksilver Cash Rewards Credit Card is a credit card offering from Capital One, with a different cash back rate and additional benefits over the Fifth Third 1.67% Card, such as 5% cash back on hotels and rental cars and a $200 signup bonus.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c6323f1c3b6acede9c7c36b10402c7dc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EARN AS YOU SPEND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BENEFIT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Earn as You Spend is a credit card benefit where you earn a percentage of your spending back, in this case, 1.5% as mentioned for other cards, but not the Fifth Third 1.67% Card.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c6323f1c3b6acede9c7c36b10402c7dc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANNUAL FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BENEFIT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Annual Fee refers to a potential annual charge associated with some credit cards. The Fifth Third 1.67% Card does not have an annual fee, making it cost-effective for users who want to avoid this charge.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c6323f1c3b6acede9c7c36b10402c7dc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MONITORING"</data>
  <data key="d1">"APR stands for Annual Percentage Rate, representing the interest rate credit cards may charge on balances, which ranges from 20.74% to 29.99% for the Fifth Third 1.67% Card.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c6323f1c3b6acede9c7c36b10402c7dc</data>
</node>
