<node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF MICHIGAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The University of Michigan is an educational institution conducting research on ultra-processed foods and their potential addictive properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"University of Michigan is an institution conducting a study on the impact of food on addiction-like behaviors, aggregating data from various studies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-89039206f849c78fab340ed6f0292d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f98804617aeaf74ea62cbccd7ea7c75</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASHLEY GEARHARDT&quot;">
