  <data key="d1">"Carrie Andrews is the author of an article discussing the role of technologists in product innovation, advocating for a strategic and conceptual approach to incorporating technology into product design."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1e2f2555285deec6246e71979792ba10</data>
</node>
