  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"State-of-the-art technology refers to the current most advanced and effective technology available, which in this context is utilized for marking AI-generated content to trace its origins and preserve transparency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b86098cf9342b7ec411c2cd37c240ff1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEXT WATERMARKING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TASK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Text watermarking is the specific application of tracing technologies to mark text content, which is currently less developed than video and audio watermarking but is expected to improve over time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b86098cf9342b7ec411c2cd37c240ff1</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VIDEO AND AUDIO WATERMARKING&quot;">
