<node id="&quot;TOTALS BETTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Totals betting refers to the method of predicting the combined score of both teams in a sports game, as part of the betting options alongside point spreads and moneylines."</data>
