</node>
<node id="&quot;OVER/UNDER BET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An over/under bet is a type of wager on whether the combined score of a game will surpass (over) or be less than (under) the predicted total set by bookmakers."&lt;SEP&gt;"An over/under bet is an instance where a bettor wagers on whether the combined score of two teams will exceed or fall below a predetermined total, which is the focal point of the examples provided."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-19883cda57e46d6f9cca9baf7ef40760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa698ab08a1176a1aabe3be226c53e30</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVER/UNDER ODDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Over/under odds are the payouts associated with a totals bet, typically ranging from -105 to -120, reflecting the nearly equal chance of the game exceeding or not exceeding the total score."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fa698ab08a1176a1aabe3be226c53e30</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BETTING ACTIVITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Betting activity can lead to changes in the totals line as bookmakers adjust the line to balance betting action and minimize potential losses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fa698ab08a1176a1aabe3be226c53e30</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OTHER NEWS AND UPDATES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
