  <data key="d1">"Ouija board is a tool that is marketed for communication with the spirit world, but warned against by Fr. Dan Reehil for potentially inviting demonic activity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ouija board is depicted as a tool connected to occult practices and alleged demonic possession, challenging its classification as a mere board game."</data>
