<node id="&quot;GHOST STORIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ghost stories are tales often associated with spiritual communication and entities that might be sought after through tools like Ouija boards, reflecting cultural fascination with the afterlife."</data>
