</node>
<node id="&quot;TRIBECA FILM FESTIVAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Tribeca Film Festival is an annual film festival held in New York City, known for premiering independent and arthouse films, and Plus One was one of the films that received its spotlight here, celebrated for its role in promoting films with a strong personal or filmmaker-driven narrative."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tribeca Film Festival is an event where indie films are showcased, highlighting Plus One's premiere which garnered it recognition despite limited attention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tribeca Film Festival was originally intended to showcase Sputnik but was later released on video-on-demand due to the COVID-19 pandemic."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9553845460fcc6ec562abf9e6ba66ed9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9396236e01c7251380454fbd1e1795d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-508b703dace19f04ad098710b945b2ee</data>
</node>
