  <data key="d2">chunk-453e686c64b434cb21b374eba8554b07</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BURNOUT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONDITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Burnout is a state of emotional, physical, and mental exhaustion caused by excessive and prolonged stress, mentioned as a possible result of chronic stress from constant video platform usage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-453e686c64b434cb21b374eba8554b07</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROFESSIONALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEMOGRAPHIC"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Professionals are implied to be a group of individuals who may be affected by new video technology like Zoom and are not used to constant self-viewing, which can lead to distraction and exhaustion.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-453e686c64b434cb21b374eba8554b07</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUSANA POLO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
