</node>
<node id="&quot;DROPOUT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dropout is a platform transitioning from CollegeHumor, noted for its strategic navigations and reliance on its community of content creators."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dropout is a streaming service that offers shows like Dimension 20 and has its most sustainable period mentioned in the anniversary."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dropout is the comedy series undergoing a name change, previously known as CollegeHumor, and is reflecting on its identity and history in improv performance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a32dc652d7287fa5e46af63d09bdf445&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bb0f99f5eaaa256e3641e666dabe94e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ad267be3c5464727b6b261662501b8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIMENSION 20&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dimension 20 is an event series on Dropout, discussing specific subgenres."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dimension 20 is an improv organization, where Reich shares his appreciation for the creative opportunities given to improvisational comedians in storytelling."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a32dc652d7287fa5e46af63d09bdf445&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0a2b5eb31de6a3c8580a726f14f0416</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COLLEGEHUMOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"CollegeHumor is the comedy company behind Dropout, which is considering a name change."&lt;SEP&gt;"CollegeHumor was a previous brand related to Dropout, now no longer in operation after its anniversary."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a32dc652d7287fa5e46af63d09bdf445&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bb0f99f5eaaa256e3641e666dabe94e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IAC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
