</node>
<node id="&quot;MULLIGAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mulligan is a content creator and co-founder of Dropout, sharing insights about the company's strategy and personal reflections on its journey."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mulligan is a participant in a discussion about an improv-based show and his response to compliments from Wayne Brady, showing humility and excitement about the improv scene in Hollywood."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mulligan is another member of Dropout, reflecting on the brand's history and the impostor syndrome associated with their work in improvisation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e0a2b5eb31de6a3c8580a726f14f0416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bb0f99f5eaaa256e3641e666dabe94e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ad267be3c5464727b6b261662501b8</data>
