<node id="&quot;LUCAS GOELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lucas Goeller is a 10-year-old boy from Pittsburgh with a rare liver disease known as biliary atresia. He has already undergone one liver transplant at the age of 2 and is now facing another transplant due to his failing liver, which is affecting his lung function and cognitive development."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fdf30663644a3269a400a8647a58049</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JESSICA GOELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Jessica Goeller is Lucas's mother, who started a Facebook page that led to a viral campaign for organ donations and helped bring Olivia Swedberg's liver for Lucas's second transplant."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fdf30663644a3269a400a8647a58049</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OLIVIA SWEDBERG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Olivia Swedberg was a 3-year-old girl who donated her liver to Lucas. She passed away from brain cancer, but her donation was life-saving for Lucas."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fdf30663644a3269a400a8647a58049</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UPMC CHILDREN’S HOSPITAL OF PITTSBURGH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"UPMC Children’s Hospital of Pittsburgh is where Lucas received his liver transplant and where Dr. George Mazariegos, a pediatric transplantation expert, is providing medical care."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fdf30663644a3269a400a8647a58049</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DR. GEORGE MAZARIEGOS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dr. George Mazariegos is a chief of pediatric transplantation at UPMC Children’s Hospital of Pittsburgh, overseeing Lucas's care and treatment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fdf30663644a3269a400a8647a58049</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SAVE LUCAS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Save Lucas is a campaign launched by Lucas's family to raise awareness for organ donation, specifically for children in need of transplants."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Save Lucas' campaign is an event/initiative aimed at galvanizing support and increasing awareness for pediatric organ donations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fdf30663644a3269a400a8647a58049</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHILDREN ON TRANSPLANT LISTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Children on transplant lists face challenges in receiving timely and appropriate organ transplants, with a disproportionate number of adults on the transplant list compared to children."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fdf30663644a3269a400a8647a58049</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FACEBOOK PAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Facebook page created by Jessica Goeller was an event/platform that served as a catalyst for organizing the nationwide awareness campaign."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fdf30663644a3269a400a8647a58049</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BILLBOARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Billboards were a specific physical location where the campaign was publicly displayed, supporting the spread of the message."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fdf30663644a3269a400a8647a58049</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOCAL NEWS STORIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Local news stories were part of the media attention that helped disseminate the information about the organ donation campaign."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fdf30663644a3269a400a8647a58049</data>
</node>
