  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The liver transplant list refers to the system in which children wait for a liver transplant, highlighting the scarcity and allocation issues."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1e13a4fbbdc0014a4f475e69c3423866</data>
</node>
