  <data key="d2">chunk-af0301db5f38bf9080adf18f0e753d32</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DATA PROTECTION COMMISSION (DPC)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ireland's DPC is the lead regulator for Meta in the EU for GDPR compliance and is involved in assessing Meta's consent-based model."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af0301db5f38bf9080adf18f0e753d32</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JULY 27&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT/VALUE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"July 27 is the date Meta notified DPC of its intention to implement the alternative, consent-based model."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af0301db5f38bf9080adf18f0e753d32</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TECHCRUNCH NEWSROOM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"TechCrunch Newsroom signifies the place where the reporting and coverage related to Meta's ad-free subscription are based and managed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af0301db5f38bf9080adf18f0e753d32</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FACEBOOK USERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Facebook users are the target demographic for Meta's ad-free subscription service, seeking privacy-focused alternatives to standard ad-supported models."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af0301db5f38bf9080adf18f0e753d32</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SWISS USERS&quot;">
