</node>
<node id="&quot;AD-SUPPORTED MODELS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY, EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ad-supported models refer to the current standard user experience on Meta's platforms, which the ad-free subscription will compete against."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af0301db5f38bf9080adf18f0e753d32</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TARGETED ADVERTISING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY, EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Targeted advertising is the practice Meta currently employs for user profiling, which is the service that the ad-free subscription aims to circumvent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af0301db5f38bf9080adf18f0e753d32</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;USER PROFILING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"User profiling is the process Meta uses to track and target users with ads, which the ad-free subscription seeks to eliminate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af0301db5f38bf9080adf18f0e753d32</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSENT-BASED MODEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consent-based model is the proposed alternative to the current tracking and profiling practices, emphasizing user choice and consent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af0301db5f38bf9080adf18f0e753d32</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL BASES FOR DATA PROCESSING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal bases refer to the justifications Meta previously used for processing user data, which are under review in the context of the new subscription service."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af0301db5f38bf9080adf18f0e753d32</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATORY ASSESSMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
