  <data key="d3">30.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Google is the entity that SEOs work for and are influenced by, creating a power dynamic where Google's priorities can affect the strategies employed by SEOs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Google's relationship with SEOs is marked by a lack of genuine engagement with their feedback and a dismissive attitude towards their attempts to optimize search results, leading to frustration and conflicts within the SEO community.)&lt;SEP&gt;"SEOs are subject to Google's rules and search algorithms, which are influenced by the company's financial goals and advertiser interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"The relationship between Google and SEOs is complex, with Google attempting to assure quality improvements, and SEOs claiming actual advancements in search results accuracy and utility."</data>
