  <data key="d3">85.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Erik ten Hag is the manager advocating for the improvement of Manchester United as a response to Carragher's criticism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erik ten Hag is the manager of Manchester United, establishing his role in the team's strategy and game outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erik ten Hag's leadership of Manchester United is challenged by the team's poor performance in the Champions League."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erik ten Hag's continued leadership at Manchester United is a testament to his success and stability at the club since taking over in December 2019."&lt;SEP&gt;"Manchester United is under the management of Erik ten Hag, who faces potential sacking.")&lt;SEP&gt;"Erik ten Hag's management of Manchester United involves oversight during a club sale and a focus on team commitment and success, amidst external developments like ownership changes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erik ten Hag, as the manager, is likely to maintain his position despite the club's poor start and the impending takeover."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erik ten Hag is the manager of Manchester United, whose team's performance is under evaluation in the Champions League match."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erik ten Hag is the manager of Manchester United, responsible for the team's performance and strategy in the match.")&lt;SEP&gt;"Erik ten Hag's management is under scrutiny due to Manchester United's consecutive losses and the team's lack of clear strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erik ten Hag's coaching is directly linked to Manchester United's performance and the team's defeat, raising questions about his effectiveness."</data>
